values
  ('399008102075910994', 'The Neuron Doctors', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Meng Xiao Bao, Liu Hua, Meng Yao', 'David Chour, Wang Youjun, Chen Haolan, Zhang Zhijian, Xu Yue, Wang Zhiwen, Jiang Shan, Liu Jia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fspImldJTD7fKbVIH0wsbS1l8u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213675'),
  ('486267486719226801', 'The NeverEnding Story', 1995, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Drama', 'Peter Sauder', 'Bruce Robb, Michael Ende, Rolf Giesen', 'Wayne Robson, Chris Wiggins, Colin Fox, Janet-Laine Green, John Stocker, Harvey Atkin, Len Carlson, Don Francks', 'TV-Y7', 'The animated adventures of Bastian Balthazar Bux in the enchanted storybook world of Fantasia.', 'The animated adventures of Bastian Balthazar Bux in the enchanted storybook world of Fantasia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hJwz9QzpntihSMtmTKYcqzkauS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10986'),
  ('921674623646417607', 'The Nevers', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Joss Whedon', null, 'Laura Donnelly, Ann Skelly, Olivia Williams, James Norton, Tom Riley, Pip Torrens, Rochelle Neil, Amy Manson', 'TV-MA', 'In the last years of Victoria''s reign, London is beset by the "Touched": people — mostly women — who suddenly manifest abnormal abilities, some charming, some very disturbing. Among them are Amalia True, a mysterious, quick-fisted widow, and Penance Adair, a brilliant young inventor. They are the champions of this new underclass, making a home for the Touched, while fighting the forces of… well, pretty much all the forces — to make room for those whom history as we know it has no place.', 'In the last years of Victoria''s reign, London is beset by the "Touched": people — mostly women — who suddenly manifest abnormal abilities, some charming, some very disturbing. Among them are Amalia True, a mysterious, quick-fisted widow, and Penance Adair, a brilliant young inventor. They are the champions of this new underclass, making a home for the Touched, while fighting the forces of… well, pretty much all the forces — to make room for those whom history as we know it has no place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6Xmj8Fy7ZruVTz3y2Po7O0TQh4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80828'),
  ('358229517574451589', 'The New 3 Stooges', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norman Maurer, Dick Brown', null, 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita', 'TV-PG', 'Larry, Moe and Curly Joe bring their mastery of mirth, merriment and mayhem to plenty of places from the Old West to Outer Space and everywhere in between. The hijinks never stop as The Boys bumble and fumble their way from one zany adventure to the next in this animated slapstick series.', 'Larry, Moe and Curly Joe bring their mastery of mirth, merriment and mayhem to plenty of places from the Old West to Outer Space and everywhere in between. The hijinks never stop as The Boys bumble and fumble their way from one zany adventure to the next in this animated slapstick series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBzc3rHxecSamUMqG3YUqC9vbIc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13592'),
  ('80858154611622314', 'The New Addams Family', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Glenn Taranto, Ellie Harvie, Nicole Fugere, Brody Smith, Betty Phillips, Michael Roberds, John DeSantis, Steven Fox', 'TV-Y7', 'The spooky-ooky-kooky family lives happily together in their macabre gothic mansion much to the chagrin and confusion of outsiders and neighbors.', 'The spooky-ooky-kooky family lives happily together in their macabre gothic mansion much to the chagrin and confusion of outsiders and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MQt1qtwoTiaEoyYZI0j5hfNi6A.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21036'),
  ('256592627565824163', 'The New Adventures of Batman', 1977, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Adam West, Burt Ward, Melendy Britt, Lou Scheimer, Lennie Weinrib', 'TV-Y7', 'The Dynamic Duo fights crime in Gotham City, encountering the classic Batman rogues gallery as well as some original villains. Complicating matters is Bat-Mite, a well meaning imp from another dimension called Ergo, who considers himself Batman''s biggest fan.', 'The Dynamic Duo fights crime in Gotham City, encountering the classic Batman rogues gallery as well as some original villains. Complicating matters is Bat-Mite, a well meaning imp from another dimension called Ergo, who considers himself Batman''s biggest fan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJgiz3tjanydNIzbn2i4GJmhxx4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10502'),
  ('267716502647093654', 'The New Adventures of He-Man', 1990, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Donald F. Glut', null, 'Garry Chalk, Campbell Lane, Scott McNeil, Ted Cole, Michael Donovan, Mark Hildreth, Venus Terzo, Alvin Sanders', null, 'He-Man, legendary defender of the planet Eternia, has been summoned to the futuristic planet of Primus to defend the planet from the evil Mutants of the neighboring planet of Denebria. But his old adversary Skeletor has followed him and allied himself with the Mutants in his fight to conquer the whole universe. Together with a team of Galactic Guardians, He-Man fights to defend Primus and all its power resources from the continuous attacks by Skeletor and the Mutants.', 'He-Man, legendary defender of the planet Eternia, has been summoned to the futuristic planet of Primus to defend the planet from the evil Mutants of the neighboring planet of Denebria. But his old adversary Skeletor has followed him and allied himself with the Mutants in his fight to conquer the whole universe. Together with a team of Galactic Guardians, He-Man fights to defend Primus and all its power resources from the continuous attacks by Skeletor and the Mutants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIE84ED9Vb29TGbtCQT6sBVefvg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2867'),
  ('1013613097954871956', 'The New Adventures of Jonny Quest', 1986, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', 'Doug Wildey, William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Scott Menville, Don Messick, Rob Paulsen, Granville Van Dusen', null, 'Jonny, his scientist father, bodyguard "Race" Bannon, Indian pal Hadji and comic-relief family bulldog Bandit travel the world, investigate strange cases, and battle a plethora of foes (including old enemy Dr. Zin).', 'Jonny, his scientist father, bodyguard "Race" Bannon, Indian pal Hadji and comic-relief family bulldog Bandit travel the world, investigate strange cases, and battle a plethora of foes (including old enemy Dr. Zin).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrtBKhLEuWbD64yzxSBtugV47la.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14675'),
  ('1128017958174827311', 'The New Adventures of Lucky Luke', 2001, 'Western, Animation, Comedy', 'Olivier Jean-Marie, Morris, René Goscinny', null, 'Antoine de Caunes', 'NR', 'The cowboy who draws a gun faster than his shadow is back! Lucky Luke, the famous wandering cowboy fights crime and injustice, most often in the form of the bumbling Dalton brothers. He rides Jolly Jumper, "the smartest horse in the world" and is often accompanied by Rantanplan, "the stupidest dog in the universe".', 'The cowboy who draws a gun faster than his shadow is back! Lucky Luke, the famous wandering cowboy fights crime and injustice, most often in the form of the bumbling Dalton brothers. He rides Jolly Jumper, "the smartest horse in the world" and is often accompanied by Rantanplan, "the stupidest dog in the universe".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no5MpPRcVVQWh33KDpA2CE7Tvvu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62318'),
  ('919322678624861778', 'The New Adventures of Mighty Mouse and Heckle & Jeckle', 1979, 'Animation', null, null, 'Lou Scheimer, Norm Prescott, Frank Welker, Alan Oppenheimer, Diane Pershing', null, 'The New Adventures of Mighty Mouse and Heckle & Jeckle is an updated version of Mighty Mouse and Heckle & Jeckle cartoons from the 1940s. The television series was produced by Filmation, and aired from 1979 to 1981 on CBS with over 48 episodes produced. It is not to be confused with Mighty Mouse: The New Adventures.', 'The New Adventures of Mighty Mouse and Heckle & Jeckle is an updated version of Mighty Mouse and Heckle & Jeckle cartoons from the 1940s. The television series was produced by Filmation, and aired from 1979 to 1981 on CBS with over 48 episodes produced. It is not to be confused with Mighty Mouse: The New Adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9NCnip4czTHNjc6e7iVHeeaGiC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10009'),
  ('133998415331552071', 'The New Adventures of Old Christine', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Kari Lizer', null, 'Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Clark Gregg, Hamish Linklater, Trevor Gagnon, Emily Rutherfurd, Tricia O''Kelley, Alex Kapp Horner, Wanda Sykes', 'TV-PG', 'Single working mom Christine Campbell has just learned that her ex is dating a much younger woman with the same first name. To avoid any confusion, the new girlfriend is dubbed New Christine, which leaves her with the unfortunate nickname Old Christine.', 'Single working mom Christine Campbell has just learned that her ex is dating a much younger woman with the same first name. To avoid any confusion, the new girlfriend is dubbed New Christine, which leaves her with the unfortunate nickname Old Christine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1u9EGyEQEVFjl5VxK7NbRCxdZ1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4402'),
  ('775517735676634194', 'The New Adventures of Peter Pan', 2013, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Clélia Constantine', null, 'Matt Hill', null, 'Featuring first-in-class animation, comedy and adventure, The New Adventures of Peter Pan transports Peter Pan, Wendy, John, Michael and the Lost Boys and Girls to wondrous places that often turn out to be far more dangerous than anyone would have ever expected! In order to keep Neverland safe from Captain Hook, Peter and his friends fly head on into adventure to protect their right to never grow up.', 'Featuring first-in-class animation, comedy and adventure, The New Adventures of Peter Pan transports Peter Pan, Wendy, John, Michael and the Lost Boys and Girls to wondrous places that often turn out to be far more dangerous than anyone would have ever expected! In order to keep Neverland safe from Captain Hook, Peter and his friends fly head on into adventure to protect their right to never grow up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1ZhgwAHX2OqdG3XyF7GryKKTUp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53113'),
  ('532543601092959713', 'The New Adventures of Robin Hood', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Sandra Weintraub', null, 'John Bradley, Barbara Griffin, Richard Ashton, Martyn Ellis', 'TV-PG', 'Sherwood Forest outlaw Robin Hood and his partners -- Marion Fitzwalter, Little John and Friar Tuck -- use magic, sorcery and courage to fight royal soldiers, evil knights and others who try to oppress the impoverished people of 12th-century England.', 'Sherwood Forest outlaw Robin Hood and his partners -- Marion Fitzwalter, Little John and Friar Tuck -- use magic, sorcery and courage to fight royal soldiers, evil knights and others who try to oppress the impoverished people of 12th-century England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t26XFa4fjm2T3By8ZO5Arlo8zt3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5315'),
  ('1031989634952807015', 'The New Adventures of Superman', 1966, 'Animation', 'Lou Scheimer', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jack Grimes, Janet Waldo, Ted Knight, Bob Hastings, Jackson Beck', 'NR', 'The New Adventures of Superman is a series of six-minute animated Superman adventures produced by Filmation that were broadcast on CBS between 1966 and 1970. The 68 segments appeared as part of three different programs during that time, packaged with similar shorts featuring The Adventures of Superboy and other DC Comics superheroes.', 'The New Adventures of Superman is a series of six-minute animated Superman adventures produced by Filmation that were broadcast on CBS between 1966 and 1970. The 68 segments appeared as part of three different programs during that time, packaged with similar shorts featuring The Adventures of Superboy and other DC Comics superheroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jxLSh66PFrUPajJk5aaP7DhlMR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10786'),
  ('813210728042023847', 'The New Adventures of Winnie the Pooh', 1988, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'John Fiedler, Jim Cummings, Ken Sansom, Peter Cullen, Hal Smith, Patricia Parris, Michael Gough, Nicholas Melody', 'TV-Y', 'An American animated children''s television series inspired by A. A. Milne''s Winnie-the-Pooh stories.', 'An American animated children''s television series inspired by A. A. Milne''s Winnie-the-Pooh stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJFbF43bN1HX5EZl4OFAVmJDl1u.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2005'),
  ('515513702609119460', 'The New Adventures of Zorro', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Michael Gough, Pat Fraley, Earl Boen, Jeannie Elias, Tony Pope', null, 'Zorro was the third animated television series to feature the adventures of Zorro in 19th century Spanish California.', 'Zorro was the third animated television series to feature the adventures of Zorro in 19th century Spanish California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlvNNxM6T72YIjig4Hrm6kosS65.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15841'),
  ('1036554946488711821', 'The New Alfred Hitchcock Presents', 1985, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Alfred Hitchcock', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'TV-PG', 'The New Alfred Hitchcock Presents is an American anthology series that aired on NBC from 1985 to 1986, and on the USA Network from 1987 to 1989. The series is an updated re-imagining of the classic 1955 series Alfred Hitchcock Presents.', 'The New Alfred Hitchcock Presents is an American anthology series that aired on NBC from 1985 to 1986, and on the USA Network from 1987 to 1989. The series is an updated re-imagining of the classic 1955 series Alfred Hitchcock Presents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndCyWSRuAMHNEjtTrEsDue7D1Uq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2751'),
  ('1017605446541668284', 'The New Avengers', 1976, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Brian Clemens', null, 'Patrick Macnee, Gareth Hunt, Joanna Lumley', null, 'The New Avengers is a British secret agent fantasy adventure television series broadcast during 1976 and 1977. It is a sequel to the 1960s series The Avengers and was developed by Albert Fennell and Brian Clemens. A joint United Kingdom-France-Canada production, the show picks up the adventures of John Steed and his team of Avengers fighting evil plots and world domination. Whereas in the original series Steed had almost always been partnered with a woman, in the new series he had two partners: Mike Gambit, a top agent, crack marksman and trained martial artist, and Purdey, a former trainee with The Royal Ballet who was an amalgam of many of the best talents from Steed''s previous female partners.', 'The New Avengers is a British secret agent fantasy adventure television series broadcast during 1976 and 1977. It is a sequel to the 1960s series The Avengers and was developed by Albert Fennell and Brian Clemens. A joint United Kingdom-France-Canada production, the show picks up the adventures of John Steed and his team of Avengers fighting evil plots and world domination. Whereas in the original series Steed had almost always been partnered with a woman, in the new series he had two partners: Mike Gambit, a top agent, crack marksman and trained martial artist, and Purdey, a former trainee with The Royal Ballet who was an amalgam of many of the best talents from Steed''s previous female partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD0hQpJfPFvAyZnKdiDrcn242W9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10360'),
  ('519466150863604708', 'The New Batman Adventures', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Kevin Conroy', 'TV-PG', 'After a long hiatus -- The Caped Crusader is back and cooler then ever, in the animated action-packed series -- The New Batman-Superman Adventures. Picking up years after Batman: The Animated Series, the series highlights Batman and his crimefighting cadre of Nightwing, Robin and Batgirl, as they join forces to battle Gotham City''s classic super-villains.', 'After a long hiatus -- The Caped Crusader is back and cooler then ever, in the animated action-packed series -- The New Batman-Superman Adventures. Picking up years after Batman: The Animated Series, the series highlights Batman and his crimefighting cadre of Nightwing, Robin and Batgirl, as they join forces to battle Gotham City''s classic super-villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s40Ji11SBKaEYDgJmDc0ifklM59.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4625'),
  ('179593463368452993', 'The New Edition Story', 2017, 'Drama, Documentary', null, 'Abdul Williams', 'Woody McClain, Algee Smith, Elijah Kelley, Bryshere Y. Gray, Keith Powers, Wood Harris, Luke James, Jahi Di''Allo Winston', 'TV-14', 'Follow the story of R&amp;B pioneers Michael Bivins, Ricky Bell, Ronnie Devoe, Bobby Brown, Ralph Tresvant and Johnny Gill as they navigate fame from their native Boston to Hollywood and beyond.', 'Follow the story of R&amp;B pioneers Michael Bivins, Ricky Bell, Ronnie Devoe, Bobby Brown, Ralph Tresvant and Johnny Gill as they navigate fame from their native Boston to Hollywood and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFgTXYL16rRcrAuHS74zWIalhXf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69760'),
  ('989652352285032031', 'The New Employee', 2022, 'Drama', 'Moscareto', 'Moscareto', 'Kwon Hyuk, Moon Ji-yong, Choi Si-hun, Nam Kyu-hee, Baek Ji-hye', null, 'A late-blooming virgin lands his dream internship where he meets his handsome, but distant boss. Can they resist temptation while working together?', 'A late-blooming virgin lands his dream internship where he meets his handsome, but distant boss. Can they resist temptation while working together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1idOoD1Eb80X2JiJhjwV4OhhYTX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209482'),
  ('943487176954772891', 'The New Force', 2025, 'Drama', 'Patrik Ehrnst, Antonia Pyk, Elin Randin', null, 'Josefin Asplund, Agnes Westerlund Rase, Malin Persson, Christopher Wagelin, Rasmus Luthander, Cilla Thorell, Hannes Fohlin, Jimmy Lindström', null, 'An understaffed police district in 1950s Sweden launches a bold experiment to introduce its first group of female officers.', 'An understaffed police district in 1950s Sweden launches a bold experiment to introduce its first group of female officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slACzBGkUWKHbU8bEwcR2Uvo1Ir.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271128'),
  ('922632369353423865', 'THE NEW GATE', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Asami Seto, Kaede Hondo, Miho Okasaki, Shunya Hiruma, Akiho Suzumoto, Kaori Ishihara, Lynn', 'TV-14', 'When an online game turns real, trapping its players in its virtual space, the strongest of them, Shin, rises up to put a stop to the madness. But just moments after defeating the game''s final boss, Origin, and freeing everyone, Shin is transported 500 years into the future of the in-game world. Armed with unrivaled strength, the young swordsman embarks on a legendary journey.', 'When an online game turns real, trapping its players in its virtual space, the strongest of them, Shin, rises up to put a stop to the madness. But just moments after defeating the game''s final boss, Origin, and freeing everyone, Shin is transported 500 years into the future of the in-game world. Armed with unrivaled strength, the young swordsman embarks on a legendary journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neTGdBl851se6Vk9xGVIZ7N2jzJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239161'),
  ('226327472567523392', 'The New Legends of Monkey', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Irvin, Gerard Johnstone', null, 'Chai Hansen, Luciane Buchanan, Josh Thomson, Emilie Cocquerel, Natasha Daniel', 'TV-PG', 'Follow a teenage girl and a trio of fallen gods on a perilous journey as they attempt to bring an end to a demonic reign of chaos and restore balance to their world. Inspired by the 16th Century Chinese fable “Journey to the West.”', 'Follow a teenage girl and a trio of fallen gods on a perilous journey as they attempt to bring an end to a demonic reign of chaos and restore balance to their world. Inspired by the 16th Century Chinese fable “Journey to the West.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwu04xIT0kNV9ZpVZ6wNBGPr0eG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71577'),
  ('361426708847904897', 'The New Look', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Todd A. Kessler', 'Matthew Fantaci', 'Ben Mendelsohn, Juliette Binoche, Maisie Williams, John Malkovich, Emily Mortimer, Claes Bang', 'TV-MA', 'The shocking story of how fashion icon Christian Dior and his contemporaries including Coco Chanel, Pierre Balmain, and Cristóbal Balenciaga navigated the horrors of World War Il and launched modern fashion.', 'The shocking story of how fashion icon Christian Dior and his contemporaries including Coco Chanel, Pierre Balmain, and Cristóbal Balenciaga navigated the horrors of World War Il and launched modern fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQBpF8VmEIgow41OL9h4nU4WN6v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157368'),
  ('53765440775357516', 'The New Normal', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Murphy, Ali Adler', null, 'Justin Bartha, Andrew Rannells, Georgia King, Bebe Wood, NeNe Leakes, Jayson Blair, Ellen Barkin', 'TV-14', 'Los Angeles couple Bryan and David have successful careers and a loving relationship and are ready for a baby. Just as they start to worry that they will never be blessed with parenthood, they meet Goldie, a waitress who has just moved to California with her precocious eight-year-old daughter to escape from her closed-minded grandmother and a life without a future. The guys quickly work out a deal with Goldie to become their surrogate, and in the process, the little group forms a unique family unit of its own.', 'Los Angeles couple Bryan and David have successful careers and a loving relationship and are ready for a baby. Just as they start to worry that they will never be blessed with parenthood, they meet Goldie, a waitress who has just moved to California with her precocious eight-year-old daughter to escape from her closed-minded grandmother and a life without a future. The guys quickly work out a deal with Goldie to become their surrogate, and in the process, the little group forms a unique family unit of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpV9QN5hGaG3L3DZ4h6YAxnLkCs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44005'),
  ('767386931747575747', 'The New Nurses', 2018, 'Drama', 'Claudia Boderke, Lars Mering', 'Lars Mering, Claudia Boderke', 'Molly Egelind, Jens Jørn Spottag, Katrine Greis-Rosenthal, Benedikte Hansen, Mikkel Hilgart, Jesper Groth, Thue Ersted Rasmussen, Ulla Vejby', null, 'The lives of Erik and Anna, students at a nursing school in 1950s Denmark, a time and place where it was not normal for a man to become a nurse.', 'The lives of Erik and Anna, students at a nursing school in 1950s Denmark, a time and place where it was not normal for a man to become a nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbFkjvJLaRBk3EgdwMAsVfa6MkJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:83524'),
  ('723659611005653059', 'The New Pope', 2020, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino', null, 'Jude Law, John Malkovich, Silvio Orlando, Cécile de France, Javier Cámara, Ludivine Sagnier, Maurizio Lombardi, Henry Goodman', 'TV-MA', 'As Pope Pius XIII hangs between life and death in a coma, charming and sophisticated moderate English aristocrat Sir John Brannox is placed on the papal throne and adopts the name John Paul III. A sequel series to “The Young Pope.”', 'As Pope Pius XIII hangs between life and death in a coma, charming and sophisticated moderate English aristocrat Sir John Brannox is placed on the papal throne and adopts the name John Paul III. A sequel series to “The Young Pope.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqIcuN2ORtCkCrGErghTp5Rrhec.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88408'),
  ('477827750229231805', 'The New Scooby and Scrappy-Doo Show', 1983, 'Animation, Mystery, Family, Comedy, Kids', 'Ken Spears, Joe Ruby, Tom Ruegger', null, 'Casey Kasem, Heather North, Don Messick', 'TV-G', 'The New Scooby and Scrappy Doo Show is the sixth incarnation of the Hanna-Barbera Saturday morning cartoon Scooby-Doo. It premiered on September 10, 1983, and ran for one season on ABC as a half-hour program made up of two eleven-minute short cartoons. The show is a return to the mystery solving format and reintroduces Daphne after a four-year absence. The plots of each episode feature her, Shaggy, Scooby-Doo, and Scrappy-Doo solving supernatural mysteries under the cover of being reporters for a teen magazine.', 'The New Scooby and Scrappy Doo Show is the sixth incarnation of the Hanna-Barbera Saturday morning cartoon Scooby-Doo. It premiered on September 10, 1983, and ran for one season on ABC as a half-hour program made up of two eleven-minute short cartoons. The show is a return to the mystery solving format and reintroduces Daphne after a four-year absence. The plots of each episode feature her, Shaggy, Scooby-Doo, and Scrappy-Doo solving supernatural mysteries under the cover of being reporters for a teen magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKZL0OVHfKxuCPnhhCQl7nVkPRf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230'),
  ('215992877067480300', 'The New Scooby-Doo Movies', 1972, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Frank Welker, Nicole Jaffe, Heather North', 'TV-G', 'Aside from doubling the length of each episode, The New Scooby-Doo Movies differed from its predecessor in the addition of a rotating special guest star slot; each episode featured real-life celebrities or well known fictional characters joining the Mystery, Inc. gang in solving the mystery of the week. Some episodes, in particular the episodes guest-starring the characters from The Addams Family, Batman, and Jeannie, deviated from the established Scooby-Doo format of presenting criminals masquerading as supernatural beings by introducing real ghosts, witches, monsters, and other such characters into the plots.', 'Aside from doubling the length of each episode, The New Scooby-Doo Movies differed from its predecessor in the addition of a rotating special guest star slot; each episode featured real-life celebrities or well known fictional characters joining the Mystery, Inc. gang in solving the mystery of the week. Some episodes, in particular the episodes guest-starring the characters from The Addams Family, Batman, and Jeannie, deviated from the established Scooby-Doo format of presenting criminals masquerading as supernatural beings by introducing real ghosts, witches, monsters, and other such characters into the plots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slBx9Vkh0ET9m2lgrD8KxJDL5T9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1068'),
  ('684672307241339510', 'The New Scooby-Doo Mysteries', 1984, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Kids, Mystery', 'Tom Ruegger, Joe Ruby, Ken Spears', null, 'Casey Kasem, Heather North, Don Messick, Frank Welker, Marla Frumkin', 'TV-G', 'Picking up where ''The New Scooby and Scappy Doo Show'' left off. The main difference being that the team is now occasionally joined by Daphne Blake and friends to solve mysteries together.', 'Picking up where ''The New Scooby and Scappy Doo Show'' left off. The main difference being that the team is now occasionally joined by Daphne Blake and friends to solve mysteries together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6npEBuY3BUjHsBJx9RMp4qNejGo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64016'),
  ('229241744333347673', 'The New Statesman', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Laurence Marks, Maurice Gran', null, 'Rik Mayall, Michael Troughton', null, 'The New Statesman is a British sitcom of the late 1980s and early 1990s satirising the Conservative government of the time.', 'The New Statesman is a British sitcom of the late 1980s and early 1990s satirising the Conservative government of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHFmn2FDQE4hlKCbnYE9dVBSiQC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:6056'),
  ('112347533397105704', 'The New Tom Green Show', 2003, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Tom Green', null, 'The Tom Green Show is a North American television show, created by and starring Canadian comedian Tom Green, that first aired in September 1994. The series aired on Rogers Television 22, a community channel in Ottawa, Ontario, until 1996, when it was picked up by The Comedy Network. The second season began airing on December 4, 1998. (In 1996, Tom Green also produced a pilot episode for CBC Television, although the CBC did not pick up the series.) In January 1999, the show moved to the United States and aired on MTV. The series stopped production in March 2000, due to Green''s diagnosis of testicular cancer, but continued to appear on the channel via reruns and other promotional materials. In 2002, it was ranked #41 on TV Guide''s 50 Worst TV Shows of All Time. In 2003, the show was revived as The New Tom Green Show. In 2006, Green launched Tom Green Live, a live call-in show for his website, which was later renamed Tom Green''s House Tonight.', 'The Tom Green Show is a North American television show, created by and starring Canadian comedian Tom Green, that first aired in September 1994. The series aired on Rogers Television 22, a community channel in Ottawa, Ontario, until 1996, when it was picked up by The Comedy Network. The second season began airing on December 4, 1998. (In 1996, Tom Green also produced a pilot episode for CBC Television, although the CBC did not pick up the series.) In January 1999, the show moved to the United States and aired on MTV. The series stopped production in March 2000, due to Green''s diagnosis of testicular cancer, but continued to appear on the channel via reruns and other promotional materials. In 2002, it was ranked #41 on TV Guide''s 50 Worst TV Shows of All Time. In 2003, the show was revived as The New Tom Green Show. In 2006, Green launched Tom Green Live, a live call-in show for his website, which was later renamed Tom Green''s House Tonight.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:22271'),
  ('225341071443241588', 'The New Woody Woodpecker Show', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Bob Jaques, Alan Zaslove', null, 'Billy West, Mark Hamill, Andrea Martin, B.J. Ward', 'TV-Y', 'The funny bird drives people crazy with his antics.', 'The funny bird drives people crazy with his antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oizXc3SnlSWDqPMmfe4koUj4RRo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9980'),
  ('490397052871585125', 'The New Years', 2024, 'Drama', 'Paula Fabra, Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Sara Cano', null, 'Iria del Río, Francesco Carril', null, 'Óscar turns thirty on New Year''s Eve with his life almost solved. Ana turns thirty on New Year''s Day with her life still unresolved. They meet, fall in love, and begin a relationship that will last ten years.', 'Óscar turns thirty on New Year''s Eve with his life almost solved. Ana turns thirty on New Year''s Day with her life still unresolved. They meet, fall in love, and begin a relationship that will last ten years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lz5IGvz4JCY7uFataoUaehU8QK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238106'),
  ('558185522544010348', 'The New Yogi Bear Show', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Don Messick, Peter Cullen, Julie Bennett, Gregg Berger, Daws Butler', 'TV-G', 'The New Yogi Bear Show is a 30-minute weekday animated series which aired on syndication in 1988 as part of The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera''s 4th season. But it was the also the fifth incarnation of Hanna-Barbera''s Yogi Bear. It contained 45 new episodes combined with reruns of the original 1960s Yogi series. Pared down from some of the other, recent incarnations of the adventures of Yogi and friends, this series featured only Yogi, Boo-Boo, Cindy and Ranger Smith, with episodes set in Jellystone Park. The show also introduced four new characters: Ranger Roubideux, Ninja Raccoon, Ninja Raccoon''s mom, and Blubber Bear from Wacky Races.', 'The New Yogi Bear Show is a 30-minute weekday animated series which aired on syndication in 1988 as part of The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera''s 4th season. But it was the also the fifth incarnation of Hanna-Barbera''s Yogi Bear. It contained 45 new episodes combined with reruns of the original 1960s Yogi series. Pared down from some of the other, recent incarnations of the adventures of Yogi and friends, this series featured only Yogi, Boo-Boo, Cindy and Ranger Smith, with episodes set in Jellystone Park. The show also introduced four new characters: Ranger Roubideux, Ninja Raccoon, Ninja Raccoon''s mom, and Blubber Bear from Wacky Races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWR0x3N7pt7f5g0YAxQgQuUVhKd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12454'),
  ('281417230804491856', 'The New York Times Presents', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A series of standalone documentaries powered by the unparalleled journalism and insight of The New York Times, bringing viewers close to the essential stories of our time.', 'A series of standalone documentaries powered by the unparalleled journalism and insight of The New York Times, bringing viewers close to the essential stories of our time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNLd1pJZiDMWtuy09Agy1Aggurz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105763'),
  ('995483211676180988', 'The News Puppets', 1988, 'News, Comedy, Talk, Reality', 'Alain Duverne, Alain de Greef', null, 'Yves Lecoq, Daniel Herzog, Cyril Valade, Boris Scheigam', null, 'A parody of a newscast, the show is a caricature of the political world, the media, personalities or more generally of French society and the current world.', 'A parody of a newscast, the show is a caricature of the political world, the media, personalities or more generally of French society and the current world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u7oDri9TvJXffoe6cyD2EDkQi2.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:88033'),
  ('837244209514889955', 'The Newsreader', 2021, 'Drama', 'Michael Lucas', null, 'Anna Torv, Sam Reid, William McInnes, Michelle Lim Davidson, Marg Downey, Chum Ehelepola, Stephen Peacocke, Philippa Northeast', 'TV-MA', 'An unconventional relationship in a world on the cusp of change; a star newsreader and an ambitious bisexual reporter join forces in a ruthless 1986 newsroom, as events unfold that will change their lives.', 'An unconventional relationship in a world on the cusp of change; a star newsreader and an ambitious bisexual reporter join forces in a ruthless 1986 newsroom, as events unfold that will change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHl6HgHcFLfe68E7uiq8NRDCXOv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130842'),
  ('27913959200784768', 'The Newsroom', 2012, 'Drama', 'Aaron Sorkin', null, 'Jeff Daniels, Emily Mortimer, John Gallagher Jr., Alison Pill, Thomas Sadoski, Dev Patel, Olivia Munn, Sam Waterston', 'TV-MA', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the people who make a nightly cable-news program. Focusing on a network anchor, his new executive producer, the newsroom staff and their boss, the series tracks their quixotic mission to do the news well in the face of corporate and commercial obstacles-not to mention their own personal entanglements.', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the people who make a nightly cable-news program. Focusing on a network anchor, his new executive producer, the newsroom staff and their boss, the series tracks their quixotic mission to do the news well in the face of corporate and commercial obstacles-not to mention their own personal entanglements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOC3DmU47X98Sv5vaPnmgjG30eY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15621'),
  ('498578369727576997', 'The Next Prince', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'CEO', null, 'Chawarin Perdpiriyawong, Pruk Panich, Thanakrit Chiamchunya, Karn Kritsanaphan, Siraphop Manithikhun, Radchapon Phornpinit, Tanawat Cheawaram, Charintip Rungthanakiat', null, 'When a reluctant heir is called to compete in a tournament to decide the next king, the royal guard sent to escort him soon becomes his forbidden desire.', 'When a reluctant heir is called to compete in a tournament to decide the next king, the royal guard sent to escort him soon becomes his forbidden desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1eBmHCpaOfUqTeiXr2d344WA6x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217810'),
  ('272948213266137836', 'The Next Station is Marriage', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yu Hewei, Liu Tao, Zhao Liang, Shao Wen, Xu Songzi, Song Ning, Gao Ming, Wang Yifei', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8laqTRmxX5ItTjoZJvYP0s8dgA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93224'),
  ('634269264568823065', 'The Next Step', 2013, 'Family, Drama', 'Frank Van Keeken', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Follow the lives of an elite group of young dancers who train at The Next Step Studio.', 'Follow the lives of an elite group of young dancers who train at The Next Step Studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28EGWObkmkbBFLCu9ksJCQmmsqI.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62404'),
  ('383942188583765715', 'The Nice Guy', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Kim Woon-kyeong, Hyo-seok Kim', null, 'Lee Dong-wook, Lee Sung-kyung, Ryu Hye-young, Oh Na-ra, Park Hoon, Cheon Ho-jin, Park Myung-shin, Park Won-sang', 'TV-14', 'Seok-cheol, the eldest son in a family of three generations of gangsters, navigates the tumultuous ups and downs of life with tears and laughter, all to protect his family, career, and love.', 'Seok-cheol, the eldest son in a family of three generations of gangsters, navigates the tumultuous ups and downs of life with tears and laughter, all to protect his family, career, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVOKlZ6Ix5OfXHsyuaQp4nEDE6n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211224'),
  ('593752147944051239', 'The Night Agent', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Shawn Ryan', null, 'Gabriel Basso, Fola Evans-Akingbola, Louis Herthum, Genesis Rodriguez, Albert Jones, Ward Horton, David Lyons, Jennifer Morrison', 'TV-MA', 'Brought together by a midnight phone call, an FBI agent and a cybersecurity expert must unravel an ever-growing web of political conspiracies.', 'Brought together by a midnight phone call, an FBI agent and a cybersecurity expert must unravel an ever-growing web of political conspiracies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c5yUNcaff4W4aPrkXE6zr7papX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:129552'),
  ('295610122630726384', 'The Night Beyond the Tricornered Window', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Wataru Hatano, Soma Saito, Chika Anzai, Satoshi Mikami, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'Shy bookstore clerk Kosuke Mikado has the ability to see ghosts and spirits, an ability he wishes he didn''t have, since what he sees usually terrifies him. Rihito Hiyakawa, an exorcist whose supernatural powers are as strong as his social graces are weak, doesn''t seem to fear anything, mortal or otherwise. When this odd couple gets together to solve the bizarre cases that come their way, their work methods may not be entirely safe for work!', 'Shy bookstore clerk Kosuke Mikado has the ability to see ghosts and spirits, an ability he wishes he didn''t have, since what he sees usually terrifies him. Rihito Hiyakawa, an exorcist whose supernatural powers are as strong as his social graces are weak, doesn''t seem to fear anything, mortal or otherwise. When this odd couple gets together to solve the bizarre cases that come their way, their work methods may not be entirely safe for work!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quwMdtlHcqNATTuofOq8Cvd6Pbf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114307'),
  ('978151294983616692', 'The Night Logan Woke Up', 2022, 'Drama', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Julie Le Breton, Patrick Hivon, Éric Bruneau, Xavier Dolan, Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Anne Dorval, Julianne Côté, Jasmine Lemée', 'TV-MA', 'On a cold October night in 1991, an unspeakable event rocks a small town in Quebec, forever haunting a family who tries to hide their dark secret. Thirty years later these secrets buried deep in the past resurface, sending the family on an unstoppable pursuit of reconciliation.', 'On a cold October night in 1991, an unspeakable event rocks a small town in Quebec, forever haunting a family who tries to hide their dark secret. Thirty years later these secrets buried deep in the past resurface, sending the family on an unstoppable pursuit of reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keDSGCKHobKCBEmZxuo6UY3yrf6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113732'),
  ('776000003779801011', 'The Night Manager', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'David Farr', null, 'Tom Hiddleston, Hugh Laurie, Diego Calva, Camila Morrone, Paul Chahidi, Hayley Squires, Indira Varma, Unax Ugalde', 'TV-MA', 'Former British soldier Jonathan Pine navigates the shadowy recesses of Whitehall and Washington where an unholy alliance operates between the intelligence community and the secret arms trade. To infiltrate the inner circle of lethal arms dealer Richard Onslow Roper, Pine must himself become a criminal.', 'Former British soldier Jonathan Pine navigates the shadowy recesses of Whitehall and Washington where an unholy alliance operates between the intelligence community and the secret arms trade. To infiltrate the inner circle of lethal arms dealer Richard Onslow Roper, Pine must himself become a criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MccRnw41qQjREuZkovqP2UX1i3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61859'),
  ('843931676693197878', 'The Night Manager', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sandeep Modi', null, 'Anil Kapoor, Aditya Roy Kapur, Sobhita Dhulipala, Tillotama Shome, Saswata Chatterjee, Ravi Behl, Anand Vikas Potdukhe, Joy Sengupta', 'TV-MA', 'A hotel''s night manager is the only weapon against a dangerous arms dealer. Will he be able to stop him?', 'A hotel''s night manager is the only weapon against a dangerous arms dealer. Will he be able to stop him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1anVoLwguecmFqsNx0Ic8cIzmuW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218953'),
  ('209432387911923884', 'The Night Of', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Richard Price, Steven Zaillian', null, 'Riz Ahmed, John Turturro, Bill Camp, Payman Maadi, Jeannie Berlin, Poorna Jagannathan', 'TV-MA', 'After a night of partying with a female stranger, a man wakes up to find her stabbed to death and is charged with her murder.', 'After a night of partying with a female stranger, a man wakes up to find her stabbed to death and is charged with her murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q13XJHdnsmxQL9rXRcnNDrZGHjO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66276'),
  ('765917114025047644', 'The Night Shift', 2014, 'Drama', 'Gabe Sachs, Jeff Judah', null, 'Eoin Macken, Jill Flint, Brendan Fehr, Robert Bailey Jr., James Roch, Scott Wolf, Tanaya Beatty', 'TV-14', 'The stories of the men and women who work the overnight shift at San Antonio Memorial Hospital. They are an irreverent and special breed, particularly adrenaline junkie T.C. Callahan.', 'The stories of the men and women who work the overnight shift at San Antonio Memorial Hospital. They are an irreverent and special breed, particularly adrenaline junkie T.C. Callahan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSfjudewdGEHAva8LvlbyH0ydof.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60804'),
  ('77032515072640397', 'The Night Watchman', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Yoo Dong-yoon, Kim Sun-hee, Bang Ji-young', 'Jung Il-woo, Ko Sung-hee, U-KNOW Yunho, Seo Yea-ji, Kim Seung-o, Seo Yi-sook, Lee Chae-mi, Ko Chang-seok', null, 'Being able to see ghosts and other supernatural spirits is a heavy responsibility. Prince Lee Rin (Jung Il Woo), like his father before him, discovers that he has the ability to see ghosts and other supernatural beings. Armed with his newfound abilities, Lee Rin becomes the leader of a group of night watchmen who patrol the streets from dusk to dawn to protect the people of the Chosun Dynasty against evil spirits. Moo Seok (Jung Yun Ho) is the best swordsman in the land who is the prince’s trusty bodyguard. But their loyalties will be tested when they both fall in love with the same woman – Do Ha (Go Sung Hee), the successor of the Ma Go tribe who seeks their help to protect the Baek Do mountain’s spirits. But Park Soo Ryun (Seo Ye Ji), the daughter of a court officer, will stop at nothing to marry Prince Lee Rin. “The Night Watchman,” also known as "Diary of a Night Watchman,"', 'Being able to see ghosts and other supernatural spirits is a heavy responsibility. Prince Lee Rin (Jung Il Woo), like his father before him, discovers that he has the ability to see ghosts and other supernatural beings. Armed with his newfound abilities, Lee Rin becomes the leader of a group of night watchmen who patrol the streets from dusk to dawn to protect the people of the Chosun Dynasty against evil spirits. Moo Seok (Jung Yun Ho) is the best swordsman in the land who is the prince’s trusty bodyguard. But their loyalties will be tested when they both fall in love with the same woman – Do Ha (Go Sung Hee), the successor of the Ma Go tribe who seeks their help to protect the Baek Do mountain’s spirits. But Park Soo Ryun (Seo Ye Ji), the daughter of a court officer, will stop at nothing to marry Prince Lee Rin. “The Night Watchman,” also known as "Diary of a Night Watchman,"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naAWrujd8S0hmYEapO10KbZpyG7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61209'),
  ('246842150505641478', 'The Nightly Show with Larry Wilmore', 2015, 'Talk, Comedy, News', 'Jon Stewart', 'Cord Jefferson', 'Larry Wilmore', null, 'The Nightly Show provides viewers with Larry Wilmore''s distinct point of view and comedic take on current events and pop culture. Hosted by Wilmore, the series features a diverse panel of voices, providing a perspective largely missing in the late night television landscape.', 'The Nightly Show provides viewers with Larry Wilmore''s distinct point of view and comedic take on current events and pop culture. Hosted by Wilmore, the series features a diverse panel of voices, providing a perspective largely missing in the late night television landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZW6diC7eWIjqCsoJWEUiGvrnr4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61587'),
  ('1075042153108511243', 'The Nightmare Room', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'James Avery', 'TV-Y7', 'The Nightmare Room is an American children''s anthology horror series that aired on Kids'' WB. The series was based on the short-lived book series The Nightmare Room children''s books created by Goosebumps author, R.L. Stine. The Nightmare Room originally aired from August 31, 2001, to March 16, 2002, in the United States. It was rated TV-Y7 for fantasy violence and scenes deemed too scary or disturbing for younger viewers in the United States. Reruns of the series started airing on Chiller on January 7, 2013.', 'The Nightmare Room is an American children''s anthology horror series that aired on Kids'' WB. The series was based on the short-lived book series The Nightmare Room children''s books created by Goosebumps author, R.L. Stine. The Nightmare Room originally aired from August 31, 2001, to March 16, 2002, in the United States. It was rated TV-Y7 for fantasy violence and scenes deemed too scary or disturbing for younger viewers in the United States. Reruns of the series started airing on Chiller on January 7, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aBRRkf0UoSEIN3kTaHPbUgFk4x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10861'),
  ('614624238543246025', 'The Nightmare Worlds of H.G. Wells', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Ray Winstone', null, 'The Nightmare Worlds of H. G. Wells is a 2016 horror-fantasy television miniseries, based on short stories by H. G. Wells. The four-part series of 30-minute episodes was commissioned for broadcast by Sky Arts. The series is hosted by Ray Winstone as Wells.', 'The Nightmare Worlds of H. G. Wells is a 2016 horror-fantasy television miniseries, based on short stories by H. G. Wells. The four-part series of 30-minute episodes was commissioned for broadcast by Sky Arts. The series is hosted by Ray Winstone as Wells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSl0VSRHfqZsyjc0j4MyKThQ2nu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65445'),
  ('1058275580077502750', 'The Nine', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hank Steinberg, K.J. Steinberg', null, 'Tim Daly, Kim Raver, John Billingsley, Chi McBride, Scott Wolf, Camille Guaty, Lourdes Benedicto, Dana Davis', null, 'Nine people are caught in a bank robbery gone wrong and endure a 52-hour hostage standoff that will leave more than one person dead. They will be forever affected and intertwined because of it.', 'Nine people are caught in a bank robbery gone wrong and endure a 52-hour hostage standoff that will leave more than one person dead. They will be forever affected and intertwined because of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FWsBK96U8VUywOun1N34cCU7Nj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:337'),
  ('387668404010988920', 'The Nine Lives of Chloe King', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Berendsen', null, 'Skyler Samuels, Gracie Gillam, Ki Hong Lee, Benjamin Stone, Alyssa Diaz, Grey Damon, Amy Pietz', 'TV-PG', 'Chloe King is looking forward to celebrating her birthday with her friends and single mother, just like every other year... that is until she starts developing heightened abilities and discovers she''s being pursued by a mysterious figure. Chloe soon learns she''s part of an ancient race which has been hunted by human assassins for millennia —and that she may be their only hope for ultimate survival.', 'Chloe King is looking forward to celebrating her birthday with her friends and single mother, just like every other year... that is until she starts developing heightened abilities and discovers she''s being pursued by a mysterious figure. Chloe soon learns she''s part of an ancient race which has been hunted by human assassins for millennia —and that she may be their only hope for ultimate survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dbVI8Cwf0HwDmPCjsw36ZgBXNq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37646'),
  ('738137977881804967', 'The Nineties', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gary Goetzman, Mark Herzog, Tom Hanks', null, 'Tom Hanks, Chuck Klosterman, Douglas Brinkley, Kurt Loder', null, 'Hit rewind and explore the most iconic moments and influential people of The Nineties, the decade that gave us the Internet, DVDs, and other cultural and political milestones.', 'Hit rewind and explore the most iconic moments and influential people of The Nineties, the decade that gave us the Internet, DVDs, and other cultural and political milestones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zWwsdY6BvB3jXDOOAKKQgY2VSF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72757'),
  ('572627957277220753', 'The No Man Zone', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Pelageya Nevzorova, Nikita Kologrivyy, Andrey Skorokhod, Zhanna Epple, Anna Snatkina, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Filipp Blednyy, Svetlana Kamynina', null, 'The year is 2140. Society has undergone profound change and is now run as a matriarchy, thus removing its reliance on men. Two Hills is one of the communities founded by this new order. It is a place of perfection, where there is harmony rather than conflict, science and reason prevail and the environment is protected and respected. One of its inhabitants is the history teacher, Rada. On her birthday she takes her students on a guided tour of a special area outside of Two Hills, a place where the so-called “primates” live. The "primates" are men (and a handful of women) who have chosen to live beyond female control. However, the tranquillity of Rada’s perfectly arranged female-centric world comes under threat when she meets the young "primate", Hera. It’s a classic girl-meets-boy story, in a world where the rules have fundamentally changed.', 'The year is 2140. Society has undergone profound change and is now run as a matriarchy, thus removing its reliance on men. Two Hills is one of the communities founded by this new order. It is a place of perfection, where there is harmony rather than conflict, science and reason prevail and the environment is protected and respected. One of its inhabitants is the history teacher, Rada. On her birthday she takes her students on a guided tour of a special area outside of Two Hills, a place where the so-called “primates” live. The "primates" are men (and a handful of women) who have chosen to live beyond female control. However, the tranquillity of Rada’s perfectly arranged female-centric world comes under threat when she meets the young "primate", Hera. It’s a classic girl-meets-boy story, in a world where the rules have fundamentally changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PiWLVa7ti8BDnUeg2hYrpiGkdK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:157769'),
  ('521555261463888091', 'The No. 1 Ladies'' Detective Agency', 2009, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Anthony Minghella, Richard Curtis', null, 'Jill Scott, Anika Noni Rose, Lucian Msamati, Desmond Dube', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of Mma Ramotswe, a Motswana woman who starts Botswana''s first female-owned detective agency.', 'The adventures of Mma Ramotswe, a Motswana woman who starts Botswana''s first female-owned detective agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVPAP1fS5k8nFRtIE8TgSgdL9bb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7154'),
