  ('673341858359459881', 'The Nokdu Flower', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jung Hyun-min, Shin Gyeong-su', 'Jung Hyun-min', 'Cho Jung-seok, Yoon Shi-yoon, Han Ye-ri, Choi Moo-seong, Park Hyuk-kwon, Hwang Young-hee, Seo Young-hee, Jeong Seon-cheol', null, 'Set during the period of the 1894 Donghak Peasant Revolution against the Japanese, the drama tells the story of two half-brothers, one illegitimate and low born, and one, part of the pro-Japanese ruling elite, who find themselves on opposite sides of the conflict.', 'Set during the period of the 1894 Donghak Peasant Revolution against the Japanese, the drama tells the story of two half-brothers, one illegitimate and low born, and one, part of the pro-Japanese ruling elite, who find themselves on opposite sides of the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKCvoDIp36NvZPu5TGfW9ALzBEf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88398'),
  ('751265907907867644', 'The Norm Show', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Norm Macdonald, Bruce Helford', null, 'Norm Macdonald, Laurie Metcalf, Ian Gomez, Max Wright, Artie Lange, Faith Ford', 'TV-14', 'Norm Henderson was once a fairly well-known -- but not particularly good -- professional hockey player. Norm''s penchant for gambling and not paying taxes resulted in his permanent expulsion from the game. Instead of jail, he was sentenced to community service as a social worker, where his fresh perspective in the field and lack of patience for office red tape don''t always jibe well with his co-workers.', 'Norm Henderson was once a fairly well-known -- but not particularly good -- professional hockey player. Norm''s penchant for gambling and not paying taxes resulted in his permanent expulsion from the game. Instead of jail, he was sentenced to community service as a social worker, where his fresh perspective in the field and lack of patience for office red tape don''t always jibe well with his co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP6ZoZQ7d14vY50UqnV1VNhwF2I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1320'),
  ('42657667823145054', 'The North Water', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Andrew Haigh', null, 'Colin Farrell, Jack O''Connell', 'TV-MA', 'Henry Drax is a harpooner and brutish killer whose amorality has been shaped to fit the harshness of his world, who will set sail on a whaling expedition to the Arctic with Patrick Sumner, a disgraced ex-army surgeon who signs up as the ship’s doctor. Hoping to escape the horrors of his past, Sumner finds himself on an ill-fated journey with a murderous psychopath. In search of redemption, his story becomes a harsh struggle for survival in the Arctic wasteland.', 'Henry Drax is a harpooner and brutish killer whose amorality has been shaped to fit the harshness of his world, who will set sail on a whaling expedition to the Arctic with Patrick Sumner, a disgraced ex-army surgeon who signs up as the ship’s doctor. Hoping to escape the horrors of his past, Sumner finds himself on an ill-fated journey with a murderous psychopath. In search of redemption, his story becomes a harsh struggle for survival in the Arctic wasteland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CM0ca8pX1os3SJ24hsIc0nN8ph.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86941'),
  ('902086653590775999', 'The Not-Too-Late Show with Elmo', 2020, 'Talk, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryan Dillon', 'TV-Y', 'Elmo is the host of his very own talk show and he''s going to bring you some (not-too-late) fun with this celeb-studded talk show, bringing familiar Sesame Street friends like Elmo, Cookie Monster, celebrity guests, and laughs the whole family can enjoy!', 'Elmo is the host of his very own talk show and he''s going to bring you some (not-too-late) fun with this celeb-studded talk show, bringing familiar Sesame Street friends like Elmo, Cookie Monster, celebrity guests, and laughs the whole family can enjoy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFxY0D86mtZ4Efi8t7HZDLdcxwE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101157'),
  ('969433547438482842', 'The Now', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Steve Leff, Pete Jones, Peter Farrelly', null, 'Dave Franco, Bill Murray, Alyssa Milano, O''Shea Jackson Jr., Daryl Hannah, Merritt Patterson, Jimmy Tatro', null, 'For Ed Poole, clarity comes when a secret from his past has seemingly destroyed his future. He soon realizes the only thing that will make his life worth living is to forget the past, screw the future and just live in The Now.', 'For Ed Poole, clarity comes when a secret from his past has seemingly destroyed his future. He soon realizes the only thing that will make his life worth living is to forget the past, screw the future and just live in The Now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlrJbTNPZYjQk0gJ3xWVUXHk2aW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95070'),
  ('759585215386083151', 'The Numbers', 2016, 'Animation', null, null, 'Daiki Kobayashi, Yuto Uemura, Tomokazu Seki, Tetsuya Kakihara, Airu Shiozaki', null, 'Four men are assigned to the prison: Jūgo, a man who attempted to break out of prison and ended up extending his jail time; Uno, a man who likes to gamble with women; Rock, a man who likes to get into fights; and Nico, a man who likes anime.', 'Four men are assigned to the prison: Jūgo, a man who attempted to break out of prison and ended up extending his jail time; Uno, a man who likes to gamble with women; Rock, a man who likes to get into fights; and Nico, a man who likes anime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deAAWfBOx5ObJji03bEv19pY9u5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68115'),
  ('1075853606994502400', 'The Nurse', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kasper Barfoed', null, 'Josephine Park, Fanny Louise Bernth, Peter Zandersen, Dick Kaysø, Selma Kjær Kuscu, Amalie Lindegård, Sofia Cukic, Stephanie Nguyen', 'TV-MA', 'Pernille Kurzmann Larsen, a fresh-faced nurse at a hospital, begins to question the attention-seeking tendencies of her colleague, Christina Aistrup Hansen. As Pernille delves deeper into her suspicions, she starts to believe that Christina''s behavior may be linked to a series of patient deaths.', 'Pernille Kurzmann Larsen, a fresh-faced nurse at a hospital, begins to question the attention-seeking tendencies of her colleague, Christina Aistrup Hansen. As Pernille delves deeper into her suspicions, she starts to believe that Christina''s behavior may be linked to a series of patient deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxh9kjto6w8GMIEGigdLFot7pUK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221802'),
  ('950589602162860828', 'The O.C.', 2003, 'Drama', 'Josh Schwartz', null, 'Peter Gallagher, Kelly Rowan, Ben McKenzie, Adam Brody, Melinda Clarke, Rachel Bilson, Autumn Reeser, Willa Holland', 'TV-14', 'Ryan Atwood, a teen from the wrong side of the tracks, moves in with a wealthy family willing to give him a chance. But Ryan''s arrival disturbs the status quo of the affluent, privileged community of Newport Beach, California.', 'Ryan Atwood, a teen from the wrong side of the tracks, moves in with a wealthy family willing to give him a chance. But Ryan''s arrival disturbs the status quo of the affluent, privileged community of Newport Beach, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDc6BMGDaeyalpSZ9KKk7RCBCz5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2673'),
  ('357524203681215630', 'The OA', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', null, 'Brit Marling, Jason Isaacs, Emory Cohen, Kingsley Ben-Adir, Phyllis Smith, Patrick Gibson, Brendan Meyer, Brandon Perea', 'TV-MA', 'Seven years after vanishing from her home, a young woman returns with mysterious new abilities and recruits five strangers for a secret mission.', 'Seven years after vanishing from her home, a young woman returns with mysterious new abilities and recruits five strangers for a secret mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rueY4slMeKtTGitm0raFUJvgaa5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69061'),
  ('262943886495432020', 'The Oath', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joe Halpin', null, 'Ryan Kwanten, Katrina Law, Cory Hardrict, J. J. Soria, Christina Milian, Zulay Henao, Sebastián Zurita, J. Anthony Pena', 'TV-MA', 'Explore a gang world we''ve never seen before: gangs that are made up of the very men and women sworn to uphold the law – cops. Only select officers make the cut, but once inside, gang members will do what they must to protect each other from enemies inside and outside their ranks.', 'Explore a gang world we''ve never seen before: gangs that are made up of the very men and women sworn to uphold the law – cops. Only select officers make the cut, but once inside, gang members will do what they must to protect each other from enemies inside and outside their ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouEeuz1XsMRnPPVC9pzxgM2DpBB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75797'),
  ('935654839576913968', 'The Oath of Love', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yang Zi, Xiao Zhan, Zhai Zilu, Li Yunrui, Ma Yujie, Daisy Li, Wang Chengyang, Zhao Shiyi', null, 'On the brink of graduation, Lin Zhixiao’s life unravels—her father falls seriously ill, she loses a key job opportunity, and her relationship ends. Amid the turmoil, she meets Gu Wei, her father’s compassionate doctor. As they navigate heartbreak, misunderstandings, and life’s challenges, they slowly discover a deep, unexpected love that proves they are meant for each other.', 'On the brink of graduation, Lin Zhixiao’s life unravels—her father falls seriously ill, she loses a key job opportunity, and her relationship ends. Amid the turmoil, she meets Gu Wei, her father’s compassionate doctor. As they navigate heartbreak, misunderstandings, and life’s challenges, they slowly discover a deep, unexpected love that proves they are meant for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puemYOibrTKQsj9gxfj0FW3DKzz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95044'),
  ('574805985637956418', 'The Oblongs', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Angus Oblong, Jace Richdale', null, 'Jean Smart, Will Ferrell, Pamela Adlon, Lea DeLaria, Jeannie Elias, Randy Sklar, Jason Sklar, Billy West', 'TV-14', 'The Oblongs are not so much dysfunctional as slightly nonfunctional. Living next to a polluted swamp has left them with the occasional missing limb or mysterious growth, but through it all, this close-knit family sticks together.Sometimes literally.', 'The Oblongs are not so much dysfunctional as slightly nonfunctional. Living next to a polluted swamp has left them with the occasional missing limb or mysterious growth, but through it all, this close-knit family sticks together.Sometimes literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHgUbiQnYhU7F4GSPv2yBU8GrRo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2568'),
  ('213579670770970418', 'The Octopus', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicola Badalucco, Lucio Battistrada', null, 'Patricia Millardet, Remo Girone, Elena Arvigo, Rolf Hoppe, Pippo Pattavina, Gilberto Idonea, Arturo Paglia, Gabriele Bocciarelli', 'TV-14', 'An epic crime saga of power, money, violence and corruption. The mafia controls everything through local and international networks like an octopus, and anyone who tries to bring them down pays the ultimate price.', 'An epic crime saga of power, money, violence and corruption. The mafia controls everything through local and international networks like an octopus, and anyone who tries to bring them down pays the ultimate price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gLLftWX1ecorSXq2jBMosQAcKx.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12822'),
  ('1039008351641978439', 'The Odd Couple', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Garry Marshall, Neil Simon', null, 'Tony Randall, Jack Klugman', 'TV-PG', 'Felix and Oscar are two divorced men. Felix is neat and tidy while Oscar is sloppy and casual. They share a Manhattan apartment, and their different lifestyles inevitably lead to conflicts.', 'Felix and Oscar are two divorced men. Felix is neat and tidy while Oscar is sloppy and casual. They share a Manhattan apartment, and their different lifestyles inevitably lead to conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NYUeWc7lXq6pbHDP0Pz3xxKhPC.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1809'),
  ('847315623687465406', 'The Odd Couple', 2015, 'Comedy, Family', 'Matthew Perry, Danny Jacobson, Joe Keenan', null, 'Matthew Perry, Thomas Lennon, Lindsay Sloane, Yvette Nicole Brown, Wendell Pierce', 'TV-PG', 'Oscar''s life seems almost perfect...sure he''s divorced and his apartment is a mess, but he''s the host of a well-known sports show, and is enjoying his bachelor lifestyle in New York City. That is until his college friend, Felix, shows up at Oscar''s apartment having just been dumped by his wife. Oscar does his best to console his old buddy and get him back on the dating horse, but his attempts uncover just how unresolved his own feelings are about his ex.', 'Oscar''s life seems almost perfect...sure he''s divorced and his apartment is a mess, but he''s the host of a well-known sports show, and is enjoying his bachelor lifestyle in New York City. That is until his college friend, Felix, shows up at Oscar''s apartment having just been dumped by his wife. Oscar does his best to console his old buddy and get him back on the dating horse, but his attempts uncover just how unresolved his own feelings are about his ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24HI3P1UtxJy019gYQSNd1FbXdN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61725'),
  ('504364191709737127', 'The Odyssey', 1992, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Warren Easton, Paul Vitols', null, 'Illya Woloshyn, Ashleigh Aston Moore, Tony Sampson, Janet Hodgkinson', null, 'The Odyssey is a Canadian-produced half-hour adventure-fantasy television series for children, originally broadcast 1992-94 on CBC Television. It starred Illya Woloshyn as Jay Ziegler, Ashleigh Aston Moore as Donna/Alpha, Tony Sampson as Keith/Flash, Andrea Nemeth as Medea/Sierra Jones, Mark Hildreth as Finger, Ryan Reynolds as Macro, Janet Hodgkinson as Val Ziegler, and Devon Sawa as Yudo.', 'The Odyssey is a Canadian-produced half-hour adventure-fantasy television series for children, originally broadcast 1992-94 on CBC Television. It starred Illya Woloshyn as Jay Ziegler, Ashleigh Aston Moore as Donna/Alpha, Tony Sampson as Keith/Flash, Andrea Nemeth as Medea/Sierra Jones, Mark Hildreth as Finger, Ryan Reynolds as Macro, Janet Hodgkinson as Val Ziegler, and Devon Sawa as Yudo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixeOYFcCj6YjKrliC13pxGFNTK2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11121'),
  ('1090174451793760863', 'The Odyssey', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Andrei Konchalovsky', null, 'Armand Assante, Greta Scacchi, Isabella Rossellini, Bernadette Peters, Eric Roberts, Irene Papas, Jeroen Krabbé, Geraldine Chaplin', 'TV-14', 'Warrior Odysseus leaves his idyllic life in the kingdom of Ithaca to fight in the Trojan War. Following victory, he now must endure a lengthy, decade-long return journey, and with all his wits, overcome deadly monsters, powerful forces of nature, seductive enchantresses, and even journey into the bowels of the Underworld.', 'Warrior Odysseus leaves his idyllic life in the kingdom of Ithaca to fight in the Trojan War. Following victory, he now must endure a lengthy, decade-long return journey, and with all his wits, overcome deadly monsters, powerful forces of nature, seductive enchantresses, and even journey into the bowels of the Underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCiQ7XySqnz9X1REtDNZRGLfhpe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9687'),
  ('598058031402340001', 'The Offer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michael Tolkin', null, 'Miles Teller, Matthew Goode, Dan Fogler, Burn Gorman, Colin Hanks, Giovanni Ribisi, Juno Temple', 'TV-MA', 'Oscar-winning producer Al Ruddy’s never before revealed experiences of making the iconic 1972 film The Godfather that Francis Ford Coppola directed and adapted with Mario Puzo.', 'Oscar-winning producer Al Ruddy’s never before revealed experiences of making the iconic 1972 film The Godfather that Francis Ford Coppola directed and adapted with Mario Puzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fdYX5uc3HZEuYotms3XJ72AbCr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114068'),
