  ('296412431209844170', 'The Old Dreams', 2022, 'Drama', 'Zhang Rui, Tian Li', 'Liu Ran', 'Lin Yun, Gao Zhiting, Ge Zheng, He Peng, Liu Yufeng, Li Ruoning, Xiong Yuexi, Li Hongtao', null, 'Set in Qingdao from the 1990s to the early 2000s, the drama follows the ups and downs of Chen Yiduo, Bi Laifu, and their friends during the decade. It depicts the inspirational story of a group of young people in the 90s who grow up and struggle in their youth and pursue a better life amidst the changes of the times.', 'Set in Qingdao from the 1990s to the early 2000s, the drama follows the ups and downs of Chen Yiduo, Bi Laifu, and their friends during the decade. It depicts the inspirational story of a group of young people in the 90s who grow up and struggle in their youth and pursue a better life amidst the changes of the times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KbQt0Ydno9dh8VaHJBnztWzE9o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157939'),
  ('1148668340915131969', 'The Old Man', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jonathan E. Steinberg, Robert Levine', null, 'Jeff Bridges, John Lithgow, Alia Shawkat, Navid Negahban, Jacqueline Antaramian, Amy Brenneman', 'TV-MA', 'Dan Chase absconded from the CIA decades ago and now lives off the grid. When an assassin arrives and tries to take Chase out, the old operative learns that to ensure his future he now must reconcile his past.', 'Dan Chase absconded from the CIA decades ago and now lives off the grid. When an assassin arrives and tries to take Chase out, the old operative learns that to ensure his future he now must reconcile his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ec9zCZl2Go8WhDN1JWjjgQRlEi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:111800'),
  ('543791277729990672', 'The Oligarch''s Wife', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Elena Podkaminskaya, Kai Aleks Getts, Margarita Dyachenkova, Evgeniya Kapralova, Anton Filipenko, Lyudmila Artemeva, Daniil Kiselev, Vladimir Gostyukhin', null, 'Albina''s life changes in an instant: under threat of arrest, her oligarch husband leaves her, taking all the money with him. All that remains of the spouse are two children and a Russian factory on the verge of bankruptcy. Now Albina is forced to forget about the luxurious life in a London mansion and remember what she was told in business courses. Just to start life from scratch in a provincial town without a penny in her pocket, no one taught her.', 'Albina''s life changes in an instant: under threat of arrest, her oligarch husband leaves her, taking all the money with him. All that remains of the spouse are two children and a Russian factory on the verge of bankruptcy. Now Albina is forced to forget about the luxurious life in a London mansion and remember what she was told in business courses. Just to start life from scratch in a provincial town without a penny in her pocket, no one taught her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUjKS6kIqtE865wq9VemE9MWb23.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136243'),
  ('58578803172711007', 'The On1y One', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mu Suli, Liu Kuang-Hui', 'Wang Yu-chen, Liu Kuang-Hui', 'Liu Dongqin, Benjamin Tsang, Samuel Ku, Kenny Yen, Lu Tingyu, Duan Chun-hao, Jennifer Hong, Yu An-shun', null, 'When their parents marry, two high school students become stepbrothers and navigate their relationship, turning from enemies into something more special.', 'When their parents marry, two high school students become stepbrothers and navigate their relationship, turning from enemies into something more special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tWIjacaIr9CM08Xnc80V6aTJfC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241613'),
  ('241013037972457115', 'The One', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Howard Overman', null, 'Amir El-Masry, Hannah Ware, Olivia Chenery, Stephen Campbell Moore, Lois Chimimba, Dimitri Leonidas, Diarmaid Murtagh, Zoë Tapper', 'TV-MA', 'Love — and lies — spiral when a DNA researcher helps discover a way to find the perfect partner, and creates a bold new matchmaking service.', 'Love — and lies — spiral when a DNA researcher helps discover a way to find the perfect partner, and creates a bold new matchmaking service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klL9vBIRdEeSLtjhn83pCNcVguZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119284'),
  ('80353064265567147', 'The One and Only', 2021, 'Drama', 'Moon Jung-min', 'Moon Jung-min', 'Ahn Eun-jin, Kim Kyung-nam, Moon Seong-hyun, Kang Ye-won, JOY, Goh Doo-shim, Jang Hyun-sung, Seo Yeon-woo', null, 'A contract killer gets entangled with a murder case and three terminally ill women who have each decided to end the life of one person before they die.', 'A contract killer gets entangled with a murder case and three terminally ill women who have each decided to end the life of one person before they die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT4qYVvilfiG8WCRjmkIKIzPbA7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127008'),
  ('20984780593557237', 'The One I Love', 2026, 'Drama, Soap', 'Coşkun Irmak', 'Yeşim Aslan', 'Aytaç Şaşmaz, Helin Kandemir, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Esra Ronabar, Deniz Işın, Cihat Süvarioğlu, Özlem Conker, Umutcan Ütebay', null, 'Erkan Aldur, a young man from a wealthy Istanbul family, is stationed in eastern Turkey to complete his mandatory military service in a remote, earthquake-stricken region. In this harsh and unfamiliar landscape, he meets Dicle, a young woman who has lived her entire life in the village and whose world is shaped by tradition, family, and community. Their encounter brings together two very different worlds, setting in motion a journey of change, resilience, and unexpected connection. As Dicle steps into the unfamiliar and Erkan faces new responsibilities, their story unfolds into a heartfelt and transformative tale of love and courage, that bridges even the widest divides', 'Erkan Aldur, a young man from a wealthy Istanbul family, is stationed in eastern Turkey to complete his mandatory military service in a remote, earthquake-stricken region. In this harsh and unfamiliar landscape, he meets Dicle, a young woman who has lived her entire life in the village and whose world is shaped by tradition, family, and community. Their encounter brings together two very different worlds, setting in motion a journey of change, resilience, and unexpected connection. As Dicle steps into the unfamiliar and Erkan faces new responsibilities, their story unfolds into a heartfelt and transformative tale of love and courage, that bridges even the widest divides', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVMb930nCNRYGhPlAVRI5hsMdAz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306215'),
