  ('988602218063578482', 'The Patients of Dr. García', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Javier Rey, Tamar Novas, Verónica Echegui, Eva Llorach, Raúl Jiménez, Stephanie Cayo, Jon Olivares', 'NR', 'In 1936 Madrid, an idealistic doctor''s life changes forever when he shelters a wounded spy and joins a decades-long fight against the spread of fascism.', 'In 1936 Madrid, an idealistic doctor''s life changes forever when he shelters a wounded spy and joins a decades-long fight against the spread of fascism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y57ND50yq0nPmQpvLmMBKrnAvRB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224490'),
