  ('558773828899948698', 'The Quad', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Anika Noni Rose, Zoë Renee, Peyton Alex Smith, Jazz Raycole, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Michelle DeFraites, Jake Allyn, Sean Blakemore', null, 'Dr. Eva Fletcher is the newly-elected President of the fictional Georgia A&M University. Upon arriving, Eva is charged with saving the prestigious HBCU from bankruptcy and her twenty-year marriage from crumbling while managing a tumultuous relationship with her rebellious only daughter. A diverse group of freshmen also promises to keep Eva''s hands full.', 'Dr. Eva Fletcher is the newly-elected President of the fictional Georgia A&M University. Upon arriving, Eva is charged with saving the prestigious HBCU from bankruptcy and her twenty-year marriage from crumbling while managing a tumultuous relationship with her rebellious only daughter. A diverse group of freshmen also promises to keep Eva''s hands full.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jtSWAB9hr3Dw6GRlADNh93WHYv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69997'),
  ('1096627250089826934', 'The Quatermass Experiment', 1953, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Reginald Tate, Isabel Dean, Hugh Kelly, Duncan Lamont, Paul Whitsun-Jones', null, 'Set in the near future against the background of a British space programme, the story of the first crewed flight into space, supervised by Professor Bernard Quatermass of the British Experimental Rocket Group.', 'Set in the near future against the background of a British space programme, the story of the first crewed flight into space, supervised by Professor Bernard Quatermass of the British Experimental Rocket Group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbNUN2Jr3O0pqfTJpB2XRLLKGYT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:352'),
  ('56544264430256886', 'The Queen of Flow', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrés Salgado', null, 'Carolina Ramírez, Carlos Torres, Juan Manuel Restrepo, Mariana Gómez, Alisson Joan', 'TV-14', 'Seventeen years after being wrongly imprisoned, a talented songwriter seeks justice against the men who caused her downfall and killed her family.', 'Seventeen years after being wrongly imprisoned, a talented songwriter seeks justice against the men who caused her downfall and killed her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuVuDYrs8sxvEolnYr0wCSvtyTi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80240'),
  ('936656724659001760', 'The QUEEN of News', 2023, 'Drama', 'Chung Shu-Kai', 'Kwok Kin-Lok, Wong Tin-shing', 'Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Kenneth Ma Kwok-Ming, Selena Lee, Samantha Ko, Venus Wong Man-Yik, Eric Tang, Shaun Tam Chun-Yin', null, 'The highly-watched 6:30 PM news report is the battleground for news anchors. In the news department, seasoned anchors Man Wai-sum and Leung Ging-yan split into two factions, each vying for the top spot. Wen causes quite a stir and eventually climbs the corporate ladder. The vacancy for the prime-time female anchor sparks a series of storms!', 'The highly-watched 6:30 PM news report is the battleground for news anchors. In the news department, seasoned anchors Man Wai-sum and Leung Ging-yan split into two factions, each vying for the top spot. Wen causes quite a stir and eventually climbs the corporate ladder. The vacancy for the prime-time female anchor sparks a series of storms!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nrVW6P44OPw2pxkAgEI5fMfjl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226197'),
  ('247284676086387873', 'The Queen Who Crowns', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kim Sang-ho, Lee Young-mi', 'Lee Young-mi', 'Cha Joo-young, Lee Hyun-wook, Lee Sung-min, Lee E-dam, Lee Shi-a, Choi Deok-moon, So Hee-jung, Jeong Eui-soon', null, 'A woman from a prestigious family helps her husband become king, but their relationship deteriorates as he takes many concubines. Tensions rise as the king seeks to control her and her family.', 'A woman from a prestigious family helps her husband become king, but their relationship deteriorates as he takes many concubines. Tensions rise as the king seeks to control her and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoTFlJ9JY2SJAeL4wTBNZTplpa4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226103'),
  ('260847047616114258', 'The Queen''s Classroom', 2005, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Amami, Mirai Shida, Kaho, Michiko Hada, Mayuko Fukuda, Shigeru Izumiya, Naruki Matsukawa, Sachie Hara', null, 'The Queen''s Classroom is a live-action Japanese television drama about Maya Akutsu, a new teacher at Hanzaki Elementary School who strives for perfection and punishes her students in unorthodox manners. A 12 year old student, Kazumi Kanda, has been able to withstand her strange punishments so far but the other 23 students begin to fold under the pressure. A South Korean remake of the same title starring Go Hyun-jung in the lead role, was produced in 2013.', 'The Queen''s Classroom is a live-action Japanese television drama about Maya Akutsu, a new teacher at Hanzaki Elementary School who strives for perfection and punishes her students in unorthodox manners. A 12 year old student, Kazumi Kanda, has been able to withstand her strange punishments so far but the other 23 students begin to fold under the pressure. A South Korean remake of the same title starring Go Hyun-jung in the lead role, was produced in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rL56p2eIqC62mOFXNtmCigdT4LX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36408'),
  ('994256829170283931', 'The Queen''s Gambit', 2020, 'Drama', 'Scott Frank, Allan Scott', null, 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Chloe Pirrie', 'TV-MA', 'In a 1950s orphanage, a young girl reveals an astonishing talent for chess and begins an unlikely journey to stardom while grappling with addiction.', 'In a 1950s orphanage, a young girl reveals an astonishing talent for chess and begins an unlikely journey to stardom while grappling with addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zU0htwkhNvBQdVSIKB9s6hgVeFK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87739'),
