  ('31059290320417308', 'The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives', 2024, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Whitney Leavitt, Mikayla Matthews, Jen Affleck, Jessi Ngatikaura, Layla Taylor, Demi Engemann, Mayci Neeley, Taylor Frankie Paul', 'TV-MA', 'The scandalous world of a group of Mormon mom influencers implodes when they get caught in the midst of a swinging sex scandal that makes international headlines. Now, their sisterhood is shook to its core. Faith, friendship and reputations are all on the line. Will #MomTok be able to survive and continue to give the rulebook a run for its money, or will this group fall from grace?', 'The scandalous world of a group of Mormon mom influencers implodes when they get caught in the midst of a swinging sex scandal that makes international headlines. Now, their sisterhood is shook to its core. Faith, friendship and reputations are all on the line. Will #MomTok be able to survive and continue to give the rulebook a run for its money, or will this group fall from grace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TYXFrVgV5JkirQG7gq8rHHaRD8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:261102'),
  ('840655928582116781', 'The Secret Message', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'T.O.P, Juri Ueno, Yoo In-na', null, 'Woo-Hyun is Korean man and Haruka is Japanese woman. They live different lives, but they both carry emotional scars from their first love. Woo-Hyun has yet to get over his first love, but he still wants to believe in true love. Haruka is a woman wants answers relating to love.', 'Woo-Hyun is Korean man and Haruka is Japanese woman. They live different lives, but they both carry emotional scars from their first love. Woo-Hyun has yet to get over his first love, but he still wants to believe in true love. Haruka is a woman wants answers relating to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwc6YOtTaXWm1TsejLtTGsNST2S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64327'),
  ('636380900905300450', 'The Secret of Crickley Hall', 2012, 'Drama', 'Joe Ahearne', null, 'Suranne Jones, Maisie Williams, Tom Ellis, Douglas Henshall, Olivia Cooke, Sarah Smart, David Warner, Iain De Caestecker', null, 'A year after the disappearance of their son, Gabe and Eve Caleigh and their two daughters attempt to start anew, they head to Crickley Hall - a seemingly perfect countryside house. But when cellar doors start to open on their own, phantom children''s cries are heard through the night and a frenzied cane-wielding specter rears its head - the Caleigh''s realize the house comes with a lot more than they bargained for. Just as they''re ready to move out, Eve Caleigh hears Cam''s cries and all bets are off.', 'A year after the disappearance of their son, Gabe and Eve Caleigh and their two daughters attempt to start anew, they head to Crickley Hall - a seemingly perfect countryside house. But when cellar doors start to open on their own, phantom children''s cries are heard through the night and a frenzied cane-wielding specter rears its head - the Caleigh''s realize the house comes with a lot more than they bargained for. Just as they''re ready to move out, Eve Caleigh hears Cam''s cries and all bets are off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0WKfSZavXH1XUMh3MxKkRFVuHo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58808'),
  ('1062622299251204816', 'The Secret of Skinwalker Ranch', 2020, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Kevin Burns', null, 'Travis Taylor, Brandon Fugal, Bryant “Dragon” Arnold, Tom Winterton, Erik Bard', 'TV-PG', 'The investigation of the world’s most mysterious hot spot for UFO and “High Strangeness” phenomena with astrophysicist Dr. Travis Taylor who joins real estate tycoon Brandon Fugal, along with his team of scientists and researchers on Utah’s notorious Skinwalker Ranch. The team utilizes cutting edge technology to investigate the 512-acre property to uncover the possibly “otherworldly” perpetrators behind it all. With everything from mysterious animal deaths to hidden underground workings and possible gateways that open to other dimensions, witness the close encounters that go beyond conventional explanation, as the team risks everything to finally reveal the ultimate secret of Skinwalker Ranch.', 'The investigation of the world’s most mysterious hot spot for UFO and “High Strangeness” phenomena with astrophysicist Dr. Travis Taylor who joins real estate tycoon Brandon Fugal, along with his team of scientists and researchers on Utah’s notorious Skinwalker Ranch. The team utilizes cutting edge technology to investigate the 512-acre property to uncover the possibly “otherworldly” perpetrators behind it all. With everything from mysterious animal deaths to hidden underground workings and possible gateways that open to other dimensions, witness the close encounters that go beyond conventional explanation, as the team risks everything to finally reveal the ultimate secret of Skinwalker Ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8PpovebgIhrt89AQVvkogcX34v.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:101359'),
  ('846984574521846655', 'The Secret of the Greco Family', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rafael Ferro', null, 'A seemingly perfect family secretly kidnaps wealthy people for ransom to maintain their high standard of living and social status. Based on a true story.', 'A seemingly perfect family secretly kidnaps wealthy people for ransom to maintain their high standard of living and social status. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ppZZoTORmHhvcWYp9UvdSXtrVL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213803'),
  ('880307452142917376', 'The Secret of the Lost Pearl', 2026, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xiao Shunyao, Zhang Zhixi', null, 'A pair of embroidered shoes sets cultural relic expert Chen Youxi on a dangerous adventure. As he and his team search for the legendary Lingxiao Pearl, they repeatedly clash with tomb raiders—only to discover, after finding the first pearl, that they’ve become entangled in a far greater conspiracy.', 'A pair of embroidered shoes sets cultural relic expert Chen Youxi on a dangerous adventure. As he and his team search for the legendary Lingxiao Pearl, they repeatedly clash with tomb raiders—only to discover, after finding the first pearl, that they’ve become entangled in a far greater conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqvEhz2i1qsutxjbFwaLBR2ydqf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:316374'),
  ('1091810703245513817', 'The Secret of the River', 2024, 'Drama', 'Alberto Barrera Tyszka', 'Estéfani Enríquez Soto', 'Diego Calva, Trinidad González, Mauro Guzman, Frida Sofía Cruz Salinas, Yoshira Escárrega, Mercedes Hernández, Octavio Mendoza, Jorge A. Jimenez', 'TV-MA', 'When a young boy arrives in a small Mexican village, a profound friendship blossoms with a local kid — and a dark secret seals their bond forever.', 'When a young boy arrives in a small Mexican village, a profound friendship blossoms with a local kid — and a dark secret seals their bond forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eo4skUtcNuRtLL4TCGHeoa2D9o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271152'),
  ('510645097891656728', 'The Secret of Us', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Nitinun Supappong', 'Sirilak Kwong, Kornnaphat Sethratanapong, Apasiri Nitibhon, Paramej Noiam, Narumon Phongsupan, Chatsak Mahata, Jakarin Puribhat, Dandao Yamapai', null, 'After a disastrous breakup, two women cross paths again and must navigate love, uncertainty and the past before they reignite their old romance.', 'After a disastrous breakup, two women cross paths again and must navigate love, uncertainty and the past before they reignite their old romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GjOfzt4QO0W6TZrNmtxYz1iRuV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253710'),
  ('472700121996405492', 'The Secret River', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Sarah Snook, Lachy Hulme, Tim Minchin, Trevor Jamieson, Rory Potter, Finn Scicluna-O''Prey, Katherine Kelly', null, 'In 1806, William Thornhill is sentenced to New South Wales for life where he is drawn into a terrifying conflict that will leave a bloody and indelible stain.', 'In 1806, William Thornhill is sentenced to New South Wales for life where he is drawn into a terrifying conflict that will leave a bloody and indelible stain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fusRpgjzAwitNAAhDPLxTH215d6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62953'),
  ('705397107472436285', 'The Secret Romantic Guesthouse', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Kwon Eum-mi', 'Shin Ye-eun, Ryeoun, Kang Hoon, Jung Gun-joo, Han Chae-a, Hyun Woo, Oh Man-seok, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'The series is about an incident that takes place when the owners of the boarding house called ''Guest Summer Palace'', which breaks stereotypes, and boarders with secrets gather to find Lee Seol who disappeared 13 years ago.', 'The series is about an incident that takes place when the owners of the boarding house called ''Guest Summer Palace'', which breaks stereotypes, and boarders with secrets gather to find Lee Seol who disappeared 13 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EpL5jb68S2pzqM0Qo1geHC0y6K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205757'),
  ('872224441822997952', 'The Secret Saturdays', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Jay Stephens', null, 'Sam Lerner, Nicole Sullivan, Phil Morris, Fred Tatasciore, Diedrich Bader, Corey Burton', 'TV-Y7', 'The Saturdays, a family of cryptozoologists, work to keep the truth about cryptids from getting out, in order to protect both the human race and the creatures themselves. They travel the world searching for cryptids to study and battling twisted villains like the megalomaniac V.V. Argost.', 'The Saturdays, a family of cryptozoologists, work to keep the truth about cryptids from getting out, in order to protect both the human race and the creatures themselves. They travel the world searching for cryptids to study and battling twisted villains like the megalomaniac V.V. Argost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6ulaU7kehrXmMOhuaBW98qx2aL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14636'),
  ('208986832449899704', 'The Secret Show', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kate Harbour, Alan Marriott, Keith Wickham, Rob Rackstraw, Martin Hyder', null, 'The Secret Show is a British animated show commissioned by BBC Worldwide in partnership with BBC Children''s. Production of the show began in 2004 and first debuted in 2006. It currently airs on CBBC, ABC1, BBC One, BBC Kids, Teletoon+, MBC3, 2x2, Disney Channel Latin America, TVB Pearl, and TSR 2. It debuted on the American Nicktoons on January 20, 2007, and was later cancelled in 2011. It also used to air on Jetix Latin America', 'The Secret Show is a British animated show commissioned by BBC Worldwide in partnership with BBC Children''s. Production of the show began in 2004 and first debuted in 2006. It currently airs on CBBC, ABC1, BBC One, BBC Kids, Teletoon+, MBC3, 2x2, Disney Channel Latin America, TVB Pearl, and TSR 2. It debuted on the American Nicktoons on January 20, 2007, and was later cancelled in 2011. It also used to air on Jetix Latin America', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHlicjxb4U2UXdyQ4hZZFLTYg06.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1127'),
  ('638093608011020237', 'The Secret Squirrel Show', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Mel Blanc, Paul Frees, John Stephenson, Dick Beals', 'NR', 'The half-hour The Secret Squirrel Show included three individual cartoon segments: "Secret Squirrel", "Squiddly Diddly" and "Winsome Witch".', 'The half-hour The Secret Squirrel Show included three individual cartoon segments: "Secret Squirrel", "Squiddly Diddly" and "Winsome Witch".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9yvtVflorbf0MmzkzWkQ0nmg3U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4752'),
  ('613231998716094946', 'The Secret Storm', 1954, 'Soap', 'Roy Winsor', null, 'Marla Adams, Jada Rowland, Russell Hicks, Marjorie Gateson, James Pritchett, Audrey Landers, Roy Scheider, Eleanor Phelps', null, 'The Secret Storm is a soap opera which ran on CBS from February 1, 1954 to February 8, 1974. The series was created by Roy Winsor, who also created the long-running soap operas Search for Tomorrow and Love of Life. Gloria Monty of General Hospital fame was a longtime director of the series. Like most CBS Soap Operas of the time such as The Guiding Light and As the World Turns The Secret Storm was filmed, and later taped, in New York at the CBS Broadcast Center on West 52 Street.', 'The Secret Storm is a soap opera which ran on CBS from February 1, 1954 to February 8, 1974. The series was created by Roy Winsor, who also created the long-running soap operas Search for Tomorrow and Love of Life. Gloria Monty of General Hospital fame was a longtime director of the series. Like most CBS Soap Operas of the time such as The Guiding Light and As the World Turns The Secret Storm was filmed, and later taped, in New York at the CBS Broadcast Center on West 52 Street.', null, 20, 'tmdb:tv:4673'),
  ('428710362718339947', 'The Secret World of Alex Mack', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Kids, Family', 'Thomas W. Lynch, Ken Lipman', null, 'Larisa Oleynik, Meredith Bishop, Darris Love, Michael Blakley, Dorian Lopinto, Alexis Fields', 'TV-PG', 'Thanks to a dousing in a top-secret chemical from an overturned truck, teenager Alex Mack is given amazing powers that make her the envy of her sister and best friend... and the target of a search by the chemical company, which wants to find her at all costs.', 'Thanks to a dousing in a top-secret chemical from an overturned truck, teenager Alex Mack is given amazing powers that make her the envy of her sister and best friend... and the target of a search by the chemical company, which wants to find her at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pIfkimPGsMVmpgN6XO78LkPZqS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4289'),
  ('935864022992214079', 'The Secret World of Nature: Spain', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gerardo Poveda, PEDRO POVEDA', null, 'Simon Stepney, Narrador Ximo Muñoz', 'TV-Y7', 'More than four years of filming have been necessary to capture the impressive images of the most varied animal species that inhabit the Iberian Peninsula: amphibians, reptiles, mammals, birds, insects and fish are represented in this wonderful journey through the different ecosystems that we can find in Iberian lands.', 'More than four years of filming have been necessary to capture the impressive images of the most varied animal species that inhabit the Iberian Peninsula: amphibians, reptiles, mammals, birds, insects and fish are represented in this wonderful journey through the different ecosystems that we can find in Iberian lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WeJUtRvLPEAFpJsrYowkMipTGe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111052'),
  ('298559842154010330', 'The Secret World of Santa Claus', 1997, 'Animation, Family', 'Prakash Topsy, Christian Choquet', null, 'Benoît Allemane, Thor Bishopric, Mélanie Dermont, Aurélien Ringelheim', 'NR', 'The Secret World of Santa Claus is a children''s animated television show that originates from France. It is syndicated to several countries worldwide, including Teletoon in Canada, and is generally seen every December during the holiday season. On December 25, 1999, Christmas Day, The Secret World of Santa Claus marathon took place from 6:00am to 7:00pm. The show has been put back on air and will be showed every Christmas season on Teletoon.', 'The Secret World of Santa Claus is a children''s animated television show that originates from France. It is syndicated to several countries worldwide, including Teletoon in Canada, and is generally seen every December during the holiday season. On December 25, 1999, Christmas Day, The Secret World of Santa Claus marathon took place from 6:00am to 7:00pm. The show has been put back on air and will be showed every Christmas season on Teletoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YLFYkmcA3ph3HiEtkwEV7Kr4Lp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13407'),
  ('686235356441887024', 'The Secrets of Hillsong', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Carl Lentz, Alex French, Dan Adler, Brian Houston, Bobbie Houston', 'TV-MA', 'With fresh reporting and analysis from journalists, historians and policymakers, go beyond the sensational headlines and behind the velvet rope to examine the church''s long pattern of covering up misconduct to protect itself.', 'With fresh reporting and analysis from journalists, historians and policymakers, go beyond the sensational headlines and behind the velvet rope to examine the church''s long pattern of covering up misconduct to protect itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEQUKQ4R8gkQ1Tlah52pkCuGhYd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223430'),
  ('208265142934702067', 'The Secrets of Hotel 88', 2026, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', null, null, 'Brent Manalo, Mika Salamanca, Will Ashley, Ralph De Leon, Bianca de Vera, River Joseph, Kira Balinger, Josh Ford', null, 'Two estranged families reunite at the reopening of Hotel 88, until the former best friends behind it are found dead. Forced to share the inheritance, their children uncover buried secrets and the truth behind their fathers'' mysterious deaths.', 'Two estranged families reunite at the reopening of Hotel 88, until the former best friends behind it are found dead. Forced to share the inheritance, their children uncover buried secrets and the truth behind their fathers'' mysterious deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FmIyAnBvDmyAGYFnP0zCqphYlP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:301031'),
  ('1135061774831347323', 'The Secrets She Keeps', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Laura Carmichael, Jessica De Gouw, Todd Lasance, Ryan Corr, Cariba Heine, Miranda Frangou, Danielle Cormack', null, 'In an affluent Sydney suburb, two women have a chance encounter in a supermarket. They are the same age, both heavily pregnant and due at the same time. Meghan is a glamorous influencer on the rise, with an ambitious television sports reporter husband Jack, while Agatha works in the supermarket as a shelf stacker. Although they live near each other, the two women’s lives could not be more different…Both women have secrets. And both will risk everything to conceal the truth. But their worlds are about to collide in one shocking act that cannot be undone.', 'In an affluent Sydney suburb, two women have a chance encounter in a supermarket. They are the same age, both heavily pregnant and due at the same time. Meghan is a glamorous influencer on the rise, with an ambitious television sports reporter husband Jack, while Agatha works in the supermarket as a shelf stacker. Although they live near each other, the two women’s lives could not be more different…Both women have secrets. And both will risk everything to conceal the truth. But their worlds are about to collide in one shocking act that cannot be undone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IqfC1nJJTfOBhKv23qreRwMifG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101567'),
  ('580761110933145283', 'The Seduction', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jean-Baptiste Delafon', null, 'Anamaria Vartolomei, Diane Kruger, Vincent Lacoste, Lucas Bravo, Noée Abita, Julien de Saint Jean, Fantine Harduin, Samuel Kircher', null, 'Marquise de Merteuil, betrayed by Valmont, embarks on a daring journey to become Paris'' leading courtesan.', 'Marquise de Merteuil, betrayed by Valmont, embarks on a daring journey to become Paris'' leading courtesan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vknbnvegsTrzjqa8fsPyXN4wCHI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255719'),
  ('1027443009266970819', 'The Seed', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Christian Jeltsch', null, 'Heino Ferch, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Rainer Bock, Jonathan Berlin, Friederike Becht, Seumas F. Sargent, Laura de Boer, Jasmina Al Zihairi', null, 'The German inspector Max Grosz sets off with the Norwegian policewoman Thea Koren to Spitsbergen in search of his missing nephew. In the process, they delve deeper and deeper into a web of intrigue and political interests, because the disappearance is apparently connected to the controversial takeover of an agricultural company.', 'The German inspector Max Grosz sets off with the Norwegian policewoman Thea Koren to Spitsbergen in search of his missing nephew. In the process, they delve deeper and deeper into a web of intrigue and political interests, because the disappearance is apparently connected to the controversial takeover of an agricultural company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/364xCf8npxdJEXx4W9mHjBg5424.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217645'),
  ('547715642858625831', 'The Sentinel', 1996, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', null, 'Richard Burgi, Garett Maggart, Bruce A. Young', null, 'The Sentinel is a Canadian-produced television series. In the jungles of peru, the fight for survival heightened his senses. Now, Detective Jim Ellison is a sentinel in the fight for justice. Anthropologist Blair Sandburg works side by side with Jim, helping him develop these senses.', 'The Sentinel is a Canadian-produced television series. In the jungles of peru, the fight for survival heightened his senses. Now, Detective Jim Ellison is a sentinel in the fight for justice. Anthropologist Blair Sandburg works side by side with Jim, helping him develop these senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cj1moyLJKpmvR0fR9AqsZuXYxAm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1654'),
  ('11265779393206995', 'The Sentinels', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Guillaume Lemans, Xabi Molia', null, 'Louis Peres, Thibaut Évrard, Kacey Mottet Klein, Carl Malapa, Olivia Ross, Ouassini Embarek, Pauline Étienne, Nastya Golubeva Carax', 'TV-MA', '1915, WWI. French Private Gabriel is presumed dead. Selected for a top-secret program, he’s given a serum that makes him stronger and faster. To see his family again, he must join the Sentinels, elite soldiers on a mission to end the war.', '1915, WWI. French Private Gabriel is presumed dead. Selected for a top-secret program, he’s given a serum that makes him stronger and faster. To see his family again, he must join the Sentinels, elite soldiers on a mission to end the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPSAHmFFgF9rDZG7xnajlSKeRtZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223876'),
  ('3394537193524302', 'The Serial Killer''s Wife', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Annabel Scholey, Jack Farthing, Luke Treadaway, Angela Griffin, Shobna Gulati, Morgana Robinson, Hari Dhillon, Tim Daish', null, 'Beth and Tom Fairchild seem to have it all. However, when a string of murders is traced back to Tom, Beth is forced to ask herself whether she has ignored signs of her husband’s violence all along.', 'Beth and Tom Fairchild seem to have it all. However, when a string of murders is traced back to Tom, Beth is forced to ask herself whether she has ignored signs of her husband’s violence all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIJtbBV2TwgfntCXp7cwDCUiahS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229940'),
  ('329653328226565196', 'The Serpent', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Richard Warlow, Toby Finlay', null, 'Tahar Rahim, Jenna Coleman, Billy Howle, Ellie Bamber, Mathilde Warnier, Grégoire Isvarine, Tim McInnerny', 'TV-MA', 'The remarkable story of how murderer Charles Sobhraj was captured. As the chief suspect in unsolved murders of young Western travellers across India, Thailand and Nepal’s ‘Hippie Trail’ in 1975 and 1976, Sobhraj had repeatedly slipped from the grasp of authorities worldwide to become Interpol''s most wanted man, with arrest warrants on three different continents.', 'The remarkable story of how murderer Charles Sobhraj was captured. As the chief suspect in unsolved murders of young Western travellers across India, Thailand and Nepal’s ‘Hippie Trail’ in 1975 and 1976, Sobhraj had repeatedly slipped from the grasp of authorities worldwide to become Interpol''s most wanted man, with arrest warrants on three different continents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZve7vS8S7nyYMIJ5rJrjzOGwAZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93454'),
  ('531117964891228974', 'The Serpent Queen', 2022, 'Drama', 'Justin Haythe', null, 'Samantha Morton, Amrita Acharia, Barry Atsma, Enzo Cilenti, Nicholas Burns, Danny Kirrane, Bill Milner', 'TV-MA', 'Considered an immigrant, common and plain, Catherine de Medici is married into the 16th century French court as an orphaned teenager expected to bring a fortune in dowry and produce many heirs, only to discover that her husband is in love with an older woman, her dowry is unpaid and she’s unable to concieve. Yet, only with her intelligence and determination, she manages to keep her marriage alive and masters the bloodsport that is the monarchy better than anyone else, ruling France for 50 years.', 'Considered an immigrant, common and plain, Catherine de Medici is married into the 16th century French court as an orphaned teenager expected to bring a fortune in dowry and produce many heirs, only to discover that her husband is in love with an older woman, her dowry is unpaid and she’s unable to concieve. Yet, only with her intelligence and determination, she manages to keep her marriage alive and masters the bloodsport that is the monarchy better than anyone else, ruling France for 50 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrpIpzbwoAZJTegfKSTlmz15jbf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:118189'),
  ('984200286896388938', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Sora Amamiya, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Misaki Kuno, Aoi Yuuki, Jun Fukuyama, Rintaro Nishi', 'TV-14', 'The “Seven Deadly Sins”—a group of evil knights who conspired to overthrow the kingdom of Britannia—were said to have been eradicated by the Holy Knights, although some claim that they still live. Ten years later, the Holy Knights have staged a Coup d''état and assassinated the king, becoming the new, tyrannical rulers of the kingdom. Elizabeth, the king''s only daughter, sets out on a journey to find the “Seven Deadly Sins,” and to enlist their help in taking back the kingdom.', 'The “Seven Deadly Sins”—a group of evil knights who conspired to overthrow the kingdom of Britannia—were said to have been eradicated by the Holy Knights, although some claim that they still live. Ten years later, the Holy Knights have staged a Coup d''état and assassinated the king, becoming the new, tyrannical rulers of the kingdom. Elizabeth, the king''s only daughter, sets out on a journey to find the “Seven Deadly Sins,” and to enlist their help in taking back the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxTojpKEOtue85EEFlozwRbDXwJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62104'),
  ('5687728070039303', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Four Knights of the Apocalypse', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shou Komura, Kikunosuke Toya, Aino Shimada, Kanna Nakamura, Koki Uchiyama, Rikiya Koyama, Sachi Kokuryu, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-MA', 'As a prophecy of doom unfolds on the peaceful land of Britannia, a purehearted boy sets out on a journey of discovery — and revenge.', 'As a prophecy of doom unfolds on the peaceful land of Britannia, a purehearted boy sets out on a journey of discovery — and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SWVJvCIC9B16u6wASZ8FEaNssz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218843'),
  ('711120539608740155', 'The Seven Heavenly Virtues', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shinji Ishihira', null, 'Yumi Uchiyama, Hiyori Nitta, Shiori Izawa, Ari Ozawa, Sakura Nakamura, Asami Seto, Lynn', null, 'Heaven has been thrown into chaos, and in the ashes, seven angels known as the Seven Heavenly Virtues, are sent to Earth to search for a candidate who can become the "true messiah".', 'Heaven has been thrown into chaos, and in the ashes, seven angels known as the Seven Heavenly Virtues, are sent to Earth to search for a candidate who can become the "true messiah".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUt1elM2MzRQeuQFpCFi7zATDbA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76138'),
  ('19613332958911283', 'The Seven Relics of ill Omen', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Song Weilong, Liu Haocun, Ao Ruipeng, Wang Yiting, Zhang Yichi, Clara Lee', null, 'Adapted from the novel The Seven Relics of ill Omen by Weiyu. In ancient times, a mysterious substance descended upon Fengzi Ridge. Capable of parasitic invasion, it twists the human heart and lures its host into evil. Now, these relics of ill omen have reemerged, unleashing a series of bizarre and gruesome murders. Five ordinary yet passionate young people—Mu Dai, Luo Ren, Thirteen-Thousand, Yan Hongsha, and Cao Yanhua—are successively drawn into this crisis through their own fateful encounters. They form the "Phoenix Squad" and embark on a perilous quest to subdue these ill omens. Amid life-and-death trials, Luo Ren and Mu Dai heal each other''s wounds and forge a genuine bond. Through a long and arduous journey fraught with danger, the five overcome relentless challenges, their friendship tempered and deepened in the fires of adversity.', 'Adapted from the novel The Seven Relics of ill Omen by Weiyu. In ancient times, a mysterious substance descended upon Fengzi Ridge. Capable of parasitic invasion, it twists the human heart and lures its host into evil. Now, these relics of ill omen have reemerged, unleashing a series of bizarre and gruesome murders. Five ordinary yet passionate young people—Mu Dai, Luo Ren, Thirteen-Thousand, Yan Hongsha, and Cao Yanhua—are successively drawn into this crisis through their own fateful encounters. They form the "Phoenix Squad" and embark on a perilous quest to subdue these ill omens. Amid life-and-death trials, Luo Ren and Mu Dai heal each other''s wounds and forge a genuine bond. Through a long and arduous journey fraught with danger, the five overcome relentless challenges, their friendship tempered and deepened in the fires of adversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBERkPkNxzKnSwCR8ZnuLYH9apE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290054'),
  ('265300107655860135', 'The Seventh Scroll', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Sergio Donati, Kevin Connor', 'Karina Lombard, Wilfried Baasner, Jeff Fahey, Katrina Gibson, Roy Scheider, Valeria Marini, Lucy Goncalves, Art Malik', null, 'Past and present intertwine when an archaeologist and her husband find a mysterious child on the banks of the Nile and adopt him. But the more they learn about the lost tomb of Pharaoh Mamose, the more Hapi, the little child, is plagued by frightening visions. Soon it is clear that powerful forces are trying to prevent the couple from finding the tomb.', 'Past and present intertwine when an archaeologist and her husband find a mysterious child on the banks of the Nile and adopt him. But the more they learn about the lost tomb of Pharaoh Mamose, the more Hapi, the little child, is plagued by frightening visions. Soon it is clear that powerful forces are trying to prevent the couple from finding the tomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjSB9tznUuTJXQk3cR8jZTTjYGX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77312'),
  ('558593191346573796', 'The Seventies', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Gary Goetzman, Tom Hanks', null, 'Walter Cronkite, Dan Rather, Tom Hanks, David Brinkley, Chris Connelly', 'TV-PG', 'A documentary series focusing on the ongoing Vietnam War, the Watergate scandal, evolving music industry, the Iran Hostage Crisis, the sexual revolution, and the rise of foreign and domestic terrorism.', 'A documentary series focusing on the ongoing Vietnam War, the Watergate scandal, evolving music industry, the Iran Hostage Crisis, the sexual revolution, and the rise of foreign and domestic terrorism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjdUWLijxH3PGoxftR0yIB06lJT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62811'),
  ('311596167086504031', 'The Severing Crime Edge', 2013, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Arisa Noto, Natsuki Hanae, Kotori Koiwai, Kaori Fukuhara, Yumi Uchiyama, Koji Yusa, Yukari Tamura, Kikuko Inoue', null, 'Killing Goods are murder weapons handed down from generation to generation within the families of their owners. They are cursed to compel their current owners to repeat the original murders. The curse also makes them indestructible. Kiri Haimura is the current owner of a pair of shears that can cut seemingly anything, although the only thing he wants to cut is hair. One day he meets Iwai Mushanokoji, a girl of whom he has only heard rumors that her hair cannot be cut, a girl who can grant one wish, any wish, but only to the person who murders her. Every morning he cuts her hair, which grows back every night; and every day he helps protect her from people who know about her curse and who want a wish granted.', 'Killing Goods are murder weapons handed down from generation to generation within the families of their owners. They are cursed to compel their current owners to repeat the original murders. The curse also makes them indestructible. Kiri Haimura is the current owner of a pair of shears that can cut seemingly anything, although the only thing he wants to cut is hair. One day he meets Iwai Mushanokoji, a girl of whom he has only heard rumors that her hair cannot be cut, a girl who can grant one wish, any wish, but only to the person who murders her. Every morning he cuts her hair, which grows back every night; and every day he helps protect her from people who know about her curse and who want a wish granted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJIQ63qHGlb1iuUhLWUrwpkgoyY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52850'),
  ('999959525846245786', 'The Sex Education Show', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anna Richardson', null, 'The Sex Education Show is a British sex education television show that aired on Channel 4. The series, hosted by Anna Richardson, aims to improve the nation''s knowledge by offering candid advice on a wide range of sexual issues and problems.', 'The Sex Education Show is a British sex education television show that aired on Channel 4. The series, hosted by Anna Richardson, aims to improve the nation''s knowledge by offering candid advice on a wide range of sexual issues and problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2AJmpxi0QQjksGwSCPiYXbYu2L.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:22757'),
  ('359397748941850664', 'The Sex Lives of College Girls', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mindy Kaling, Justin Noble', null, 'Pauline Chalamet, Amrit Kaur, Alyah Chanelle Scott, Renika Williams, Christopher Meyer, Ilia Isorelýs Paulino, Gracie Lawrence, Mia Rodgers', 'TV-MA', 'Follow four college roommates as they arrive at New England''s prestigious Essex College. A bundle of contradictions and hormones, these girls are equal parts lovable and infuriating as they live out their new, free lives on campus.', 'Follow four college roommates as they arrive at New England''s prestigious Essex College. A bundle of contradictions and hormones, these girls are equal parts lovable and infuriating as they live out their new, free lives on campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wThMl6AhneaNw78XHC7fupBxNle.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:134373'),
  ('758635444660069513', 'The Shadow Line', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Hugo Blick', 'Hugo Blick', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Christopher Eccleston, Kierston Wareing, Stephen Rea, Rafe Spall, Eve Best, Lesley Sharp, Richard Lintern', null, 'A murder is investigated by both sides of the line, cops and criminals, using opposing methods. But the real line is the morality within each person and how far they will go before they cross it.', 'A murder is investigated by both sides of the line, cops and criminals, using opposing methods. But the real line is the morality within each person and how far they will go before they cross it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxpOOl38VgzCtC8tlKkgLsug52T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37602'),
  ('61741611996826315', 'The Shadow Team', 2021, 'War & Politics, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ethem Özışık', null, 'Tolga Sarıtaş, Rabia Soytürk, Yunus Emre Yıldırımer, Serdar Yeğin, Melisa Akman, Yakup Aksel', null, 'National Intelligence Organization members are always ready to serve to destroy the enemies of Türkiye.', 'National Intelligence Organization members are always ready to serve to destroy the enemies of Türkiye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ7kZ2KK8VlXCeFRluqSuFzbL3z.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:119806'),
  ('156795783157753361', 'The Shannara Chronicles', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar', null, 'Austin Butler, Ivana Baquero, Manu Bennett, Aaron Jakubenko, Marcus Vanco, Melise, Vanessa Morgan, Gentry White', 'TV-14', 'A young Healer armed with an unpredictable magic guides a runaway Elf in her perilous quest to save the peoples of the Four Lands from an age-old Demon scourge.', 'A young Healer armed with an unpredictable magic guides a runaway Elf in her perilous quest to save the peoples of the Four Lands from an age-old Demon scourge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzoaoBSMww5D22Kfrd2LEJumIzl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64122'),
  ('91576660145278278', 'The Share House''s Secret Rule', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mame Bozu, Satomi Miura, Hikaru Isshiki', null, 'After entering university, Ryota moves into a share house where he meets two stunningly beautiful sharemates, Momoka and Kanade. As the three of them begin to cohabitate together, they agree on one "secret rule." "If it''s just for a minute, you can touch whatever you want." Thus begins Ryota''s new life at the share house, where sweet temptation lies behind every door...!', 'After entering university, Ryota moves into a share house where he meets two stunningly beautiful sharemates, Momoka and Kanade. As the three of them begin to cohabitate together, they agree on one "secret rule." "If it''s just for a minute, you can touch whatever you want." Thus begins Ryota''s new life at the share house, where sweet temptation lies behind every door...!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chmCJiUJqhOpBKfJi88Rw2iB8IT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279120'),
  ('596181445615125254', 'The Shell Game', 1980, 'Drama', null, null, 'Patrick Tse Yin, Liza Wong Ming-Chuen, Chow Yun-Fat, Simon Yam, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Lau Siu-Ming, Leung Oi, Wong San', null, 'Set in 1930s Guangdong, when the gambling industry was in full bloom. One of the greatest gamblers in all of Southern China is Law Sei Hoi, who is dubbed as "Divine Eyes of the South" due to his keen eyesight, which he has used to win a great number of games. In addition to his recognition as a highly-skilled gambler, Law Sei Hoi is the owner of a number of casinos in Guangzhou. Tam Sing, an orphan, wanting to be a gambler himself, pursues Law Sei Hoi, asking him to accept him as a disciple. A blossoming romance begins to emerge between his teacher, Law Sei Hoi and his older sister, Tam Siu Tong, who is a well-known Cantonese opera singer. Hung Biu, the rival of Lo Sei Hoi and a gambling tycoon from Guangxi, however, plans to take over the Guangzhou gambling industry.', 'Set in 1930s Guangdong, when the gambling industry was in full bloom. One of the greatest gamblers in all of Southern China is Law Sei Hoi, who is dubbed as "Divine Eyes of the South" due to his keen eyesight, which he has used to win a great number of games. In addition to his recognition as a highly-skilled gambler, Law Sei Hoi is the owner of a number of casinos in Guangzhou. Tam Sing, an orphan, wanting to be a gambler himself, pursues Law Sei Hoi, asking him to accept him as a disciple. A blossoming romance begins to emerge between his teacher, Law Sei Hoi and his older sister, Tam Siu Tong, who is a well-known Cantonese opera singer. Hung Biu, the rival of Lo Sei Hoi and a gambling tycoon from Guangxi, however, plans to take over the Guangzhou gambling industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI1wWXwsgS3IgO8BWaidZoJM61n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81393'),
  ('784456652871831720', 'The Shield', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Shawn Ryan', null, 'Michael Chiklis, Catherine Dent, Paula Garcés, Walton Goggins, Michael Jace, Jay Karnes, Benito Martinez, David Marciano', 'TV-MA', 'The story of an inner-city Los Angeles police precinct where some of the cops aren''t above breaking the rules or working against their associates to both keep the streets safe and their self-interests intact.', 'The story of an inner-city Los Angeles police precinct where some of the cops aren''t above breaking the rules or working against their associates to both keep the streets safe and their self-interests intact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfdZXqqlFsPUEfi6kWWWthxw7Nz.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1414'),
  ('335038864191212832', 'The Shield and the Sword', 1968, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama', 'Vadim Kozhevnikov, Vladimir Basov', null, 'Stanislav Lyubshin, Oleg Yankovskiy, Juozas Budraitis, Aleksey Glazyrin, Alla Demidova, Algimantas Masiulis, Anatoliy Verbitskiy', null, 'The year is 1940 and Nazi Germany is at the height of its military prowess, having captured most of Europe and eyeing the Soviet Union to the East. The Russian military command suspects hostile intent from Germany and so arranges for its spies to infiltrate ranks of the German military and the SS. Alexander Belov is a Russian spy, who travels from Soviet-held Latvia to Nazi Germany under an alias of Johann Weiss. His mastery of the German language, steel nerves and an ability to manipulate others help him to use his connections in the SS to ascend the ladder of the German intelligence. He uses his position to identify sympathetic Germans, who help him to procure vital intelligence, and to help local resistance movements in their collective fight against Nazism.', 'The year is 1940 and Nazi Germany is at the height of its military prowess, having captured most of Europe and eyeing the Soviet Union to the East. The Russian military command suspects hostile intent from Germany and so arranges for its spies to infiltrate ranks of the German military and the SS. Alexander Belov is a Russian spy, who travels from Soviet-held Latvia to Nazi Germany under an alias of Johann Weiss. His mastery of the German language, steel nerves and an ability to manipulate others help him to use his connections in the SS to ascend the ladder of the German intelligence. He uses his position to identify sympathetic Germans, who help him to procure vital intelligence, and to help local resistance movements in their collective fight against Nazism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lAioQWVAOc5xmBLJL4pu10Y3EC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85114'),
  ('604973578555935550', 'The Shining', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Rebecca De Mornay, Steven Weber, Wil Horneff, Courtland Mead, Cynthia Garris', 'TV-14', 'A new caretaker moves with his family into the mysterious Overlook Hotel for the winter.', 'A new caretaker moves with his family into the mysterious Overlook Hotel for the winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YTH851DpQxoWFRu9gAYwPM56Yy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1867'),
  ('989499626000825865', 'The Ship of Theseus', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Daisuke Yamamuro, Yasuharu Ishii', null, 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Ryohei Suzuki, Juri Ueno, Nana Eikura, Masanobu Ando, Shihori Kanjiya, Ryo Ryusei, Yumi Aso', null, 'At the age of 10, Shin Tamura’s happy family life was torn apart when his policeman father was sentenced to death and imprisoned for murder. Now, some 30 years later, Shin is determined to prove his father’s innocence by solving the mystery at the heart of the case. Finding himself transported back in time, Shin must uncover the shocking truth, change the past, and restore his family’s happiness.', 'At the age of 10, Shin Tamura’s happy family life was torn apart when his policeman father was sentenced to death and imprisoned for murder. Now, some 30 years later, Shin is determined to prove his father’s innocence by solving the mystery at the heart of the case. Finding himself transported back in time, Shin must uncover the shocking truth, change the past, and restore his family’s happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/639Bew9z4ixDDoo4m7pJu3S7JOi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98929'),
  ('856890759113558975', 'The Shiunji Family Children', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuuichirou Umehara, Chika Anzai, Marika Kouno, Rie Takahashi, Hana Hishikawa, Kana Ichinose, Chiaki Kobayashi, Masaki Terasoma', null, 'The Shiunji family with their seven children reside in a mansion within Tokyo’s Setagaya ward. The eldest son, Arata, is tired of being pushed around by his five sisters and daydreams of a life without them. That is, until Arata’s father reveals a shocking truth—Arata isn’t biologically related to his sisters! The siblings’ relationships will be tested as they navigate life in this new light.', 'The Shiunji family with their seven children reside in a mansion within Tokyo’s Setagaya ward. The eldest son, Arata, is tired of being pushed around by his five sisters and daydreams of a life without them. That is, until Arata’s father reveals a shocking truth—Arata isn’t biologically related to his sisters! The siblings’ relationships will be tested as they navigate life in this new light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvhXMejlXyOUo24we09pXSgKw5j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261091'),
  ('241229748341775492', 'The Shivering Truth', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Vernon Chatman', 'Vernon Chatman', 'Vernon Chatman', 'TV-MA', 'A miniature propulsive omnibus clusterbomb of painfully riotous daymares all dripping with the orange goo of dream logic. A series of loosely linked emotional parables about stories within tales that crawled out of the deepest caverns of your unconscious mind and became lovingly animated in breath-slapping stop motion - in other words, it is the truth.', 'A miniature propulsive omnibus clusterbomb of painfully riotous daymares all dripping with the orange goo of dream logic. A series of loosely linked emotional parables about stories within tales that crawled out of the deepest caverns of your unconscious mind and became lovingly animated in breath-slapping stop motion - in other words, it is the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41r0yzrZOrnL1U8v5I19F0hXWlF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85000'),
  ('637012339848426030', 'The Shop', 2018, 'Talk', 'Paul Rivera', null, 'Maverick Carter, LeBron James', 'TV-PG', 'A one-of-a-kind barbershop experience with unfiltered conversation and debate from the biggest names in sports and entertainment.', 'A one-of-a-kind barbershop experience with unfiltered conversation and debate from the biggest names in sports and entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhISN0ewMkjqKxBQAeo2QkLFTnm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:81187'),
  ('710192026392754242', 'The Short Life', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor', 'Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor', 'Carlos Scholz, Alicia Armenteros, Javier Gutiérrez, Leonor Watling, Jorge Usón, Héctor Carballo, Pepe Viyuela, Eric Masip', null, 'Like any young man, Louis is about to experience great changes. He is married to an unknown cousin and is to inherit the throne of Spain. In the middle of the 18th century, this would be a happy episode in the life of any prince, but things are not going to be easy for Louis. With a rebellious wife, an alienated father and a conspiring stepmother, Louis I has to begin his reign. Luckily for him, the problems will soon end.', 'Like any young man, Louis is about to experience great changes. He is married to an unknown cousin and is to inherit the throne of Spain. In the middle of the 18th century, this would be a happy episode in the life of any prince, but things are not going to be easy for Louis. With a rebellious wife, an alienated father and a conspiring stepmother, Louis I has to begin his reign. Luckily for him, the problems will soon end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfdKC0zg8MvEYgE2NZsHbw3WvgL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243790'),
  ('620274127057956909', 'The Shrink Next Door', 2021, 'Drama', 'Georgia Pritchett', null, 'Paul Rudd, Will Ferrell, Kathryn Hahn, Casey Wilson, Cornell Womack, Robin Bartlett', 'TV-MA', 'Inspired by the true story of Marty and the therapist who turned his life around...then took it over. When he first meets Dr. Ike, Marty just wants to get better at boundaries. Over 30 years, he''ll learn all about them—and what happens when they get crossed.', 'Inspired by the true story of Marty and the therapist who turned his life around...then took it over. When he first meets Dr. Ike, Marty just wants to get better at boundaries. Over 30 years, he''ll learn all about them—and what happens when they get crossed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61GjPSU2HNAsdCVccSQEcdQHy1f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102540'),
  ('1094434499282982870', 'The Shy Hero and the Assassin Princesses', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shunsuke Takeuchi, Iori Saeki, Hitomi Ueda, Haruka Shiraishi', 'TV-14', 'The hero Toto has talent, but his shyness has prevented him from forming a party. As he languishes in the town of origins, three beautiful women—Ciel, Anemone, and Goa—invite Toto to join their party out of the blue. Toto gears up to begin the journey, but unbeknownst to him, all three women are plotting to kill him for their own reasons!', 'The hero Toto has talent, but his shyness has prevented him from forming a party. As he languishes in the town of origins, three beautiful women—Ciel, Anemone, and Goa—invite Toto to join their party out of the blue. Toto gears up to begin the journey, but unbeknownst to him, all three women are plotting to kill him for their own reasons!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgfSkXh8UOCPhVBN7nGtaoe89YJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283705'),
  ('750629368379554873', 'The Sign', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'I-Rain-Yia', null, 'Patchanon Ounsa-ard, Tanatat Phanviriyakool, Jakarin Puribhat, Phongsakorn Sukiang, Nuttapart Tuntistinchai, Asavarid Pinitkanjanapun, Pittikorn Siripornsawan, Akarat Nimitchai', null, 'Two men join a high-stakes special ops team to solve supernatural crimes, while a hidden connection from their past lives complicates everything.', 'Two men join a high-stakes special ops team to solve supernatural crimes, while a hidden connection from their past lives complicates everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqAjpdhw3vMNgyMwOJ0C29q9Vb5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237411'),
  ('692664437091305899', 'The Signal', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Florian David Fitz, Peri Baumeister, Yuna Bennett', 'TV-MA', 'A missing astronaut sets her family on a frantic hunt for answers. But the more they uncover, the greater the threat becomes to them — and the world.', 'A missing astronaut sets her family on a frantic hunt for answers. But the more they uncover, the greater the threat becomes to them — and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoDYkBwRtOZPwLPaqPxXTQx0WZk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241473'),
  ('949743157269582505', 'The Signing', 2023, 'Reality', 'Lex Borrero', null, 'Rauw Alejandro, Yandel, Lex Borrero, Nicki Nicole, Tainy', 'TV-MA', 'In this competition, young artists must impress Latin American music icons such as Rauw Alejandro, Nicki Nicole and Yandel to get the contract of a lifetime.', 'In this competition, young artists must impress Latin American music icons such as Rauw Alejandro, Nicki Nicole and Yandel to get the contract of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afcfxkHgfTAaWSdGQAHBIrdxtN9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223669'),
  ('147530094053916334', 'The Silence', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Fiona Seres', 'Hugh Bonneville, Dervla Kirwan, Gina McKee, Rebecca Oldfield, Harry Ferrier, Josette Simon, Nick Nevern, Tom Kane', 'NR', 'A deaf girl witnesses the audacious murder of a policewoman.', 'A deaf girl witnesses the audacious murder of a policewoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKnPW5MAYYS4IM4patSQ66LIlI7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33267'),
  ('409270147780801525', 'The Silence', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Marjan Alčevski', null, 'Kseniia Mishyna, Goran Bogdan, Darko Milas, Sandra Lončarić, Leon Lučev, Tihana Lazović, Mijo Jurišić, Iryna Verenych-Ostrovska', null, 'Dramatic events unfold in Croatia and Ukraine. The first girl drowned, the second one died from a drug overdose. The main suspect in these deaths, however, soon turns out to be innocent - and dead too. While detective Vladimir and reporter Stribor struggle to solve these murders in Croatia, the niece of Olga, an Ukrainian philanthropist, goes missing in Kyiv.', 'Dramatic events unfold in Croatia and Ukraine. The first girl drowned, the second one died from a drug overdose. The main suspect in these deaths, however, soon turns out to be innocent - and dead too. While detective Vladimir and reporter Stribor struggle to solve these murders in Croatia, the niece of Olga, an Ukrainian philanthropist, goes missing in Kyiv.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbRIm9uUuSBePntaV3ot2d5QfTa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153459'),
  ('1069620991167818100', 'The Silent Noise', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Angelica Panganiban, Zanjoe Marudo, Mutya Orquia, Zaijian Jaranilla, KD Omalin, Mylene Dizon, Joem Bascon, Joel Saracho', null, 'In the coastal town of Escondido, Eli, a deaf, 10-year-old child, struggles to make sense of the sudden death of his beloved teacher, Sam Ignacio. As police investigate further, suspicion falls on his family. While they search for the truth, Eli watches his home crumble as devastating secrets unravel.', 'In the coastal town of Escondido, Eli, a deaf, 10-year-old child, struggles to make sense of the sudden death of his beloved teacher, Sam Ignacio. As police investigate further, suspicion falls on his family. While they search for the truth, Eli watches his home crumble as devastating secrets unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLbVOaMwwSmJUxSbiA89bj6ZM6v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314531'),
  ('1111298921420327918', 'The Silent Sea', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Park Eun-kyo, Choi Hang-yong', null, 'Bae Doona, Gong Yoo, Lee Joon, Kim Sun-young, Lee Mu-saeng, Lee Sung-wook, Jung Soon-won, Choi Young-woo', 'TV-MA', 'During a perilous 24-hour mission on the moon, space explorers try to retrieve samples from an abandoned research facility steeped in classified secrets.', 'During a perilous 24-hour mission on the moon, space explorers try to retrieve samples from an abandoned research facility steeped in classified secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFT0IgqtCOks4munDTxQwkvNJkd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96777'),
  ('320530631933663234', 'The Silent Service', 2024, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Takao Osawa, Hiroshi Tamaki, Aya Ueto, Yusuke Santamaria, Tomoya Nakamura, Aoi Nakamura, Koudai Matsuoka, Kou Maehara', null, 'An MSDF submarine collides with a U.S. nuclear submarine, crushing all 76 people on board, including its CO, Shiro Kaieda. However, the crew survives. The accident is a cover story to get the MSDF submarine''s crew on board the Seabat, a nuclear submarine secretly built by the Japanese and U.S. governments. However, Kaieda loads the Seabat with nuclear missiles and suddenly mutinies and flees.', 'An MSDF submarine collides with a U.S. nuclear submarine, crushing all 76 people on board, including its CO, Shiro Kaieda. However, the crew survives. The accident is a cover story to get the MSDF submarine''s crew on board the Seabat, a nuclear submarine secretly built by the Japanese and U.S. governments. However, Kaieda loads the Seabat with nuclear missiles and suddenly mutinies and flees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TZa3muX3y0BSVmtdI4iU3vOKIl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244814'),
  ('991277734919296016', 'The Silent Valley', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Vlad Balan, Theodor Șoptelea, Adrian Păduraru, Alexandra Fasola, Ioan Tiberiu Dobrică, Mihaela Trofimov, Emilian Oprea, Ovidiu Niculescu', 'TV-MA', 'Filip and Horia are two teenagers who seem like two usual friends, but after they spend the night in Horia''s cabin, they discover their mutual attraction and they engage in an affair. After a car stops by the cabin, the two realize that they''ve become witnesses to a multiple homicide. Being afraid that by confessing, their relationshop will surface, the two choose to remain silent, but their secret will become harder and harder to keep and they''ll find themselves in a frightening series of events.', 'Filip and Horia are two teenagers who seem like two usual friends, but after they spend the night in Horia''s cabin, they discover their mutual attraction and they engage in an affair. After a car stops by the cabin, the two realize that they''ve become witnesses to a multiple homicide. Being afraid that by confessing, their relationshop will surface, the two choose to remain silent, but their secret will become harder and harder to keep and they''ll find themselves in a frightening series of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OvDDv8jFfFHEtsJmStK9AnHhqD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68378'),
  ('572525542699411333', 'The Silver Guardian', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Yang Ning, Tang Xiaoxi, Qiao Shiyu, Zhang Zhe, Baomu Zhongyang', 'TV-14', 'Lu Shuiyin (Riku Suigin in Japanese) is a master of gaming, a skill only known to his classmate Lu Lian (Riku Lin in Japanese). One day, Shuiyin receives a device from Lu Lian for a tomb raiding online game. While Shuiyin is excited to receive the device, Lian is suddenly kidnapped. Shuiyin touches the device that was left behind, pulling him inside the game and trapping him there. What is the imaginary world inside the device? What will Shuiyin find there? It is a world where two groups of people fight over the power of the gods, which originates from the tomb the mother goddess Pangu (Bango in Japanese). The two groups are the tomb raiders and the tomb protectors. The device Shuiyin received from Lian is called the Monolith, and it allows a normal gamer to go near the tomb. The tomb raiding group plans its attack by recruiting common people in the name of gaming. Shuiyin, as the final tomb protector, must fight against the raiders in order to save Lian.', 'Lu Shuiyin (Riku Suigin in Japanese) is a master of gaming, a skill only known to his classmate Lu Lian (Riku Lin in Japanese). One day, Shuiyin receives a device from Lu Lian for a tomb raiding online game. While Shuiyin is excited to receive the device, Lian is suddenly kidnapped. Shuiyin touches the device that was left behind, pulling him inside the game and trapping him there. What is the imaginary world inside the device? What will Shuiyin find there? It is a world where two groups of people fight over the power of the gods, which originates from the tomb the mother goddess Pangu (Bango in Japanese). The two groups are the tomb raiders and the tomb protectors. The device Shuiyin received from Lian is called the Monolith, and it allows a normal gamer to go near the tomb. The tomb raiding group plans its attack by recruiting common people in the name of gaming. Shuiyin, as the final tomb protector, must fight against the raiders in order to save Lian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsI06e3SbgKpn6cy5tp1qPzfrdf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71005'),
  ('266466451229346556', 'The Simple Life', 2003, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Jonathan Murray, Mary-Ellis Bunim', null, 'Nicole Richie, Paris Hilton', null, 'The Simple Life is an American reality television series. The series aired from December 2, 2003 to August 5, 2007. The first three seasons aired on Fox, and the final two on E!. The series depicts two wealthy socialites, Paris Hilton and Nicole Richie, as they struggle to do manual, low-paying jobs such as cleaning rooms, farm work, serving meals in fast-food restaurants and working as camp counselors.', 'The Simple Life is an American reality television series. The series aired from December 2, 2003 to August 5, 2007. The first three seasons aired on Fox, and the final two on E!. The series depicts two wealthy socialites, Paris Hilton and Nicole Richie, as they struggle to do manual, low-paying jobs such as cleaning rooms, farm work, serving meals in fast-food restaurants and working as camp counselors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXNd06zlKk2Pl7dF7PNq7tsGvje.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4406'),
  ('461893348949303972', 'The Simpsons', 1989, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Groening', null, 'Dan Castellaneta, Julie Kavner, Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Hank Azaria, Harry Shearer', 'TV-14', 'Set in Springfield, the average American town, the show focuses on the antics and everyday adventures of the Simpson family; Homer, Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie, as well as a virtual cast of thousands. Since the beginning, the series has been a pop culture icon, attracting hundreds of celebrities to guest star. The show has also made name for itself in its fearless satirical take on politics, media and American life in general.', 'Set in Springfield, the average American town, the show focuses on the antics and everyday adventures of the Simpson family; Homer, Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie, as well as a virtual cast of thousands. Since the beginning, the series has been a pop culture icon, attracting hundreds of celebrities to guest star. The show has also made name for itself in its fearless satirical take on politics, media and American life in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWpG7GqfKGQqX4YMAo3nv5OrglV.jpg', 37, 'tmdb:tv:456'),
  ('656460158535157290', 'The Simulators', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Alejandro Calva, Rubén Zamora, Arath de la Torre, Tony Dalton', 'NR', 'A remake of the Argentine series of the same name about a group of four partners who solve common problems through advanced simulation operations.', 'A remake of the Argentine series of the same name about a group of four partners who solve common problems through advanced simulation operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pAkIDpMZXf4AiMLxIJjJBCozo9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62302'),
  ('649924781742033450', 'The Singing Detective', 1986, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Dennis Potter', null, 'Michael Gambon, Joanne Whalley, David Ryall, Sharon D. Clarke, Gerard Horan, Ron Cook, George Rossi', null, 'Tormented and bedridden by a debilitating disease, a mystery writer relives his detective stories through his imagination and hallucinations.', 'Tormented and bedridden by a debilitating disease, a mystery writer relives his detective stories through his imagination and hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xUAh6d239ABRU8KiTqXOijNPuJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:658'),
