  ('591917881227259534', 'The Three Sides of Ana', 2016, 'Soap, Drama', 'Juan Carlos Alcalá', null, 'Angelique Boyer, Sebastián Rulli, David Zepeda, Susana Dosamantes, Ramiro Fumazoni, Ana Bertha Espín, Roberto Ballesteros, Leticia Perdigón', 'TV-14', 'Over a road trip, triplets Ana Laura, Ana Leticia, and Ana Lucía, along with their parents, suffer a dramatic accident crashing by the side of a river. The consequences of this event are catastrophic: Both parents die, Ana Laura loses one leg, and Ana Lucía, unconscious, is dragged by the river’s flow. Only Ana Leticia, who actually caused the accident, emerges unscathed. Soledad, a woman who was seriously hurt after her daughter’s death, helps Ana Lucía, whom she finds agonizing. Although Soledad discovers who the girl is, she takes advantage of her memory loss regarding the accident and her family and decides to keep her, making her believe she is her mother. Despite everyone declares Ana Lucía is death, Ernestina, the triplets'' grandmother, and Ramiro, their uncle, don’t give up and do everything they can to find Ana Lucía. But years go by, the same as their wishful', 'Over a road trip, triplets Ana Laura, Ana Leticia, and Ana Lucía, along with their parents, suffer a dramatic accident crashing by the side of a river. The consequences of this event are catastrophic: Both parents die, Ana Laura loses one leg, and Ana Lucía, unconscious, is dragged by the river’s flow. Only Ana Leticia, who actually caused the accident, emerges unscathed. Soledad, a woman who was seriously hurt after her daughter’s death, helps Ana Lucía, whom she finds agonizing. Although Soledad discovers who the girl is, she takes advantage of her memory loss regarding the accident and her family and decides to keep her, making her believe she is her mother. Despite everyone declares Ana Lucía is death, Ernestina, the triplets'' grandmother, and Ramiro, their uncle, don’t give up and do everything they can to find Ana Lucía. But years go by, the same as their wishful', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHURRha9cvKI6LaFVl7gbfEaGjt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66579'),
  ('508248896830869749', 'The Three-Body Problem', 2022, 'Mystery, War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, 'Ruan Rui, 赵佳星, 纪敬', 'Ma Zhengyang, Fan Zhechen, Duan Yixuan, Zhao Chengchen, Yang Mo, Zhen Zhao, Shuiyu Tang, 高增志', null, 'A science-fiction drama adapted from the novel of the same name by the famous science fiction writer Liu Cixin. “Three-Body Problem” tells the story of nanomaterials scientist Wang Miao and criminal police Shi Qiang who jointly unveiled the mystery of the “Three-Body Problem” world of an extraterrestrial civilization..', 'A science-fiction drama adapted from the novel of the same name by the famous science fiction writer Liu Cixin. “Three-Body Problem” tells the story of nanomaterials scientist Wang Miao and criminal police Shi Qiang who jointly unveiled the mystery of the “Three-Body Problem” world of an extraterrestrial civilization..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IpjdDLbvDZg2EO3DDqqa01QknQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97113'),
  ('605668001128954622', 'The Three-Body Problem in Minecraft', 2014, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Li Zhenyi, Liu Cixin', 'Liu Cixin, Feng Xiaoyang', null, null, 'The Three-Body Problem in Minecraft (Chinese: 我的三体; pinyin: Wǒdè Sāntǐ; lit. ''My Three-Body'') is a Chinese network animated series based on the science fiction novels "The Three-Body Problem" and "The Dark Forest" by Liu Cixin. Initially, the animation was an unofficial machinima doujin work, but from the second season onwards, it became an official adaptation.', 'The Three-Body Problem in Minecraft (Chinese: 我的三体; pinyin: Wǒdè Sāntǐ; lit. ''My Three-Body'') is a Chinese network animated series based on the science fiction novels "The Three-Body Problem" and "The Dark Forest" by Liu Cixin. Initially, the animation was an unofficial machinima doujin work, but from the second season onwards, it became an official adaptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZUio8U3OwiNOAE33naAFmeHRUQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:100363'),
  ('419863095355555894', 'The Three-eyed One', 1990, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, 'Naoko Matsui, Kazue Ikura, Kenichi Ogata, Show Hayami, Megumi Tano, Shunsuke Shima, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'The Three-Eyed One is a romance SF manga by Osamu Tezuka. It was originally serialized in Weekly Shōnen Magazine from 7 July 1974 through 19 March 1978 and was later published into thirteen tankōbon by Kodansha. This story is about Hosuke Sharaku, the heir to the long lost super civilization of the "Three Eyed Ones", and his best friend, Chiyoko Wato, with whom he solves various problems, often of his own doing. In 1977, The Three-Eyed One tied with another Tezuka manga, Black Jack, for the Kodansha Manga Award. The manga has since spawned a TV special by Shueisha and later an anime whose 48 episodes ran from 18 October 1990 through 26 September 1991. The main character appears in three video games: Mittsume ga Tooru by Natsume on the MSX in 1989, Mittsume ga Tooru/The Three-Eyed One by Tomy on the NES in 1992, Astro Boy: Omega Factor by Sega on the Game Boy Advance and Astro Boy by Sega on the PlayStation 2.', 'The Three-Eyed One is a romance SF manga by Osamu Tezuka. It was originally serialized in Weekly Shōnen Magazine from 7 July 1974 through 19 March 1978 and was later published into thirteen tankōbon by Kodansha. This story is about Hosuke Sharaku, the heir to the long lost super civilization of the "Three Eyed Ones", and his best friend, Chiyoko Wato, with whom he solves various problems, often of his own doing. In 1977, The Three-Eyed One tied with another Tezuka manga, Black Jack, for the Kodansha Manga Award. The manga has since spawned a TV special by Shueisha and later an anime whose 48 episodes ran from 18 October 1990 through 26 September 1991. The main character appears in three video games: Mittsume ga Tooru by Natsume on the MSX in 1989, Mittsume ga Tooru/The Three-Eyed One by Tomy on the NES in 1992, Astro Boy: Omega Factor by Sega on the Game Boy Advance and Astro Boy by Sega on the PlayStation 2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWzQrGe3sfjoAvLNZbVErNNA3Kj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34853'),
  ('214920046499882078', 'The Thunder', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Johnny Huang, Wu Gang, Wang Jinsong, Simon Yam, Li Mozhi, Zhang Xilin, Ma Yujie, Gong Lei', null, 'A father and son represent two generations of policemen as they risk their lives in the war against drugs.', 'A father and son represent two generations of policemen as they risk their lives in the war against drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5KgRjyfj6ijWx9c50epUQ3gcug.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89216'),
  ('809024073542427243', 'The Thundermans', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jed Spingarn', null, 'Kira Kosarin, Jack Griffo, Addison Riecke, Diego Velazquez, Chris Tallman, Rosa Blasi, Maya Le Clark, Edward Chiodo', 'TV-G', 'Meet The Thundermans, a typical suburban family that happens to have astounding superpowers. At the center of the action are the 14-year-old Thunderman twins, who share the same bathroom, the same school, and the same annoying little siblings. Their only difference? The sister is a super student with a super sunny disposition who super looks forward to being a superhero someday, and her twin brother is a super villain.', 'Meet The Thundermans, a typical suburban family that happens to have astounding superpowers. At the center of the action are the 14-year-old Thunderman twins, who share the same bathroom, the same school, and the same annoying little siblings. Their only difference? The sister is a super student with a super sunny disposition who super looks forward to being a superhero someday, and her twin brother is a super villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tIYEyjK1LLcX0jYK3ZouT7601o.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:58981'),
  ('392258935278938331', 'The Thundermans: Undercover', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jed Spingarn', null, 'Kira Kosarin, Jack Griffo, Maya Le Clark, Nathan Broxton, Kinley Cunningham, Daran Norris, Dana Snyder', null, 'Twins Phoebe and Max Thunderman embark on a mission to alleviate the threat in the seaside town of Secret Shores, as well as helping Chloe develop her superhero abilities by bringing her along on their undercover mission. Chloe forms a bond with two classmates while they investigate suspicious activity coming from the local school, who don’t realize their new friend has secret powers. As the danger increases, the Thunderman trio must stay in town indefinitely, leaving the squabbling twins in charge of raising their younger sister.', 'Twins Phoebe and Max Thunderman embark on a mission to alleviate the threat in the seaside town of Secret Shores, as well as helping Chloe develop her superhero abilities by bringing her along on their undercover mission. Chloe forms a bond with two classmates while they investigate suspicious activity coming from the local school, who don’t realize their new friend has secret powers. As the danger increases, the Thunderman trio must stay in town indefinitely, leaving the squabbling twins in charge of raising their younger sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeynuCJTLvZBpNYtAzi5clXfBiq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:254653'),
  ('462404984195140636', 'The Tick', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Ben Edlund', null, 'Townsend Coleman, Rob Paulsen, Kay Lenz, Cam Clarke, Jess Harnell', 'TV-Y7', 'Attention Evil-doers! The Tick is here, and he’s wearing the blue tights of justice! Together with his trusty moth-costumed sidekick Arthur, The Tick keeps the streets of The City safe from a rogue’s gallery of hilariously malevolent villains. So grab a snack, put your feet up and get ready to laugh and cheer as everyone’s favorite brawny hero swats evil on the snout with the rolled-up newspaper of goodness!', 'Attention Evil-doers! The Tick is here, and he’s wearing the blue tights of justice! Together with his trusty moth-costumed sidekick Arthur, The Tick keeps the streets of The City safe from a rogue’s gallery of hilariously malevolent villains. So grab a snack, put your feet up and get ready to laugh and cheer as everyone’s favorite brawny hero swats evil on the snout with the rolled-up newspaper of goodness!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRme2aeGyDwel0e9NSPx9FzIPq9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14540'),
  ('442004557555568658', 'The Tick', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Ben Edlund', null, 'Patrick Warburton, David Burke, Liz Vassey, Nestor Carbonell', 'TV-PG', 'Based on Ben Edlund''s cult comic, a mysterious blue avenger teams up with an odd group of superheroes to fight crime.', 'Based on Ben Edlund''s cult comic, a mysterious blue avenger teams up with an odd group of superheroes to fight crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oy2Wr3XtH0UybnnQPjJUjU5Jsyf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14651'),
  ('329043226984981021', 'The Tick', 2016, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Ben Edlund', null, 'Peter Serafinowicz, Griffin Newman, Valorie Curry, Brendan Hines, Yara Martinez, Scott Speiser', 'TV-MA', 'In a world where superheroes have been real for decades, an accountant with zero powers comes to realize his city is owned by a super villain. As he struggles to uncover this conspiracy, he falls in league with a strange blue superhero.', 'In a world where superheroes have been real for decades, an accountant with zero powers comes to realize his city is owned by a super villain. As he struggles to uncover this conspiracy, he falls in league with a strange blue superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sngJVF54bugHfCkjJOsY4wx8Hk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67487'),
  ('408489238250043022', 'The Tiger and Her Wings', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sairi Ito, Yuriko Ishida, Takashi Okabe, Taiga Nakano, Misato Morita, Machiko Ono, Kaoru Kobayashi, Kenichi Matsuyama', null, 'In the early Showa era, Japan’s first women’s law school opens, and the protagonist, Inotsume Tomoko (Ito Sairi), gains nationwide attention as one of the first female lawyers in the country. However, after facing wartime Japan’s harsh realities and losing everything, she becomes a judge with her legal knowledge and dedicates herself to establishing the family court. She stands passionately for the hardships that politics and economics cannot solve.', 'In the early Showa era, Japan’s first women’s law school opens, and the protagonist, Inotsume Tomoko (Ito Sairi), gains nationwide attention as one of the first female lawyers in the country. However, after facing wartime Japan’s harsh realities and losing everything, she becomes a judge with her legal knowledge and dedicates herself to establishing the family court. She stands passionately for the hardships that politics and economics cannot solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irBSwW1PcffauuFPem9hz2iEJtc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244462'),
  ('719702737763242927', 'The TikTok Killer', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'José Jurado Montilla', 'TV-MA', 'When Esther vanishes without a trace, her family is able to piece together her last movements thanks to José Jurado Montilla, a traveler who journeys across Spain sharing heartfelt videos of his trips on his TikTok account. But “Dynamite” Montilla – the last person to have been with Esther – hides a dark past', 'When Esther vanishes without a trace, her family is able to piece together her last movements thanks to José Jurado Montilla, a traveler who journeys across Spain sharing heartfelt videos of his trips on his TikTok account. But “Dynamite” Montilla – the last person to have been with Esther – hides a dark past', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sZfTsu02nhCoIEGdyQ2iYK09JN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313338'),
  ('640126827714640883', 'The Time in Between', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Adriana Ugarte, Tristán Ulloa, Peter Vives', 'TV-14', 'Sira Quiroga is a young Spanish dressmaker engaged to a solid suitor when a suave typewriter salesman upends her life. Spain is being upended by a civil war and the new regime''s growing alliances with Nazi Germany. Sira, smart, gutsy and resourceful with a Scarlett O''Hara-like ability to whip up designer duds on a moment''s notice, Sira has spunk. Sira gains and loses a small fortune, is dumped by her cad of a lover in Morocco, runs guns to get the cash to start her life anew and becomes couturier to the Nazi wives stationed in Madrid. Urged on by her friend, the real-life British spy Rosalinda Fox, Sira, too, aids the British cause.', 'Sira Quiroga is a young Spanish dressmaker engaged to a solid suitor when a suave typewriter salesman upends her life. Spain is being upended by a civil war and the new regime''s growing alliances with Nazi Germany. Sira, smart, gutsy and resourceful with a Scarlett O''Hara-like ability to whip up designer duds on a moment''s notice, Sira has spunk. Sira gains and loses a small fortune, is dumped by her cad of a lover in Morocco, runs guns to get the cash to start her life anew and becomes couturier to the Nazi wives stationed in Madrid. Urged on by her friend, the real-life British spy Rosalinda Fox, Sira, too, aids the British cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHEsG18uciqj9bw6OVs8KtqeOpE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63485'),
  ('646643342909361313', 'The Time It Takes', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Inés Pintor, Nadia de Santiago, Pablo Santidrián', null, 'Nadia de Santiago, Álvaro Cervantes', 'TV-MA', 'Lina and Nico break up after many years together, and Lina struggles to find a new life and to think about him a little less each day.', 'Lina and Nico break up after many years together, and Lina struggles to find a new life and to think about him a little less each day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5mrhRIJKjSIwuwSMnCh4TVyZYc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127426'),
  ('714175983896399553', 'The Time Traveler''s Wife', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Steven Moffat', null, 'Rose Leslie, Theo James, Natasha Lopez, Desmin Borges, Caitlin Shorey, Everleigh McDonell, Peter Graham, Michael Park', 'TV-MA', 'The intricate and magical love story of Clare and Henry, and a marriage with a problem… time travel.', 'The intricate and magical love story of Clare and Henry, and a marriage with a problem… time travel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwPIGO0tCcCZKWHwTOHOu5FGj0k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81322'),
  ('811989968792604823', 'The Time Tunnel', 1966, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Irwin Allen', null, 'James Darren, Robert Colbert, Whit Bissell, Lee Meriwether, John Zaremba', 'TV-G', 'The Time Tunnel is a 1966–1967 U.S. color science fiction TV series, written around a theme of time travel adventure. The show was creator-producer Irwin Allen''s third science fiction television series, released by 20th Century Fox and broadcast on ABC. The show ran for one season of 30 episodes. Reruns are viewable on cable and by internet streaming. A pilot for a new series was produced in 2002, although it was not picked up.', 'The Time Tunnel is a 1966–1967 U.S. color science fiction TV series, written around a theme of time travel adventure. The show was creator-producer Irwin Allen''s third science fiction television series, released by 20th Century Fox and broadcast on ABC. The show ran for one season of 30 episodes. Reruns are viewable on cable and by internet streaming. A pilot for a new series was produced in 2002, although it was not picked up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E3Ncd9iLWqi8m1GcdkU5bSwOnS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103'),
  ('460638323097416458', 'The Time We Were Not in Love', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', null, 'Jung Do-yoon, Lee Ha-na', 'Ha Ji-won, Lee Jin-uk, Yoon Kyun-sang, Choo Soo-hyun, Shin Jung-keun, Seo Ju-hee, Lee Ju-seung, Jin Kyung', null, 'A drama about the growing pains of turning thirty for two longtime friends.', 'A drama about the growing pains of turning thirty for two longtime friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcmzZ5MI0f4NGaYOcHfHBQaIlio.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62925'),
  ('1098298810764097613', 'The Titan Games', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dwayne Johnson', 'TV-PG', 'Dwayne Johnson redefines the athletic competition, giving exceptional men and women from all walks of life the chance to test their physical strength and mental fortitude for the chance to battle on Mount Olympus in hopes of becoming a Titan.', 'Dwayne Johnson redefines the athletic competition, giving exceptional men and women from all walks of life the chance to test their physical strength and mental fortitude for the chance to battle on Mount Olympus in hopes of becoming a Titan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEs94sKekYmUjHKN2c9Untznq9J.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85487'),
  ('608262338269865923', 'The Titan''s Bride', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kent Ito, Noriko Fujimoto, Yuki Ono, Yusuke Shirai, Masatomo Nakazawa', 'TV-MA', 'Koichi, a student about to graduate, is summoned to a world of Titans. It''s the land of Tildant, where the prince, Caius, appears in front of Koichi and says, "I want you to be my bride and give birth to my baby!"', 'Koichi, a student about to graduate, is summoned to a world of Titans. It''s the land of Tildant, where the prince, Caius, appears in front of Koichi and says, "I want you to be my bride and give birth to my baby!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYaYGcY4lNLkvuxYupTRwRrnaqQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103830'),
  ('433825376568443049', 'The Tom and Jerry Comedy Show', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lou Scheimer', 'TV-G', 'The Tom and Jerry Comedy Show is an animated television program produced by Filmation for MGM Television in 1980, on CBS for Saturday mornings. The show lasted one season and the individual episodes were eventually added to syndicated Tom and Jerry packages, and also occasionally appeared on Cartoon Network and Boomerang. Most voices were done by Frank Welker and Lou Scheimer.', 'The Tom and Jerry Comedy Show is an animated television program produced by Filmation for MGM Television in 1980, on CBS for Saturday mornings. The show lasted one season and the individual episodes were eventually added to syndicated Tom and Jerry packages, and also occasionally appeared on Cartoon Network and Boomerang. Most voices were done by Frank Welker and Lou Scheimer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4usKsUnNy3DYkrEGC8EXe3bQ8PV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14705'),
  ('1002085805966904406', 'The Tom and Jerry Show', 1975, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'John Stephenson, Don Messick, Joe E. Ross', null, 'The New Tom & Jerry Show is an animated television series produced for Saturday mornings by Hanna-Barbera Productions in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television in 1975 for ABC based on the theatrical shorts and characters Tom and Jerry.', 'The New Tom & Jerry Show is an animated television series produced for Saturday mornings by Hanna-Barbera Productions in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television in 1975 for ABC based on the theatrical shorts and characters Tom and Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olhPG4SHIZuDngkQtKJBOMK9BiQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7842'),
  ('186436478026312948', 'The Tom and Jerry Show', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Rick Zieff, Kath Soucie, Grey DeLisle, Stephen Stanton, Joey D''Auria, Gary Cole, Sam Kwasman', 'TV-PG', 'The iconic cat and mouse rivals are back in a fresh take on the classic series. Preserving the look, characters and sensibility of the original, this series shines a brightly colored, high-definition lens on the madcap slapstick and never-ending battle that has made Tom and Jerry two of the most beloved characters of all time.', 'The iconic cat and mouse rivals are back in a fresh take on the classic series. Preserving the look, characters and sensibility of the original, this series shines a brightly colored, high-definition lens on the madcap slapstick and never-ending battle that has made Tom and Jerry two of the most beloved characters of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41EWXLXTZO4MLb2BL28mWZuydyq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:47480'),
  ('942218031284308247', 'The Tom Green Show', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Tom Green', null, 'Phil Giroux, Tom Green', null, 'Comedy Network''s Tom Green Show. The Tom Green Show is a North American television show that first aired in September 1994 on Rogers Television 22, a community channel in Ottawa, Ontario, until 1996, and was later picked up by The Comedy Network in 1997 and debuted on February 13, 1998. The first season was 13 episodes. The second season of 13 episodes began on December 4, 1998. In January 1999, the show moved to the United States and aired on MTV. The MTV show stopped production when Green was diagnosed with testicular cancer in March 2000, but continued to appear on the channel via reruns and other promotional materials. In 2002, it was ranked #41 on TV Guide''s 50 Worst TV Shows of All Time. In 2003, the show was revived as The New Tom Green Show. In 2006, Green launched Tom Green Live, a live call-in show for his website. Later renamed Tom Green''s House Tonight, the show takes place in his living room.', 'Comedy Network''s Tom Green Show. The Tom Green Show is a North American television show that first aired in September 1994 on Rogers Television 22, a community channel in Ottawa, Ontario, until 1996, and was later picked up by The Comedy Network in 1997 and debuted on February 13, 1998. The first season was 13 episodes. The second season of 13 episodes began on December 4, 1998. In January 1999, the show moved to the United States and aired on MTV. The MTV show stopped production when Green was diagnosed with testicular cancer in March 2000, but continued to appear on the channel via reruns and other promotional materials. In 2002, it was ranked #41 on TV Guide''s 50 Worst TV Shows of All Time. In 2003, the show was revived as The New Tom Green Show. In 2006, Green launched Tom Green Live, a live call-in show for his website. Later renamed Tom Green''s House Tonight, the show takes place in his living room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pefUendasTeoJIEwBklIdGhxTQy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9826'),
  ('634314244611206858', 'The Tommy Tiernan Show', 2017, 'Talk', null, null, 'Tommy Tiernan, Fred Cooke', null, 'No stranger to television, Tommy has appeared on some of the biggest and most established chat shows in the world. But, for some time, Tommy has wanted to host his own TV chat show – one with a difference. It has all the ingredients of a normal chat show but there was a catch – neither the host or the audience know the identity of the guests until they walk out on stage! The Tommy Tiernan Show is recorded in front of a live audience and will include stand-up from Tommy, live music and plenty of chat….. with a little help from fellow comedian Fred Cooke thrown in.', 'No stranger to television, Tommy has appeared on some of the biggest and most established chat shows in the world. But, for some time, Tommy has wanted to host his own TV chat show – one with a difference. It has all the ingredients of a normal chat show but there was a catch – neither the host or the audience know the identity of the guests until they walk out on stage! The Tommy Tiernan Show is recorded in front of a live audience and will include stand-up from Tommy, live music and plenty of chat….. with a little help from fellow comedian Fred Cooke thrown in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8W8hfa1TRtP4tX1GdS29nGPe3db.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:217908'),
  ('777826243254796054', 'The Tommyknockers', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Stephen King', 'Lawrence D. Cohen', 'Jimmy Smits, Marg Helgenberger, E.G. Marshall, William Johnson, Joanna Cassidy, John Ashton, Allyce Beasley, Robert Carradine', null, 'A buried UFO slowly turns local inhabitants into gizmo-building alien mutants.', 'A buried UFO slowly turns local inhabitants into gizmo-building alien mutants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r41hDFTHfFYYYBxiPP0osamSB8h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16089'),
  ('839059991422651417', 'The Tomorrow People', 1973, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Roger Damon Price', null, 'Nicholas Young', null, 'Born to human parents, an apparently normal child might at some point between childhood and late adolescence experience a process called ''breaking out'' and develop special paranormal abilities. These abilities include psychic powers such as telepathy, telekinesis, and teleportation. However, their psychological make-up prevents them from intentionally killing others.', 'Born to human parents, an apparently normal child might at some point between childhood and late adolescence experience a process called ''breaking out'' and develop special paranormal abilities. These abilities include psychic powers such as telepathy, telekinesis, and teleportation. However, their psychological make-up prevents them from intentionally killing others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMUrENZBbyX4EnzJ6RnRNjmMUVC.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1550'),
  ('253985968977678654', 'The Tomorrow People', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Greg Berlanti, Phil Klemmer, Julie Plec', null, 'Robbie Amell, Peyton List, Luke Mitchell, Aaron Yoo, Madeleine Mantock, Mark Pellegrino', 'TV-14', 'The story of several young people from around the world who represent the next stage in human evolution, possessing special powers, including the ability to teleport and communicate with each other telepathically. Together they work to defeat the forces of evil.', 'The story of several young people from around the world who represent the next stage in human evolution, possessing special powers, including the ability to teleport and communicate with each other telepathically. Together they work to defeat the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EavFY6TuhDm4ERbDGrZ1oEqB57.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48860'),
  ('700735114744878189', 'The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon', 2014, 'Comedy, Talk', null, 'Jimmy Fallon', 'Jimmy Fallon, Steve Higgins', 'TV-14', 'After Jay Leno''s second retirement from the program, Jimmy Fallon stepped in as his permanent replacement. After 42 years in Los Angeles the program was brought back to New York.', 'After Jay Leno''s second retirement from the program, Jimmy Fallon stepped in as his permanent replacement. After 42 years in Los Angeles the program was brought back to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N4o5PmmqhlVDrcdJ2RlCFWbLGX.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:59941'),
  ('1264332836076878', 'The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson', 1962, 'Talk', 'Sylvester Weaver, Steve Allen', null, 'Johnny Carson', 'TV-PG', 'The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson is a talk show hosted by Johnny Carson under The Tonight Show franchise from 1962 to 1992. It originally aired during late-night. For its first ten years, Carson''s Tonight Show was based in New York City with occasional trips to Burbank, California; in May 1972, the show moved permanently to Burbank, California. In 2002, The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson was ranked #12 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time.', 'The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson is a talk show hosted by Johnny Carson under The Tonight Show franchise from 1962 to 1992. It originally aired during late-night. For its first ten years, Carson''s Tonight Show was based in New York City with occasional trips to Burbank, California; in May 1972, the show moved permanently to Burbank, California. In 2002, The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson was ranked #12 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSvET5YUvHNDIeoCpErrbSmasFb.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:2261'),
  ('16242806260926994', 'The Tonight Show with Conan O''Brien', 2009, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Conan O''Brien', null, 'The Tonight Show with Conan O''Brien is an American television talk show broadcast by NBC. The show is the fifth installment of The Tonight Show, hosted by Conan O''Brien. It aired from June 1, 2009, to January 22, 2010, succeeding The Tonight Show with Jay Leno and ended when Leno returned to the role of Tonight Show host.', 'The Tonight Show with Conan O''Brien is an American television talk show broadcast by NBC. The show is the fifth installment of The Tonight Show, hosted by Conan O''Brien. It aired from June 1, 2009, to January 22, 2010, succeeding The Tonight Show with Jay Leno and ended when Leno returned to the role of Tonight Show host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkDDxwhBKqrziSVHZknZFomTslq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17535'),
  ('300304526478664830', 'The Tonight Show with Jay Leno', 1992, 'Talk, Comedy', null, 'Jon Macks, Wayne Kline, Suli McCullough', 'Jay Leno', null, 'Jay Leno hosts some of the biggest celebrities in the world.', 'Jay Leno hosts some of the biggest celebrities in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAFMZ3wFIEXTISryRZD94AAvWng.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:2518'),
  ('22831959661467076', 'The Tony Danza Show', 2004, 'Talk', null, null, 'Tony Danza, Ereka Vetrini', null, 'The Tony Danza Show was a daytime variety talk show that premiered on September 13, 2004 in syndication and was distributed by Buena Vista Television.', 'The Tony Danza Show was a daytime variety talk show that premiered on September 13, 2004 in syndication and was distributed by Buena Vista Television.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:319'),
  ('521855199739010957', 'The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside by My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Kaede Hondo, Takuya Sato, Kohei Amasaki, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Sora Tokui, Ken Narita, Kanna Nakamura', 'TV-14', 'Philia Adenauer hails from a family renowned for producing Saints for generations in the Kingdom of Girtonia. Saints fight to protect humankind from monsters, and Philia underwent rigorous education and training to earn her title. After her fiancé, Julius, breaks off their engagement, Philia is sold to the kingdom of Parnacorta for resources. Will her homeland survive without her?!?', 'Philia Adenauer hails from a family renowned for producing Saints for generations in the Kingdom of Girtonia. Saints fight to protect humankind from monsters, and Philia underwent rigorous education and training to earn her title. After her fiancé, Julius, breaks off their engagement, Philia is sold to the kingdom of Parnacorta for resources. Will her homeland survive without her?!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBvBEN0uC7nnNtPjpmxVQcjO97y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274741'),
  ('418445101204824742', 'The Torch', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Cohen', 'Hugo Benamozig, David Caviglioli, Jérémie Galan', 'Jonathan Cohen, Ramzy Bedia, Ana Girardot, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Géraldine Nakache, Leïla Bekhti, Camille Chamoux, Pierre Niney', null, 'Goodbye villa and hello Chupacabra. After THE FLAME, Marc and 15 other contestants will have to compete and survive on a deserted island. Physical challenges, mental manipulation, and emotional betrayals will be the ingredients of this tropical cocktail.', 'Goodbye villa and hello Chupacabra. After THE FLAME, Marc and 15 other contestants will have to compete and survive on a deserted island. Physical challenges, mental manipulation, and emotional betrayals will be the ingredients of this tropical cocktail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a89SLEtX9AsooDEHOXKoSvj9BRG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202772'),
  ('960078136471088904', 'The Torkelsons', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Lynn Montgomery', null, 'Connie Ray, Olivia Burnette, Lee Norris, Brittany Murphy, Rachel Duncan, Jason Marsden, Perry King', 'TV-G', 'Millicent Torkelson does what she can to hold her family together as it shrinks to just her and her children after her husband Randy abandons the family.', 'Millicent Torkelson does what she can to hold her family together as it shrinks to just her and her children after her husband Randy abandons the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJN1EczX0FiLy0H6JaWxbF1J7Uo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2147'),
  ('942122062258464066', 'The Tough Fight', 1985, null, null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Carina Lau, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Susanna Kwan, Sek Kin, Teresa Ha Ping, Lam Tin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xakgZZH2VHO4s0R6x32rDtLtrg2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108061'),
  ('100669675841470628', 'The Tourist', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jack Williams, Harry Williams', null, 'Jamie Dornan, Danielle Macdonald, Olwen Fouéré, Greg Larsen, Victoria Haralabidou, Conor MacNeill, Mark McKenna, Nessa Matthews', 'TV-MA', 'When a man wakes up in the Australian outback with no memory, he must use the few clues he has to discover his identity before his past catches up with him.', 'When a man wakes up in the Australian outback with no memory, he must use the few clues he has to discover his identity before his past catches up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jLF76FYBh5YHb4n1mQz1ayjDD4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:120909'),
  ('942484178897054343', 'The Tower', 2012, 'Drama', 'Benjamin Benedict, Nico Hofmann', 'Uwe Tellkamp, Thomas Kirchner', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Claudia Michelsen, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Götz Schubert, Nadja Uhl, Stephanie Stumph, Josephin Busch, Valery Tscheplanowa', null, 'A seemingly sheltered family living behind the Berlin Wall in East Germany begins to crumble, in a climate of fear, mistrust, and shocking secrets.9', 'A seemingly sheltered family living behind the Berlin Wall in East Germany begins to crumble, in a climate of fear, mistrust, and shocking secrets.9', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FhqLRjxuDaNmA1OR48BsWFRAim.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65179'),
  ('1087693882444059873', 'The Tower', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Patrick Harbinson', 'Patrick Harbinson', 'Gemma Whelan, Tahirah Sharif, Jimmy Akingbola, Emmett J. Scanlan, Bobby Lockwood, Ella Smith, Karl Davies, Michael Karim', 'TV-14', 'A veteran beat cop and teenage girl fall to their deaths from a tower block in south-east London, leaving a five-year-old boy and rookie police officer Lizzie Griffiths on the roof, only for them to go missing. Detective Sergeant Sarah Collins is drafted in to investigate, working to find Lizzie before she comes to serious harm, but also to uncover the truth behind the grisly tower block deaths.', 'A veteran beat cop and teenage girl fall to their deaths from a tower block in south-east London, leaving a five-year-old boy and rookie police officer Lizzie Griffiths on the roof, only for them to go missing. Detective Sergeant Sarah Collins is drafted in to investigate, working to find Lizzie before she comes to serious harm, but also to uncover the truth behind the grisly tower block deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lw4ZiZITgOy1bQIlv7cxGfNGqp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138181'),
  ('462805104319273398', 'The Tower of Druaga: The Aegis of Uruk', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Yui Horie, Fumiko Orikasa, KENN, Akiko Yajima, Hozumi Goda', null, 'The Summer of "Anu": In a summer once every five years, demons in the mysterious Tower of Druaga lose their powers due to the magic spell cast by a god named "Anu". King Gilgamesh, ruler of the kingdom Uruk, uses the appearance of demons as an excuse to invade the tower and find out the construct''s secrets. As 80 years passed, the Uruk army managed to fight back the demons and built a fortress city and safe haven on the very first floor of Druaga—Metz Kier. Thus begins the story of a warrior named Jil, who, finding companions along the way, embarks on a quest for the fabled Blue Crystal Rod, a powerful artifact rumored to be in the highest floor of Druaga. However, other competitors, including the kingdom of Uruk itself, want the treasure, all for their own reasons.', 'The Summer of "Anu": In a summer once every five years, demons in the mysterious Tower of Druaga lose their powers due to the magic spell cast by a god named "Anu". King Gilgamesh, ruler of the kingdom Uruk, uses the appearance of demons as an excuse to invade the tower and find out the construct''s secrets. As 80 years passed, the Uruk army managed to fight back the demons and built a fortress city and safe haven on the very first floor of Druaga—Metz Kier. Thus begins the story of a warrior named Jil, who, finding companions along the way, embarks on a quest for the fabled Blue Crystal Rod, a powerful artifact rumored to be in the highest floor of Druaga. However, other competitors, including the kingdom of Uruk itself, want the treasure, all for their own reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k77eqVawgYo4tPGzmuCdwBTi7XO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37517'),
  ('521830613821373216', 'The Town', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Deniz Karaoğlu, Doğu Yaşar Akal', 'Deniz Karaoğlu, Doğu Yaşar Akal', 'Okan Yalabık, Özgürcan Çevik, Ozan Dolunay, Büşra Develi, Kerem Can, Açelya Devrim Yılhan, Sarp Aydınoğlu', 'TV-MA', 'A group of cash-strapped friends find their morals and relationships tested when they stumble upon a stolen fortune in their hometown.', 'A group of cash-strapped friends find their morals and relationships tested when they stumble upon a stolen fortune in their hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4EhIaAapcEc79mXvzjxmplGb0e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278100'),
  ('710767753781760950', 'The Town Doctor', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Kang Eun-kyung', null, 'Ozan Akbaba, Deniz Can Aktaş, Hazal Subaşı, Vildan Atasever, Sinan Albayrak, Özgün Karaman, Barış Yıldız, Sinan Demirer', null, 'Medical drama series, local adaptation of the Korean scripted format “Dr. Romantic”, centering on a genius doctor with an accomplished career who somehow ends up leaving it all behind to be a neighborhood doctor in a small town where he meets some younger doctors and becomes a mentor to them.', 'Medical drama series, local adaptation of the Korean scripted format “Dr. Romantic”, centering on a genius doctor with an accomplished career who somehow ends up leaving it all behind to be a neighborhood doctor in a small town where he meets some younger doctors and becomes a mentor to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snaKsrV9Y1D1xjfxr5JylgOhH62.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197188'),
  ('970957540184200489', 'The Toys That Made Us', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Brian Volk-Weiss', null, 'Donald Ian Black', 'TV-14', 'The minds behind history''s most iconic toy franchises discuss the rise -- and sometimes fall -- of their billion-dollar creations.', 'The minds behind history''s most iconic toy franchises discuss the rise -- and sometimes fall -- of their billion-dollar creations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh3UQ7WPSSYUJ5FrCugqAeSqIhr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75871'),
  ('394245296967791337', 'The Tracey Ullman Show', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tracey Ullman, James L. Brooks, Jerry Belson', 'Paul Flaherty, Dick Blasucci, Matt Groening', 'Tracey Ullman, Julie Kavner, Dan Castellaneta, Sam McMurray, Joseph Malone, Anna Thomson', null, 'The Tracey Ullman Show is an American television variety show, hosted by British-born actress and onetime pop singer Tracey Ullman. It debuted on April 5, 1987 as the Fox network''s second primetime series after Married... with Children (1987–1997), and ran until May 26, 1990. The show is produced by Gracie Films and 20th Century Fox Television. The show blended sketch comedy shorts with many musical numbers, featuring choreography by Paula Abdul. The show also produced The Simpsons shorts before it spun off into its own show, which was also produced by Gracie Films and 20th Century Fox Television.', 'The Tracey Ullman Show is an American television variety show, hosted by British-born actress and onetime pop singer Tracey Ullman. It debuted on April 5, 1987 as the Fox network''s second primetime series after Married... with Children (1987–1997), and ran until May 26, 1990. The show is produced by Gracie Films and 20th Century Fox Television. The show blended sketch comedy shorts with many musical numbers, featuring choreography by Paula Abdul. The show also produced The Simpsons shorts before it spun off into its own show, which was also produced by Gracie Films and 20th Century Fox Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9LEacUqkY2DNDEkLK75EvHCzF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1679'),
  ('1056589548105636500', 'The Trades', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Ryan J. Lindsay', null, 'Robb Wells, Anastasia Phillips, Jennifer Spence, Raoul Bhaneja, Dan Petronijevic, Tom Green, Enrico Colantoni, Patrick McKenna', 'TV-14', 'In a blue-collar community where the high stress of working in a refinery is balanced by the comedic high-wire antics of its plant workers, The Trades centres around pipefitter Todd and his sister and roommate, Audrey, who follows in her big brother’s footsteps pursuing a career in the trades as a carpenter, just like their father Rod.', 'In a blue-collar community where the high stress of working in a refinery is balanced by the comedic high-wire antics of its plant workers, The Trades centres around pipefitter Todd and his sister and roommate, Audrey, who follows in her big brother’s footsteps pursuing a career in the trades as a carpenter, just like their father Rod.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZM1JHo0ejinfKe6mTMK2cOhKA8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:246480'),
  ('602444964313400930', 'The Traitors', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Claudia Winkleman, Claudia Winkleman', 'TV-MA', 'Strangers play the ultimate game of detection, backstabbing and trust in the hope of winning up to £120,000. But hidden amongst the players are three Traitors, who secretly ‘murder’ a player every night. It’s up to the Faithfuls to banish them from the game before they become the next victim. If the Faithfuls eliminate all the Traitors they split the cash; but if a Traitor remains undetected to the end of the game, they take all the money.', 'Strangers play the ultimate game of detection, backstabbing and trust in the hope of winning up to £120,000. But hidden amongst the players are three Traitors, who secretly ‘murder’ a player every night. It’s up to the Faithfuls to banish them from the game before they become the next victim. If the Faithfuls eliminate all the Traitors they split the cash; but if a Traitor remains undetected to the end of the game, they take all the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KeLm8fSqBgK0lRNXorwlmcf6j2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:215307'),
  ('55428193316350471', 'The Traitors', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Alan Cumming', 'TV-14', 'The entertainment industry’s most competitive reality stars and famous faces play the ultimate murder mystery game. Hosted by award-winning actor Alan Cumming at an ancient castle set deep in the Scottish Highlands, contestants work together on a series of exhilarating missions to build a prize fund worth up to $250,000. Hidden amongst the Faithful are the Traitors, whose goal is to eliminate the Faithful and claim the prize for themselves.', 'The entertainment industry’s most competitive reality stars and famous faces play the ultimate murder mystery game. Hosted by award-winning actor Alan Cumming at an ancient castle set deep in the Scottish Highlands, contestants work together on a series of exhilarating missions to build a prize fund worth up to $250,000. Hidden amongst the Faithful are the Traitors, whose goal is to eliminate the Faithful and claim the prize for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWK9tLH2UGgzuAI6P3cHeTKopfj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:215943'),
  ('1126340194432529132', 'The Traitors - Italy', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Alessia Marcuzzi', null, 'Fourteen players gather in a castle to compete for a grand prize by completing a series of missions. But among them hide the traitors - secretly eliminating their fellow contestants one by one. The rest are the faithful, and it''s up to them to identify and banish the traitors before they become the next victims.', 'Fourteen players gather in a castle to compete for a grand prize by completing a series of missions. But among them hide the traitors - secretly eliminating their fellow contestants one by one. The rest are the faithful, and it''s up to them to identify and banish the traitors before they become the next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkyrD1MGAtPOfAmkU3PRDDhC6gX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304434'),
  ('50732221979351869', 'The Traitors Canada', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Karine Vanasse', null, 'Follow a group of contestants – including some familiar faces – who live together as they complete a series of challenges with the goal of earning a cash prize. The catch? Some of the contestants are traitors who will attempt to deceive and manipulate their way to the prize instead of sharing it amongst the group. In this psychological adventure will the traitors be unmasked in time?', 'Follow a group of contestants – including some familiar faces – who live together as they complete a series of challenges with the goal of earning a cash prize. The catch? Some of the contestants are traitors who will attempt to deceive and manipulate their way to the prize instead of sharing it amongst the group. In this psychological adventure will the traitors be unmasked in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nric399WVyiZqjmoqhKzOszM90l.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:234613'),
  ('1135970142296783033', 'The Traitors Finland', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Based on the global hit format, "The Traitors" is a new kind of psychological battle where no one can trust anyone.', 'Based on the global hit format, "The Traitors" is a new kind of psychological battle where no one can trust anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rg0yKPp6AAxu46I9fNoz8u0MWJM.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:234294'),
  ('775786117300888603', 'The Traitors France', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Éric Antoine', null, 'In a magnificent castle, personalities will take part in an experience they will never forget. A game of lies, manipulation, and betrayal, hosted by Éric Antoine, where anything goes. Among the players, some will be designated as traitors, while the others will be loyal. Day and night, the traitors must lie about their true identity, devise strategies to deceive the loyal players, and secure their place in the game. To achieve this, they must win challenges, withstand psychological pressure, outwit strategies, and mislead their enemies. Most importantly, they must avoid elimination to be the last one standing and win the game!', 'In a magnificent castle, personalities will take part in an experience they will never forget. A game of lies, manipulation, and betrayal, hosted by Éric Antoine, where anything goes. Among the players, some will be designated as traitors, while the others will be loyal. Day and night, the traitors must lie about their true identity, devise strategies to deceive the loyal players, and secure their place in the game. To achieve this, they must win challenges, withstand psychological pressure, outwit strategies, and mislead their enemies. Most importantly, they must avoid elimination to be the last one standing and win the game!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmIAeRowK0qG1zTkrDdy0g73qFW.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:208398'),
  ('716660842657954493', 'The Traitors Ireland', 2025, 'Reality', 'Marc Pos, Jasper Hoogendoorn', null, 'Siobhán McSweeney', null, '22 strangers are pitted against each other in a remote castle, where they must play a game an imaginative game of strategy. The twist? Some players, known as the Traitors, are secretly tasked with eliminating their competitors each night without being detected.', '22 strangers are pitted against each other in a remote castle, where they must play a game an imaginative game of strategy. The twist? Some players, known as the Traitors, are secretly tasked with eliminating their competitors each night without being detected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43c2u9G9iRHAusHWr9RyTnRsXb5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298714'),
  ('446450098190715510', 'The Traitors NZ', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Welcome to The Traitors NZ, Paul Henry''s devilish little game with one main goal - find and unmask the traitors, the secret saboteurs within the group, before they get you.', 'Welcome to The Traitors NZ, Paul Henry''s devilish little game with one main goal - find and unmask the traitors, the secret saboteurs within the group, before they get you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szFca3nAo6pqjN2TzX4pmAChAiI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232058'),
