  ('142810616483213693', 'The Unaware Atelier Meister', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu, Minami Tanaka, Asami Seto, Hisako Kanemoto, Rie Tanaka', null, 'Kurt Rockhans is a kind-hearted errand boy for a hero’s party, the Flaming Dragon Fang. One day, he''s banished from the party and finds out he has the lowest rank in combat. In order to make a living, Kurt picks up various jobs and discovers he has astonishing abilities. Though he doesn''t realize it yet, Kurt has SSS-rank skills in anything other than fighting, as he sets off on a new journey.', 'Kurt Rockhans is a kind-hearted errand boy for a hero’s party, the Flaming Dragon Fang. One day, he''s banished from the party and finds out he has the lowest rank in combat. In order to make a living, Kurt picks up various jobs and discovers he has astonishing abilities. Though he doesn''t realize it yet, Kurt has SSS-rank skills in anything other than fighting, as he sets off on a new journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OPJ7k6DMm1o3A0kIXysgrqVT5w.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:277881'),
  ('655344921561969007', 'The UnBelievable with Dan Aykroyd', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dan Aykroyd, Adam Richman', 'TV-14', 'Each episode opens up a cabinet of curiosities to reveal the strangest-but-true stories in human history, brought to life through dynamic recreation, compelling graphics, and arresting archival. From Boston’s Great Molasses Flood to a man who survived being struck by lightning not once, not twice, but SEVEN times, these seemingly tall tales all actually happened, and our cast of experts dives into the historical record to tell you how and why.', 'Each episode opens up a cabinet of curiosities to reveal the strangest-but-true stories in human history, brought to life through dynamic recreation, compelling graphics, and arresting archival. From Boston’s Great Molasses Flood to a man who survived being struck by lightning not once, not twice, but SEVEN times, these seemingly tall tales all actually happened, and our cast of experts dives into the historical record to tell you how and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCdcmyYICMZ4oceqiNraSztTJn6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227521'),
  ('262984504951533988', 'The Unbroken Voice', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Héctor Rodríguez', 'Ángela Milena Ardila, Mayra Alejandra Henao, Johnny A. Ortiz', 'Verónica Orozco, Santiago Alarcón, Mateo Rincón, Brandon Figueredo, Linda Lucía Callejas, Catalina Polo, Diego Daniel Mira, Sebastián Yatra', 'TV-MA', 'Against all odds, a young Arelys Henao pursues her dream of a singing career in this music-packed drama inspired by the Colombian icon''s early life.', 'Against all odds, a young Arelys Henao pursues her dream of a singing career in this music-packed drama inspired by the Colombian icon''s early life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCJAPtPg6b2JckKbbIeeOiFPTdD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:155499'),
  ('16406759815197457', 'The Uncanny Counter', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Sae-bom, Yoo Sun-dong, Yeoh Gee-na', 'Kim Sae-bom', 'Cho Byeong-kyu, Yu Jun-sang, Kim Se-jeong, Yeom Hye-ran, Ahn Suk-hwan, Yoo In-soo, Kim Hieora, Kang Ki-young', 'TV-MA', 'A group of supernatural demon hunters known as "Counters," each with unique abilities, disguise themselves as employees of a noodle restaurant, while tracking down evil spirits that terrorize the mortal world.', 'A group of supernatural demon hunters known as "Counters," each with unique abilities, disguise themselves as employees of a noodle restaurant, while tracking down evil spirits that terrorize the mortal world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsbuXbQqryQ8aJlwXFkFXbrYko1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113268'),
  ('543883855866934028', 'The Undateables', 2012, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Follow single people with disabilities as they sign up to a dating agency in order to find a partner.', 'Follow single people with disabilities as they sign up to a dating agency in order to find a partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXoDAmbYDFiUNblUbZmIzYY2wu0.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:44600'),
  ('709253062248978074', 'The Undeclared War', 2022, 'War & Politics, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Kosminsky', null, 'Hannah Khalique-Brown, Simon Pegg, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, Edward Holcroft, Adrian Lester, Alex Jennings, Hattie Morahan, Ed Stoppard', null, 'In the post-pandemic world of 2024 during an upcoming British general election involving the UK’s first Black Conservative prime minister, a leading team of analysts at the heart of the UK’s NSA-style spy agency GCHQ attempt to ward off a cyber-attack on the country’s electoral system.', 'In the post-pandemic world of 2024 during an upcoming British general election involving the UK’s first Black Conservative prime minister, a leading team of analysts at the heart of the UK’s NSA-style spy agency GCHQ attempt to ward off a cyber-attack on the country’s electoral system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1BGSW4mvpnXYM34OqiCtyZQhEC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156988'),
  ('788132142995715724', 'The Underclass', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nannaphas Loetnamchoetsakun, Praewa Suthamphong, Sumitra Duangkaew, Tanutchai Wijitvongtong, Tarisa Preechatangkit, Natticha Chantaravareelrkha, Miori Ohkubo', 'TV-MA', 'After getting dropped from an elite program, a student gets tangled in the affairs of a high school gang while trying to find her own identity.', 'After getting dropped from an elite program, a student gets tangled in the affairs of a high school gang while trying to find her own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDGmpAQzHfqa9gdLtgGbfpPf2Wx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105646'),
  ('482887029290802207', 'The Underground Railroad', 2021, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Barry Jenkins', null, 'Thuso Mbedu, Chase W. Dillon, Joel Edgerton', 'TV-MA', 'Follow young Cora’s journey as she makes a desperate bid for freedom in the antebellum South. After escaping her Georgia plantation for the rumored Underground Railroad, Cora discovers no mere metaphor, but an actual railroad full of engineers and conductors, and a secret network of tracks and tunnels beneath the Southern soil.', 'Follow young Cora’s journey as she makes a desperate bid for freedom in the antebellum South. After escaping her Georgia plantation for the rumored Underground Railroad, Cora discovers no mere metaphor, but an actual railroad full of engineers and conductors, and a secret network of tracks and tunnels beneath the Southern soil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CrrTqw7LHafnbdH9UcK60aOZSm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80039'),
  ('652308417461906309', 'The Undersea World of Jacques Cousteau', 1968, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau', 'NR', 'The intrepid undersea explorer and author circles the globe on his floating laboratory, Calypso, in this occasional series. A pioneer in marine study, the red-capped Frenchman introduced generations of landlubbers to the creatures and mysteries of the sea.', 'The intrepid undersea explorer and author circles the globe on his floating laboratory, Calypso, in this occasional series. A pioneer in marine study, the red-capped Frenchman introduced generations of landlubbers to the creatures and mysteries of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4nMk7XRR7hlQgUtszbd9pbVFwa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44103'),
  ('547572583662970988', 'The Undertaker', 2013, 'Crime', 'Hartmut Block', null, 'Mike Müller, Barbara Terpoorten, Reto Stalder, Samuel Streiff, Suly Röthlisberger, Martin Ostermeier', null, 'A detective leaves the force to take over the family business as an undertaker at the same time as he is being investigated for murder. His close encounters with corpses and his earlier police training lead him to see things some of his ex-colleagues miss and he investigates the crimes he encounters in an unofficial capacity often to the dismay of the official police.', 'A detective leaves the force to take over the family business as an undertaker at the same time as he is being investigated for murder. His close encounters with corpses and his earlier police training lead him to see things some of his ex-colleagues miss and he investigates the crimes he encounters in an unofficial capacity often to the dismay of the official police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nKpZSHvqCDvMRItx19gyIGflne.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62514'),
  ('7612193443450826', 'The Undoing', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'David E. Kelley', 'David E. Kelley', 'Nicole Kidman, Hugh Grant, Edgar Ramírez, Noah Jupe, Lily Rabe, Matilda De Angelis, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Edan Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Grace and Jonathan Fraser are living the only lives they ever wanted. Overnight a chasm opens in their lives: a violent death and a chain of terrible revelations. Left behind in the wake of a spreading and very public disaster, Grace must dismantle one life and create another for her child and her family.', 'Grace and Jonathan Fraser are living the only lives they ever wanted. Overnight a chasm opens in their lives: a violent death and a chain of terrible revelations. Left behind in the wake of a spreading and very public disaster, Grace must dismantle one life and create another for her child and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tDbJxobPN3EI2bBebL6zmusmw5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83851'),
  ('828001603278182772', 'The Unforgettable Memory', 2004, 'Drama', null, 'Ting Wa-Chung', 'Wang Shih-sian, Phoenix Chang, Lee Lee-zen, Anais Yang, Qin Zhang, Angel Han, Lee Hsing-wen, Johnny Hsu', null, 'The Unforgettable Memory is a Taiwanese prime-time television series, originally broadcast on Formosa Television from 22 September 2004 to 28 September 2006 for 526 episodes. With a run-time of over 50,000 minutes, it is the longest Taiwanese TV drama in the 21st century.', 'The Unforgettable Memory is a Taiwanese prime-time television series, originally broadcast on Formosa Television from 22 September 2004 to 28 September 2006 for 526 episodes. With a run-time of over 50,000 minutes, it is the longest Taiwanese TV drama in the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPqcyiBoTax5wHUR89pPvv33fl0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108586'),
  ('100830187581160998', 'The Unicorn', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mike Schiff, Bill Martin', null, 'Walton Goggins, Rob Corddry, Michaela Watkins, Omar Benson Miller, Maya Lynne Robinson, Ruby Jay, Makenzie Moss', 'TV-PG', 'A tight-knit group of best friends and family helps Wade embrace his “new normal” in the wake of the loss of his wife. As a sometimes ill-equipped but always devoted single parent to his two adolescent daughters, he is taking the major step of dating again.', 'A tight-knit group of best friends and family helps Wade embrace his “new normal” in the wake of the loss of his wife. As a sometimes ill-equipped but always devoted single parent to his two adolescent daughters, he is taking the major step of dating again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/464MyJvlG2Po8J1ObAwRljf2Exf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89611'),
  ('333183754843635331', 'The Unit', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Mamet', null, 'Dennis Haysbert, Regina Taylor, Scott Foley, Audrey Marie Anderson, Max Martini, Abby Brammell, Michael Irby, Robert Patrick', 'TV-14', 'A covert team of special forces operatives risk their lives on undercover missions around the globe, while their wives maintain the homefront, protecting their husbands'' secrets.', 'A covert team of special forces operatives risk their lives on undercover missions around the globe, while their wives maintain the homefront, protecting their husbands'' secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftwhXqizcVRo4pgqFnTysR9tAIM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2321'),
  ('337274942368720285', 'The United States Steel Hour', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Cyril Hume, Richard Maibaum', null, null, 'The United States Steel Hour is an anthology series which brought hour-long dramas to television from 1953 to 1963. The television series and the radio program that preceded it were both sponsored by the United States Steel Corporation.', 'The United States Steel Hour is an anthology series which brought hour-long dramas to television from 1953 to 1963. The television series and the radio program that preceded it were both sponsored by the United States Steel Corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15Lz0tLjmTswcp46Buc3jxvhUoL.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12450'),
  ('621792311904098527', 'The Universe', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Ackroyd, Erik Thompson', 'TV-PG', 'From the planets to the stars and out to the edge of the unknown, history and science collide in a wondrous yet deadly adventure through space and time.', 'From the planets to the stars and out to the edge of the unknown, history and science collide in a wondrous yet deadly adventure through space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbtVDGQbzvNSbAqXIVE1X7BUtq2.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2622'),
  ('100624450901584349', 'The Unlikely Murderer', 2021, 'Drama', 'Thomas Pettersson, Wilhelm Behrman, Niklas Rockström', null, 'Robert Gustafsson, Mikael Persbrandt, Eva Melander, Björn Bengtsson, Peter Viitanen, Cilla Thorell, Joel Spira, Magnus Krepper', 'TV-MA', 'After the assassination of prime minister Olof Palme in 1986, Stig Engström managed to elude justice right up to his death through a combination of audacity, luck, and a perplexed police force.', 'After the assassination of prime minister Olof Palme in 1986, Stig Engström managed to elude justice right up to his death through a combination of audacity, luck, and a perplexed police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5doyEwXiowg2mrjKsS9NSvPs53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132316'),
  ('170444221607868355', 'The Unlisted', 2019, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Justine Flynn', null, 'Vrund Rao, Ved Rao, Abigail Adriano, Miah Madden, Annabel Wolfe, Danny Kim', 'TV-PG', 'Twelve-year-old identical twins Dru and Kal discover that the government is secretly tracking and manipulating Australia''s youth via electronic tracking devices.', 'Twelve-year-old identical twins Dru and Kal discover that the government is secretly tracking and manipulating Australia''s youth via electronic tracking devices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlDPN9MMMc1NQpx5EA6HIUFnRVy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94625'),
  ('448852416141279476', 'The Unremarkable Juanquini', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Dago García', null, 'Julián Cerati, Antonio Sanint, Biassini Segura, Julio Cesar Herrera, María Cecilia Sánchez, Jacques Toukhmanian, Mariana Gómez', null, 'An inept magician pulls off the trick of his life: accidentally disappearing a wanted criminal during a police raid. Now he''s going to pay for that.', 'An inept magician pulls off the trick of his life: accidentally disappearing a wanted criminal during a police raid. Now he''s going to pay for that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2jgq3q8MGHwP5ZNtnJ8GPCSQ1W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103505'),
  ('1060490664481366510', 'The Unsettling', 2019, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Nick Maniatis, Andrew Jacobsen, Adam Jay Epstein', null, 'Holly Taylor, Tequan Richmond, Willow Shields, Alex Lange, Marguerite Moreau, David Clayton Rogers, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, An-Li Bogan', null, 'Becca, a 16-year-old girl, arrives at her new foster home located in a remote area. Her foster siblings are less than welcoming but none more so than the 11-year-old biological son of their foster parents. Becca tries to keep to herself and adjust to her new home, but strange things start to happen around her, and Becca is uncertain about who or what is responsible.', 'Becca, a 16-year-old girl, arrives at her new foster home located in a remote area. Her foster siblings are less than welcoming but none more so than the 11-year-old biological son of their foster parents. Becca tries to keep to herself and adjust to her new home, but strange things start to happen around her, and Becca is uncertain about who or what is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klQFSpyENmZyb2rkogAvxHKtWwd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91198'),
  ('438599821719104859', 'The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ashley Pearson', null, 'Follows the cold case and controversial investigation into the murder of Beverly Lynn Smith in her home in Oshawa, Ontario. Woven together from first hand accounts, expert interviews, family archives, and rare access to key participants, The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith is an unpredictable tale that explores the unrelenting enigma of ethics and accountability in this provocative criminal case.', 'Follows the cold case and controversial investigation into the murder of Beverly Lynn Smith in her home in Oshawa, Ontario. Woven together from first hand accounts, expert interviews, family archives, and rare access to key participants, The Unsolved Murder of Beverly Lynn Smith is an unpredictable tale that explores the unrelenting enigma of ethics and accountability in this provocative criminal case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96FdKhAu0YPsnoUq0GVpNI7JIB5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201429'),
  ('104037795301353706', 'The Untamed', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', 'Ma Jing, Guo Guangyun, Deng Yaoyu', 'Xiao Zhan, Wang Yibo, Meng Ziyi, Xuan Lu, Wang Zhuocheng, Yu Bin, Liu Haikuan, James Huang', null, 'In a magical world of inter-clan rivalry, two soulmates face treacherous schemes and uncover a dark mystery linked to a tragic event in the past.', 'In a magical world of inter-clan rivalry, two soulmates face treacherous schemes and uncover a dark mystery linked to a tragic event in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TZbpPpLQVS2i7P7yUVhrFlFsmW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90761'),
  ('1039038237678119663', 'The Untamed: Special Edition', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Xiao Zhan, Wang Yibo, Liu Haikuan, Wang Zhuocheng', null, '"The Untamed Special Edition" is a 20-episode cut of The Untamed specially made to overseas fans for better integration and comprehension of the series. This special edition focuses more on Lan Wangji/Lan Zhan and his emotions towards Wei Wuxian/Wei Ying.', '"The Untamed Special Edition" is a 20-episode cut of The Untamed specially made to overseas fans for better integration and comprehension of the series. This special edition focuses more on Lan Wangji/Lan Zhan and his emotions towards Wei Wuxian/Wei Ying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHy38hbjjNyGHXp5DIAyGeiepfF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97706'),
  ('110031700897553167', 'The Untouchables', 1959, 'Drama, Crime', 'Quinn Martin', null, 'Robert Stack, Nicholas Georgiade, Steve London, Paul Picerni, Abel Fernandez, Walter Winchell', 'TV-PG', 'Special Agent Eliot Ness and his elite team of incorruptible agents battle organized crime in 1930s Chicago.', 'Special Agent Eliot Ness and his elite team of incorruptible agents battle organized crime in 1930s Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80IDXgaHmcxj6CKRImkpHjnIMcd.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2774'),
  ('642178028663352331', 'The Untouchables', 1993, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Tom Amandes, John Rhys-Davies, William Forsythe, Paul Regina, David James Elliott, Michael Horse, John Newton, Hynden Walch', 'NR', 'The Untouchables is an American crime drama series that aired for two seasons in syndication, from January 1993 to May 1994. The series portrayed work of the real life Untouchables federal investigative squad in Prohibition-era Chicago and its efforts against Al Capone''s attempts to profit from the market in bootleg liquor. The series features Tom Amandes as Eliot Ness and William Forsythe as Al Capone, and was based on the 1959 series and 1987 film of the same name.', 'The Untouchables is an American crime drama series that aired for two seasons in syndication, from January 1993 to May 1994. The series portrayed work of the real life Untouchables federal investigative squad in Prohibition-era Chicago and its efforts against Al Capone''s attempts to profit from the market in bootleg liquor. The series features Tom Amandes as Eliot Ness and William Forsythe as Al Capone, and was based on the 1959 series and 1987 film of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8ks6yxQkyf4buS6DjKyRvnYQJU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11530'),
  ('972331858440677985', 'The Unusual Suspects', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jessica Redenbach', null, 'Miranda Otto, Aina Dumlao, Michelle Vergara Moore, Lena Cruz, Susana Downes, Toby Leonard Moore, Matt Day, Peter O''Brien', null, 'Follows the theft of a multi-million-dollar necklace and the women from different walks of life who come together to ensure that justice is served.', 'Follows the theft of a multi-million-dollar necklace and the women from different walks of life who come together to ensure that justice is served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMxSrhaESNFiz6dgqa8dx0jj0Uf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125309'),
  ('93738720094753831', 'The Unusuals', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Noah Hawley', null, 'Amber Tamblyn, Jeremy Renner, Harold Perrineau, Adam Goldberg, Joshua Close, Monique Gabriela Curnen, Kai Lennox, Terry Kinney', null, 'Like a modern-day M*A*S*H, The Unusuals explores both the grounded drama and comic insanity of New York City police detectives.', 'Like a modern-day M*A*S*H, The Unusuals explores both the grounded drama and comic insanity of New York City police detectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpxRTb56npkF6gLSYgynPXEy7MT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17385'),
  ('236477849159874420', 'The Unwanted Undead Adventurer', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Ikumi Hasegawa, Mikako Komatsu, Sayumi Suzushiro', 'TV-14', 'Rentt Faina has hunted monsters for the last 10 years. Sadly, he’s not great at his job, stuck hunting slimes and goblins for a few coins each day. His luck turns when he finds an undiscovered path. At the path’s end, he meets his demise in the maw of a legendary dragon. But, he wakes up as an undead bag of bones! He sets out to achieve Existential Evolution and rejoin the land of the living.', 'Rentt Faina has hunted monsters for the last 10 years. Sadly, he’s not great at his job, stuck hunting slimes and goblins for a few coins each day. His luck turns when he finds an undiscovered path. At the path’s end, he meets his demise in the maw of a legendary dragon. But, he wakes up as an undead bag of bones! He sets out to achieve Existential Evolution and rejoin the land of the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQpkZLyw8ID6lZG3djRtihzVWmY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197848'),
  ('163844314527039511', 'The UnXplained', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'William Shatner', 'TV-14', 'Explore the world’s most fascinating, strange and inexplicable mysteries. Each episode features compelling contributions from scientists, historians, witnesses and experiencers—each seeking to shed light on how the seemingly impossible actually can happen.', 'Explore the world’s most fascinating, strange and inexplicable mysteries. Each episode features compelling contributions from scientists, historians, witnesses and experiencers—each seeking to shed light on how the seemingly impossible actually can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4jKrJ03pJPyDJgHGQU6au8gpRL.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:91371'),
  ('824947348428721508', 'The Upper Hand', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Blake Hunter', null, 'Honor Blackman, Kellie Bright, Joe McGann, Diana Weston, William Puttock', null, 'The Upper Hand is a British television sitcom, produced by Central Independent Television and Columbia Pictures Television and broadcast by ITV from 1990 to 1996. The programme was adapted from the American sitcom Who''s the Boss?. As in the former series, an affluent single woman, raising a son with the help of her mother, hires a housekeeper only to have a man apply for the job.', 'The Upper Hand is a British television sitcom, produced by Central Independent Television and Columbia Pictures Television and broadcast by ITV from 1990 to 1996. The programme was adapted from the American sitcom Who''s the Boss?. As in the former series, an affluent single woman, raising a son with the help of her mother, hires a housekeeper only to have a man apply for the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ir9cVYy9uRtlTMcDDB7rZrjSHJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2272'),
  ('203431248722589425', 'The Upshaws', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Regina Y. Hicks, Wanda Sykes', null, 'Mike Epps, Kim Fields, Wanda Sykes, Khali Spraggins, Journey Christine, Jermelle Simon', 'TV-MA', 'Bennie Upshaw, the head of a Black working class family in Indianapolis, is a charming, well-intentioned mechanic and lifelong mess just trying his best to step up and care for his family and tolerate his sardonic sister-in-law, all without a blueprint for success.', 'Bennie Upshaw, the head of a Black working class family in Indianapolis, is a charming, well-intentioned mechanic and lifelong mess just trying his best to step up and care for his family and tolerate his sardonic sister-in-law, all without a blueprint for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgtpwAsKNfqJmgp3zBxuSHMBAaW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:121509'),
  ('413812349117702266', 'The Upstart and the Self-Made Man', 1987, null, null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Kit-wah Leung, Eugina Lau Mei-Guen, Anthony Tang Ho-Kwong, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Debbie Chui, Helena Law Lan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNz2fy5yr0Wws6ig8dLEXCJj63i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108088'),
  ('910473390841047073', 'The Usurper', 2019, 'Drama, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', 'Larissa Andrade', 'Sandra Echeverría, Andrés Palacios, Arap Bethke, Daniela Schmidt, Juan Carlos Barreto, Aurora Gil, Germán Bracco, Macarena Oz', 'TV-14', 'A humble young woman allows herself be manipulated by her twin sister to replace her so she can leave with another man.', 'A humble young woman allows herself be manipulated by her twin sister to replace her so she can leave with another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnBu7Ym3WeMZy2goTl3c2YReVqE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92433'),
  ('820404206956620612', 'The Valhalla Murders', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Thordur Palsson', null, 'Nína Dögg Filippusdóttir, Björn Thors, Bergur Ebbi Benediktsson, Aldís Amah Hamilton, Sigurður Skúlason, Tinna Hrafnsdóttir, Arndís Hrönn Egilsdóttir, Edda Björgvinsdóttir', 'TV-MA', 'An Oslo detective with a painful past returns to his native Iceland to help a dedicated cop hunt a serial killer with a link to a mysterious photo.', 'An Oslo detective with a painful past returns to his native Iceland to help a dedicated cop hunt a serial killer with a link to a mysterious photo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYmFudSTEu7t6a5fWUV3c89d8tQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97405'),
  ('429613430941098095', 'The Valley', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Arved Birnbaum, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Friedrich Mücke, Laura Tonke, Jenny Schily, Christina Große, Arnd Klawitter, Anna Böttcher', null, 'Between forests and hills, the river Ahr meanders through a mystical, foggy autumn landscape. Amidst this idyll a man awakens in the middle of a vineyard. He does not know who he is, where he is or how he came to be here. Next to him is a dead young woman lying among the vines. As a foreigner in the secluded town in the Ahr valley he enters an archaic village community, which seems to keep a secret from him.', 'Between forests and hills, the river Ahr meanders through a mystical, foggy autumn landscape. Amidst this idyll a man awakens in the middle of a vineyard. He does not know who he is, where he is or how he came to be here. Next to him is a dead young woman lying among the vines. As a foreigner in the secluded town in the Ahr valley he enters an archaic village community, which seems to keep a secret from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmheTHvaQYVPS0s4w3qEpkzwcGG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64086'),
  ('925561771899859224', 'The Valley', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'One day they are living the glam party life at SUR with Lisa Vanderpump and the next they''re married and dealing with homeownership and children. From bottle service to baby bottles, close friends and reality stars find their way out of the young and fast life of the Hollywood lights. They are getting ready to grow up and have moved to the serenity of The Valley, where they navigate bustling businesses, rocky relationships and feisty friendships.', 'One day they are living the glam party life at SUR with Lisa Vanderpump and the next they''re married and dealing with homeownership and children. From bottle service to baby bottles, close friends and reality stars find their way out of the young and fast life of the Hollywood lights. They are getting ready to grow up and have moved to the serenity of The Valley, where they navigate bustling businesses, rocky relationships and feisty friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CnDkyevooH4OneksUTBO9OQ8UU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:247758'),
  ('25593204893485220', 'The Valley of The Wolves', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Osman Sınav, Raci Şaşmaz', null, 'Necati Şaşmaz, Özgü Namal, Kenan Çoban, Gürkan Uygun, İpek Tenolcay, Erhan Ufak, Emin Olcay, Serpil Tamur', null, 'Valley of the Wolves was a Turkish television drama which broadcast mainly on Show TV and then transferred to Kanal D, then atv for its last season. It was mostly about an agent named Polat Alemdar who leaked into the mafia after his plastic surgery. The scenario has direct and indirect references to the Turkish politics and political history from a viewpoint of an undercover agent. Valley of the Wolves became one of the most successful TV shows in Turkey and produced a successful feature film named Valley of the Wolves: Iraq.', 'Valley of the Wolves was a Turkish television drama which broadcast mainly on Show TV and then transferred to Kanal D, then atv for its last season. It was mostly about an agent named Polat Alemdar who leaked into the mafia after his plastic surgery. The scenario has direct and indirect references to the Turkish politics and political history from a viewpoint of an undercover agent. Valley of the Wolves became one of the most successful TV shows in Turkey and produced a successful feature film named Valley of the Wolves: Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGi8EuXsf5bbM4O59Uu0pucLcT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34587'),
  ('764063598947020650', 'The Vampire Diaries', 2009, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Julie Plec, Kevin Williamson', null, 'Paul Wesley, Ian Somerhalder, Kat Graham, Candice King, Zach Roerig, Michael Malarkey, Matthew Davis', 'TV-14', 'The story of two vampire brothers obsessed with the same girl, who bears a striking resemblance to the beautiful but ruthless vampire they knew and loved in 1864.', 'The story of two vampire brothers obsessed with the same girl, who bears a striking resemblance to the beautiful but ruthless vampire they knew and loved in 1864.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3vl6wV1W8PBezFfntKTrhrehCY.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:18165'),
  ('511109224275060225', 'The Vampire Dies in No Time', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Makoto Furukawa, Mutsumi Tamura, Natsumi Hioka, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Atsushi Tamaru, Shunichi Toki', 'TV-14', 'In Shin-Yokohama, humans engage in a long, drawn out battle against vampires. Amongst them, the last "true vampire" stands... Will he be a bringer of peace, or destruction?', 'In Shin-Yokohama, humans engage in a long, drawn out battle against vampires. Amongst them, the last "true vampire" stands... Will he be a bringer of peace, or destruction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZFAqdFmg7wHUiJqowTITBxh7C2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112624'),
  ('293726685652205564', 'The Vampires of Midland', 2021, 'Mystery, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Alexey Akimov', null, 'Yuriy Stoyanov, Tatyana Dogileva, Mikhail Gavrilov, Artyom Tkachenko, Olga Medynich, Dmitry Chebotarev, Anastasiya Stezhko, Timofey Kochnev', null, 'Grandpa Slava is the oldest of the Midland vampire family. They live quietly. They live by the law. They live the unremarkable life of an ordinary Russian family and they never kill humans – ever. Although, of course, everyone knows they drink blood. And when some lifeless corpses are found in a birch grove near Smolensk... their peaceful life falls under threat.', 'Grandpa Slava is the oldest of the Midland vampire family. They live quietly. They live by the law. They live the unremarkable life of an ordinary Russian family and they never kill humans – ever. Although, of course, everyone knows they drink blood. And when some lifeless corpses are found in a birch grove near Smolensk... their peaceful life falls under threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AHDGuOm0pefzw4tyZ7s13VAQ8P.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:105136'),
  ('964941410973730560', 'The Vanishing Triangle', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Ivan Kavanagh', 'Sally Tatchell, Rachel Anthony', 'India Mullen, Allen Leech, Adam Richardson, Laoise Sweeney, Fionnuala Murphy, Sarah Carroll, Philip O''Sullivan, Stephen Hogan', 'TV-MA', 'After investigative journalist Lisa Wallace publishes an article about her mother''s murder, other girls start to disappear; she and Detective David Burkely investigate across Ireland, searching for the missing girls while the killer taunts Lisa. Inspired by true events.', 'After investigative journalist Lisa Wallace publishes an article about her mother''s murder, other girls start to disappear; she and Detective David Burkely investigate across Ireland, searching for the missing girls while the killer taunts Lisa. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7hZA4hoXV3iGCZ6Jym8fiDoNUl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209280'),
  ('340098765714475822', 'The Veil', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Park Seok-ho', null, 'Namkoong Min, Park Ha-seon, Kim Ji-eun, Kim Byeong-gi, Lee Kyung-young, Jang Young-nam, Yu Oh-seong, Kim Jong-tae', 'TV-MA', 'Han Ji-hyuk, an NIS agent gone MIA, returns after one year to join a new team as he searches for his lost past.', 'Han Ji-hyuk, an NIS agent gone MIA, returns after one year to join a new team as he searches for his lost past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVMmNwMXrXBmTMn1HtUdpB7RPZw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127358'),
  ('1010180151081089603', 'The Veil', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Elisabeth Moss, Yumna Marwan, Dali Benssalah, Thibault de Montalembert, Josh Charles, James Purefoy', 'TV-MA', 'Two women play a deadly game of truth and lies on the road from Istanbul to Paris and London. One woman has a secret, the other a mission to reveal it before thousands of lives are lost. In the shadows, mission controllers at the CIA and French DGSE must put differences aside and work together to avert potential disaster.', 'Two women play a deadly game of truth and lies on the road from Istanbul to Paris and London. One woman has a secret, the other a mission to reveal it before thousands of lives are lost. In the shadows, mission controllers at the CIA and French DGSE must put differences aside and work together to avert potential disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aM5Lyp3zUtPyc0WVofES6UrV06.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207334'),
  ('964819904190875839', 'The Velvet Collection', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Marta Hazas, Asier Etxeandia, Adrián Lastra, Diego Martín, Javier Rey, Fernando Guallar, Llorenç González, Megan Montaner', null, 'It is the year 1967. After five happy years of marriage in New York with Alberto and their young son, Anna Ribera returns to Spain to take her project Velvet to the next level. She and Alberto had been managing all things Velvet from across the ocean and, together with their best friends and partners, had made a name for Velvet as the number one address in the world of fashion and innovation. Now they decide to take the next step and turn their reputation into a franchise, first at home, then abroad. The first step is opening shop in the other great Spanish city, Barcelona, on its world famous promenade, the Passeig de Gracia. There, the second Velvet Fashion Store is about to open its gates, managed by Ana''s good friend Clara who had made it up the career ladder from seamstress to directorial assistant in the Madrid Velvet years.', 'It is the year 1967. After five happy years of marriage in New York with Alberto and their young son, Anna Ribera returns to Spain to take her project Velvet to the next level. She and Alberto had been managing all things Velvet from across the ocean and, together with their best friends and partners, had made a name for Velvet as the number one address in the world of fashion and innovation. Now they decide to take the next step and turn their reputation into a franchise, first at home, then abroad. The first step is opening shop in the other great Spanish city, Barcelona, on its world famous promenade, the Passeig de Gracia. There, the second Velvet Fashion Store is about to open its gates, managed by Ana''s good friend Clara who had made it up the career ladder from seamstress to directorial assistant in the Madrid Velvet years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYrLZbWKKSUECCQ5CCvpEm6HZma.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74024'),
  ('171290613244643974', 'The Vendetta of An', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', null, null, 'Cheng Yi, Liu Yijun, Wang Jinsong, Zhou Qi, Tong Mengshi, Xu Lu, Ni Dahong, Wang Zixuan', 'TV-14', 'Xie Huai''an, son of the Huben Army''s creator, survives his family''s massacre. After ten long years in hiding, he returns to Chang''an disguised as a lowly registrar, moving step by step through jianghu clashes and palace power plays in a tense battle of wits to avenge his family and safeguard the realm.', 'Xie Huai''an, son of the Huben Army''s creator, survives his family''s massacre. After ten long years in hiding, he returns to Chang''an disguised as a lowly registrar, moving step by step through jianghu clashes and palace power plays in a tense battle of wits to avenge his family and safeguard the realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMwB4BNicfWJl0JhU7YQApcoiHE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254482'),
  ('472951881411548369', 'The Venture Bros.', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Doc Hammer, Christopher McCulloch', null, 'Doc Hammer, Christopher McCulloch, Patrick Warburton, James Urbaniak, Michael Sinterniklaas', 'TV-MA', 'Hank and Dean Venture, with their father Doctor Venture and faithful bodyguard Brock Samson, go on wild adventures facing megalomaniacs, zombies, and suspicious ninjas, all for the glory of adventure. Or something like that.', 'Hank and Dean Venture, with their father Doctor Venture and faithful bodyguard Brock Samson, go on wild adventures facing megalomaniacs, zombies, and suspicious ninjas, all for the glory of adventure. Or something like that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckQE1aLYQkRpp2HmHljiELAiOr1.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2418'),
