  ('179172667725365543', 'The Vertical Line', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mattia Torre', null, 'Valerio Mastandrea, Greta Scarano, Babak Karimi, Antonino Bruschetta, Antonio Catania, Giorgio Tirabassi, Paolo Calabresi, Barbara Ronchi', null, 'Heartfelt Italian comedy-drama about the patients and staff of a hospital oncology ward.', 'Heartfelt Italian comedy-drama about the patients and staff of a hospital oncology ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HaiqcTZnVwWzbXhZRtjRHOdFam.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77411'),
  ('713846230567997482', 'The Vexations of a Shut-In Vampire Princess', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomori Kusunoki, Sayumi Suzushiro, Manaka Iwami, Fairouz Ai, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Yoko Hikasa, Sora Amamiya, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Shut-in vampire Terakomari, or Komari for short, awakens from her slumber to find she''s been promoted to a commander of the army! The thing is, though, her new squad has a reputation for being violently insubordinate. And although Komari was born to a prestigious vampire family, her hatred of blood has made her the picture of mediocrity-scrawny, uncoordinated, and inept at magic. With the odds stacked against her, will the help of her trusty maid be enough for this recluse to blunder her way to success?', 'Shut-in vampire Terakomari, or Komari for short, awakens from her slumber to find she''s been promoted to a commander of the army! The thing is, though, her new squad has a reputation for being violently insubordinate. And although Komari was born to a prestigious vampire family, her hatred of blood has made her the picture of mediocrity-scrawny, uncoordinated, and inept at magic. With the odds stacked against her, will the help of her trusty maid be enough for this recluse to blunder her way to success?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IfQxH5ORqYbsxtCNcUVCwID8Cg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217755'),
  ('1038798275782094008', 'The Vicar of Dibley', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Paul Mayhew-Archer, Richard Curtis', null, 'Dawn French, Emma Chambers, Trevor Peacock, John Bluthal, James Fleet, Gary Waldhorn, Liz Smith, Roger Lloyd Pack', 'TV-PG', 'Reverend Granger is assigned as the Vicar of the rural parish of Dibley, but she is not quite what the villagers expected.', 'Reverend Granger is assigned as the Vicar of the rural parish of Dibley, but she is not quite what the villagers expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSMljUndA07O8eMCSwaal4kcWoq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2767'),
  ('552402806949181776', 'The Vice', 1999, 'Drama', null, 'Barry Simner', 'Caroline Catz, Tim Pigott-Smith, David Harewood, Rosie Marcel, Mel Raido, Tamzin Malleson, Jake Nightingale', null, 'The Vice is an ITV police drama about the Metropolitan Police Vice Unit. It ran for five short series between 1999 and 2003. It tells the story of the London Metropolitan police force''s vice squad, where prostitution, underage sex, and other such organized crime are regular occurrences. Most episodes end in such a way where the main villain is caught but often not in a ''naturally'' concluded way that you would expect with other TV dramas, and often ending an episode with more questions unanswered than answered. The small dedicated team is led by Detective Inspector Pat Chappel who struggles to manage the balance between his home life and his work life - as do the other members of the team. Working in the seedy underworld leads to a continual dilemma for the team - the tension between the Vice Squad and the vice-related crimes that they investigate runs throughout the series and gives the show a rich viewing experience. The programme often blurs the line of the team staying on the right side of the law, as almost every member of the team at different points submits briefly or permanently to the temptations of either sex, drugs, money or honey traps. Sometimes with drastic consequences.', 'The Vice is an ITV police drama about the Metropolitan Police Vice Unit. It ran for five short series between 1999 and 2003. It tells the story of the London Metropolitan police force''s vice squad, where prostitution, underage sex, and other such organized crime are regular occurrences. Most episodes end in such a way where the main villain is caught but often not in a ''naturally'' concluded way that you would expect with other TV dramas, and often ending an episode with more questions unanswered than answered. The small dedicated team is led by Detective Inspector Pat Chappel who struggles to manage the balance between his home life and his work life - as do the other members of the team. Working in the seedy underworld leads to a continual dilemma for the team - the tension between the Vice Squad and the vice-related crimes that they investigate runs throughout the series and gives the show a rich viewing experience. The programme often blurs the line of the team staying on the right side of the law, as almost every member of the team at different points submits briefly or permanently to the temptations of either sex, drugs, money or honey traps. Sometimes with drastic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppblehy6Ezs8AeAlqwA3Q6vgQyP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:17766'),
  ('22564058263071194', 'The Victim', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Rob Williams', 'Rob Williams', 'Kelly Macdonald, James Harkness, John Hannah, Jamie Sives, Karla Crome, John Scougall, Isis Hainsworth, Chloe Pirrie', null, 'A grieving mother is accused of identifying online the man she believes killed her son. But is he really a notorious child murderer or a tragic victim of mistaken identity?', 'A grieving mother is accused of identifying online the man she believes killed her son. But is he really a notorious child murderer or a tragic victim of mistaken identity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow8vlCfGzZuUxipm0CNGRiCnSiX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88129'),
  ('1041443287159406781', 'The Victims'' Game', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Chen Kuan-chung, David Chuang', 'Chien Shih-Keng, Huang Yu Chia, Kong Hiu-Yan', 'Joseph Chang, Hsu Wei-ning, Wang Shih-sian, Tarcy Su, Dean Fujioka, Moon Lee, Terrance Lau Chun-Him, Chang Tsai-hsing', null, 'After discovering his estranged daughter''s link to mysterious murders, a forensic detective with Asperger''s syndrome risks everything to solve the case.', 'After discovering his estranged daughter''s link to mysterious murders, a forensic detective with Asperger''s syndrome risks everything to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGINJfhBDzUNEYx3fUKooSlgITe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101146'),
  ('122640762983668841', 'The Vietnam War', 2017, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'Peter Coyote', 'TV-MA', 'An immersive 360-degree narrative telling the epic story of the Vietnam War as it has never before been told on film. Featuring testimony from nearly 80 witnesses, including many Americans who fought in the war and others who opposed it, as well as Vietnamese combatants and civilians from both the winning and losing sides.', 'An immersive 360-degree narrative telling the epic story of the Vietnam War as it has never before been told on film. Featuring testimony from nearly 80 witnesses, including many Americans who fought in the war and others who opposed it, as well as Vietnamese combatants and civilians from both the winning and losing sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKt4lYTA4YmfBUH5Vtd7qqgqGBW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46434'),
  ('430836068554907403', 'The View', 1997, 'Talk', 'Barbara Walters, Bill Geddie', null, 'Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Whoopi Goldberg, Alyssa Farah Griffin, Ana Navarro', 'TV-14', 'ABC Daytime''s morning chatfest, currently featuring Whoopi Goldberg, Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Alyssa Farah Griffin, and Ana Navarro discussing the most exciting events of the day. Hot topics in the news, the best experts in their field, celebrity interviews and general entertainment are all part of The View.', 'ABC Daytime''s morning chatfest, currently featuring Whoopi Goldberg, Joy Behar, Sunny Hostin, Sara Haines, Alyssa Farah Griffin, and Ana Navarro discussing the most exciting events of the day. Hot topics in the news, the best experts in their field, celebrity interviews and general entertainment are all part of The View.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEUNIxCMh2jFjUj7u09f4O5CcR4.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:2221'),
  ('612470877770912039', 'The Village', 2013, 'Drama', 'Peter Moffat', null, 'David Ryall, Tom Varey, Maxine Peake, John Simm, Charlie Murphy, Emily Beecham, Rupert Evans, Augustus Prew', null, 'The Village is a BBC television drama created and written by Peter Moffat. Consisting of two six-episode series—the project intended as a 42-hour televised epic—the first series covers 1914 to 1920; the second continued the story into the 1920s. However, it was not commissioned for a third series. An epic drama charting the turbulent times experienced by one English village throughout the 20th century; births, deaths, political events and rebellions are among the events that occur during the time. Bert Middleton lives across the entire 100-year period, and his story from boyhood to old age forms the crux of the story, seen via flashbacks as Bert is interviewed in the present day by a documentarian working on a project about the second eldest man in the United Kingdom and his village.', 'The Village is a BBC television drama created and written by Peter Moffat. Consisting of two six-episode series—the project intended as a 42-hour televised epic—the first series covers 1914 to 1920; the second continued the story into the 1920s. However, it was not commissioned for a third series. An epic drama charting the turbulent times experienced by one English village throughout the 20th century; births, deaths, political events and rebellions are among the events that occur during the time. Bert Middleton lives across the entire 100-year period, and his story from boyhood to old age forms the crux of the story, seen via flashbacks as Bert is interviewed in the present day by a documentarian working on a project about the second eldest man in the United Kingdom and his village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojTX0B5o5yI2mKkLyyTxaKoPvWL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:46878'),
  ('603205035459421450', 'The Village', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mike Daniels', null, 'Lorraine Toussaint, Dominic Chianese, Frankie Faison, Grace Van Dien, Daren Kagasoff, Michaela McManus, Warren Christie, Moran Atias', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to the Village, an apartment building in Brooklyn that appears like any other from the outside but is quite unique inside. The people who reside here have built a bonded family of friends and neighbors.', 'Welcome to the Village, an apartment building in Brooklyn that appears like any other from the outside but is quite unique inside. The people who reside here have built a bonded family of friends and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhOrzKjnNpKtNQuGABj5ygAc9Kn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81948'),
  ('322402001755904976', 'The Village', 2023, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Milind Rau', 'Milind Rau, Deeraj Vaidy, Deepthi Govindarajan', 'Arya, John Kokken, Aadukalam Naren, Muthukumar, Divya Pillai, Baby Aazhiya, Thalaivasal Vijay, George Mariyan', 'TV-MA', 'In the desolate hinterlands of Tamil Nadu, a stranded urbanite enlists the help of three locals to find his missing family believed to have been abducted by nefarious beings of a cursed village. Meanwhile, a maniacal heir to a pharma empire sends a group of mercenaries to the same village to retrieve something long forgotten. Will they come out of this terror-stricken night alive?', 'In the desolate hinterlands of Tamil Nadu, a stranded urbanite enlists the help of three locals to find his missing family believed to have been abducted by nefarious beings of a cursed village. Meanwhile, a maniacal heir to a pharma empire sends a group of mercenaries to the same village to retrieve something long forgotten. Will they come out of this terror-stricken night alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3amr8DNfvhszpTR7wzr3Rb3RM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200879'),
  ('847812302869001525', 'The Village: Achiara''s Secret', 2015, 'Mystery', null, 'Do Hyun-jung', 'Moon Geun-young, Yook Sung-jae, Shin Eun-kyung, On Ju-wan, Jang Hee-jin, Park Eun-seok, Kim Min-jae, Lee Yul-eum', null, 'Achiara is a quiet, peaceful village with hardly any crime. But on her first day of school there, English language instructor Kim So-yoon discovers a buried corpse. As the townspeople speculate on the identity of the dead person and the reason she was killed, So-yoon and policeman Park Woo-jae become determined to solve the mystery.', 'Achiara is a quiet, peaceful village with hardly any crime. But on her first day of school there, English language instructor Kim So-yoon discovers a buried corpse. As the townspeople speculate on the identity of the dead person and the reason she was killed, So-yoon and policeman Park Woo-jae become determined to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/layQ0TmOUDPVEOsP3XPiR7C1LQP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63929'),
  ('310837062731826817', 'The Villainess Is Adored by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mai Fuchigami, Yuuichirou Umehara, Takuya Sato, Yumiri Hanamori', null, 'Tiararose Lapis Clamentile is set to marry Hartknights, crown prince of Lapis Lazuli—until she suddenly remembers her past life and realizes she’s been reincarnated into her favorite game, The Ring of Lapis Lazuli, as the doomed villainess! But just as she’s about to lose hope, the crown prince of Aquasteed proposes instead. Could this unexpected turn finally lead to a happy ending of her own?', 'Tiararose Lapis Clamentile is set to marry Hartknights, crown prince of Lapis Lazuli—until she suddenly remembers her past life and realizes she’s been reincarnated into her favorite game, The Ring of Lapis Lazuli, as the doomed villainess! But just as she’s about to lose hope, the crown prince of Aquasteed proposes instead. Could this unexpected turn finally lead to a happy ending of her own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h96XGrKnxMLns3QZVDytji37Ng6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295483'),
  ('1052738000936749252', 'The Villains of Valley View', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Chris Peterson, Bryan Moore', null, 'Isabella Pappas, Malachi Barton, Reed Horstmann, Kayden Muller-Janssen, James Patrick Stuart, Lucy Davis', 'TV-Y7', 'A family of raucous supervillains who recently ran afoul of the League of Villains and now must somehow beat a path to normalcy in a small Texas town.', 'A family of raucous supervillains who recently ran afoul of the League of Villains and now must somehow beat a path to normalcy in a small Texas town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q4QWFm2SOyjeJniHi8ncTRc2iU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153715'),
  ('549242622721978510', 'The Vince Staples Show', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Maurice Williams, Vince Staples, Ian Edelman', null, 'Vince Staples', 'TV-MA', 'Kind of famous and sort of rich, rapper and actor Vince Staples navigates the challenges and surprises of everyday life in his hometown of The Beach.', 'Kind of famous and sort of rich, rapper and actor Vince Staples navigates the challenges and surprises of everyday life in his hometown of The Beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyUKo6ILKVwuiVq4EWv1avEXpBp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243861'),
  ('1023049320770017488', 'The Vineyard', 2021, 'Drama', 'Susana López Rubio', null, 'Leonor Watling, Rafael Novoa, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Juana Acosta, Esmeralda Pimentel, Nathaniel Parker, Alejandro de la Madrid, Raúl Briones', 'TV-MA', 'Mauro Larrea and Soledad Montalvo are two strangers whose destinies cross in the second half of the 19th century, leading to their lives changing forever. A history of glories and defeats, of silver mines, family intrigues, vineyards, wineries, and fascinating cities whose splendor faded over time.', 'Mauro Larrea and Soledad Montalvo are two strangers whose destinies cross in the second half of the 19th century, leading to their lives changing forever. A history of glories and defeats, of silver mines, family intrigues, vineyards, wineries, and fascinating cities whose splendor faded over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koLnCEa4Pzm9d5IQQeBjaCAIRJz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118587'),
  ('593286014413908262', 'The Virgin Queen', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Paula Milne', 'Anne-Marie Duff, Tom Hardy, Ian Hart, Dexter Fletcher, Joanne Whalley, Ben Daniels, Kevin McKidd, Emilia Fox', null, 'The Virgin Queen explores the full sweep of Elizabeth''s life: from her days of fear as a potential victim of her sister''s terror; through her great love affair with Robert Dudley; into her years of triumph over the Armada; and finally her old age and her last, enigmatic relationship with her young protégé, the Earl of Essex.', 'The Virgin Queen explores the full sweep of Elizabeth''s life: from her days of fear as a potential victim of her sister''s terror; through her great love affair with Robert Dudley; into her years of triumph over the Armada; and finally her old age and her last, enigmatic relationship with her young protégé, the Earl of Essex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcjkkS23K7EKZv5vLLjqidI3Fmc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13710'),
  ('596191662972857624', 'The Virgin Wife', 2005, 'Drama, Soap', 'Caridad Bravo Adams, Liliana Abud', null, 'Lilia Aragón, Adela Noriega, Jorge Salinas, Sergio Sendel, Delia Casanova, Roberto Ballesteros, Alejandro Ruiz, Luis Bayardo', null, 'La esposa virgen is a Mexican telenovela that first aired in 2005. Produced by Salvador Mejia, it starred Adela Noriega and Jorge Salinas.', 'La esposa virgen is a Mexican telenovela that first aired in 2005. Produced by Salvador Mejia, it starred Adela Noriega and Jorge Salinas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOEP6jdY4INbHl53RpBnBaukJbS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40298'),
  ('1076731048322393463', 'The Virginian', 1962, 'Western, Drama', null, null, 'Doug McClure, James Drury, Lee Majors, Stewart Granger', 'TV-PG', 'The Shiloh Ranch in Wyoming Territory of the 1890s is owned in sequence by Judge Henry Garth, the Grainger brothers, and Colonel Alan MacKenzie. It is the setting for a variety of stories, many more based on character and relationships than the usual western.', 'The Shiloh Ranch in Wyoming Territory of the 1890s is owned in sequence by Judge Henry Garth, the Grainger brothers, and Colonel Alan MacKenzie. It is the setting for a variety of stories, many more based on character and relationships than the usual western.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAbCE44r6wtmAnfzZI2SxyeaBmW.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:10180'),
  ('648228221818583994', 'The Virtues', 2019, 'Drama', 'Shane Meadows', null, 'Stephen Graham, Niamh Algar, Helen Behan, Frank Laverty, Mark O''Halloran, Deirdre Donnelly, James Nelson-Joyce, Liam Carney', 'TV-MA', 'Joseph falls into despair when his nine-year-old son Shea leaves for Australia with his ex Debbie. Suffering the hangover from hell, he walks away from his present life and boards a boat bound for Ireland to confront memories from his childhood.', 'Joseph falls into despair when his nine-year-old son Shea leaves for Australia with his ex Debbie. Suffering the hangover from hell, he walks away from his present life and boards a boat bound for Ireland to confront memories from his childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj6eGPbkGGoGW8vSTZdSF2svBZt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87932'),
  ('174625759789717170', 'The Vision of Escaflowne', 1996, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Ryota Yamaguchi', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Tomokazu Seki, Shin-ichiro Miki, Mayumi Izuka, Minami Takayama, Jouji Nakata, Yuri Amano, Ikue Otani', 'TV-14', 'High school student Hitomi is transported from Earth to the magical world of Gaea, where she meets boy prince Van Fanel, and is caught up in his quest to unite the countries of Gaea against the ominous Zaibach empire. On the way, she discovers an hidden ability and strives to unravel layers of mystery surrounding Van, his past, and the giant machine known as Escaflowne.', 'High school student Hitomi is transported from Earth to the magical world of Gaea, where she meets boy prince Van Fanel, and is caught up in his quest to unite the countries of Gaea against the ominous Zaibach empire. On the way, she discovers an hidden ability and strives to unravel layers of mystery surrounding Van, his past, and the giant machine known as Escaflowne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uX0Q7Sn9JYWbHqQ5ZRJoJKcTmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8779'),
  ('527061499549554698', 'The Visitor', 1997, 'Drama', 'Dean Devlin', null, 'John Corbett, Grand L. Bush, Leon Rippy, John Storey, Steve Railsback', null, 'The Visitor is a science fiction television series created by Roland Emmerich and Dean Devlin which aired on Fox from 1997–1998. It starred John Corbett as Adam McArthur who was abducted by extraterrestrials 50 years earlier and escapes back to Earth to help improve life for humanity.', 'The Visitor is a science fiction television series created by Roland Emmerich and Dean Devlin which aired on Fox from 1997–1998. It starred John Corbett as Adam McArthur who was abducted by extraterrestrials 50 years earlier and escapes back to Earth to help improve life for humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlJR5IMAp4eZC66H8VoeSAXxPmp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12011'),
  ('823270416424433226', 'The Visitor from the Future', 2009, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'François Descraques', 'François Descraques', 'Florent Dorin, Raphaël Descraques, Slimane-Baptiste Berhoun, Mathieu Poggi, Isabel Jeannin, Justine Le Pottier, Sabine Perraud, Samuel Brafman', null, 'The Visitor from the Future is a cross-media series that combines comedy and science fiction. Since its launch in April 2009, it was viewed 5 million times on the French web and was aired on the TV channel NOLIFE.', 'The Visitor from the Future is a cross-media series that combines comedy and science fiction. Since its launch in April 2009, it was viewed 5 million times on the French web and was aired on the TV channel NOLIFE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMZ9zp2P6qWm4kMz4PwkDU5qN1E.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60013'),
  ('177377612743945458', 'The Visitors', 1983, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Jindřich Polák, Ota Hofman', null, null, null, 'It''s the year 2484 and the Earth is threatened by a rogue comet which could fatally change its orbit. The solution is surprising - Adam Bernau, the greatest genius of 20th century developed 500 years ago an ingenious formula for easy transporting of continents and even worlds. Unfortunately, he made this discovery at the age of 11 and the exercise book containing it was destroyed in the fire. But this is not a challenge to Academic Filip who decides to send an expedition back in time to retrieve the precious exercise book from the fire. But everything is not so simple as it seems...', 'It''s the year 2484 and the Earth is threatened by a rogue comet which could fatally change its orbit. The solution is surprising - Adam Bernau, the greatest genius of 20th century developed 500 years ago an ingenious formula for easy transporting of continents and even worlds. Unfortunately, he made this discovery at the age of 11 and the exercise book containing it was destroyed in the fire. But this is not a challenge to Academic Filip who decides to send an expedition back in time to retrieve the precious exercise book from the fire. But everything is not so simple as it seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY0e2zKHhgwOmp21QlGOAu8YgFu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5464'),
  ('478457439228552896', 'The Voice', 2011, 'Reality', 'Roel van Velzen, John de Mol', null, 'Carson Daly, Adam Levine, Kelly Clarkson, John Legend', 'TV-PG', 'The strongest vocalists from across the United states compete in a blockbusters vocal competition, the winner becomes “The Voice.” The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'The strongest vocalists from across the United states compete in a blockbusters vocal competition, the winner becomes “The Voice.” The show''s innovative format features four stages of competition: the blind auditions, the battle rounds, the knockouts and, finally, the live performance shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jgjykcCuQ5rYreyqba4mazNKYd.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:37678'),
  ('276049544053250833', 'The Voice', 2012, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Sonia Kruger, Kate Miller-Heidke, Melanie C, Ronan Keating, Richard Marx', 'NR', 'Contestants compete in a singing competition that focuses on the quality of their voice.', 'Contestants compete in a singing competition that focuses on the quality of their voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t79aBTcPC4vEeeDMv8cWE9tnVwe.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:39845'),
  ('54206989750544368', 'The Voice', 2025, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Bryn Terfel, Aleighcia Scott, Ywain Gwynedd, Bronwen Lewis, Sian Eleri', null, '"Y Llais" is the Welsh-language adaptation of the globally popular singing competition, The Voice. Airing on S4C, the show features four renowned coaches searching for the best Welsh-speaking vocal talent. Contestants compete through blind auditions, battles, and live performances, aiming to win the title of Y Llais champion. With a focus on vocal ability and mentorship, the series celebrates the rich musical heritage of Wales.', '"Y Llais" is the Welsh-language adaptation of the globally popular singing competition, The Voice. Airing on S4C, the show features four renowned coaches searching for the best Welsh-speaking vocal talent. Contestants compete through blind auditions, battles, and live performances, aiming to win the title of Y Llais champion. With a focus on vocal ability and mentorship, the series celebrates the rich musical heritage of Wales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb4zib3ua021MiEwA1MPUx2QMC4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284226'),
  ('490545557673447590', 'The Voice - Norges beste stemme', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Espen Lind, Jarle Bernhoft, Marion Ravn, Ingebjørg Bratland', null, 'A reality singing competition, featuring blind auditions where coaches, who are popular artists, select and train singing talents based solely on their voice. The show emphasizes vocal quality, with coaches occasionally performing alongside their chosen talents.', 'A reality singing competition, featuring blind auditions where coaches, who are popular artists, select and train singing talents based solely on their voice. The show emphasizes vocal quality, with coaches occasionally performing alongside their chosen talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUclkMi49cD6t0nCrG9kAm4rIih.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:115528'),
