  ('839265662136347689', 'Themis', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Alice Chan Wai, Kalok Chow, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Mark Ma, Joman Chiang, Joey Thye', null, 'High Court Judge Yin Wai-chi sacrifices her prestigious career to become a Juvenile Court judge, dedicated to redeeming delinquent youths and upholding justice.', 'High Court Judge Yin Wai-chi sacrifices her prestigious career to become a Juvenile Court judge, dedicated to redeeming delinquent youths and upholding justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueuFQumoj6YDePVSCqErrDxsC9Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277412'),
  ('106373923150108396', 'Then You Run', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ben Chanan', null, 'Leah McNamara, Lise Risom Olsen, Francis Magee, Richard Coyle, Christian Rubeck, Cillian O''Sullivan, Vivian Oparah, Yasmin Monet Prince', null, 'A close-knit group of rebellious London teenagers are on a getaway in Rotterdam. But after the estranged father of Tara is discovered dead, they find themselves on the run across Europe with three kilos of heroin and a host of deadly criminals snapping at their heels.', 'A close-knit group of rebellious London teenagers are on a getaway in Rotterdam. But after the estranged father of Tara is discovered dead, they find themselves on the run across Europe with three kilos of heroin and a host of deadly criminals snapping at their heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6Eb0ZxmnZM1YJN5MLiDiAZSNPh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155495'),
  ('935760216080125150', 'Theodore Roosevelt', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', null, null, 'Rufus Jones, Greg Kriek, Mark Elderkin, Traverse Le Goff', null, 'The two-part premium miniseries event on Theodore Roosevelt, the first modern President of the United States, will provide a rich, panoramic biography weaving Roosevelt''s captivating personal story while revealing little-known truths behind his expansive curiosity, restless spirit and the profound, lasting impact he has had on the country.', 'The two-part premium miniseries event on Theodore Roosevelt, the first modern President of the United States, will provide a rich, panoramic biography weaving Roosevelt''s captivating personal story while revealing little-known truths behind his expansive curiosity, restless spirit and the profound, lasting impact he has had on the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytL9AXuy82mxK5zvoAfZ2BtI3u5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103173'),
  ('289972639225168191', 'Theodosia', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Family', null, null, 'Eloise Little, Nana Agyeman-Bediako, Frankie Minchella, Julie Lamberton, Louis Martino, Rik Young', 'TV-Y7', 'In 1906 London, 14-year-old Theodosia “Theo” Throckmorton gathers an eclectic team that includes her younger brother Henry, along with friends Will and Egyptian Princess, Safiya, to fight a powerful secret society bent on destroying the world with ancient Egyptian dark magic.', 'In 1906 London, 14-year-old Theodosia “Theo” Throckmorton gathers an eclectic team that includes her younger brother Henry, along with friends Will and Egyptian Princess, Safiya, to fight a powerful secret society bent on destroying the world with ancient Egyptian dark magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tH2zDZIaKSRsSef55DGueNh4mI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139061'),
  ('614975329330928455', 'Theory of Love', 2019, 'Drama', 'JittiRain', null, 'Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Atthaphan Phunsawat, Nawat Phumphothingam, Chinnarat Siriphongchawalit, Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Sara Legge, Neen Suwanamas, Patara Eksangkul', null, 'Third is a filmology major and a member of the Savage Team along with his best friends Two, Bone, and Khai, but he has a secret. Third has been secretly in love with Khai for years. For three years he has kept his.', 'Third is a filmology major and a member of the Savage Team along with his best friends Two, Bone, and Khai, but he has a secret. Third has been secretly in love with Khai for years. For three years he has kept his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SvjtBxQ3Cc1mWBRlpCK8RuNiMG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89672'),
  ('1029177039311621155', 'There She Goes', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shaun Pye', null, 'David Tennant, Jessica Hynes, Edan Hayhurst, Miley Locke, Yasmine Akram, Oliver Gibbs', null, 'Comedy drama that shines a light on the day-to-day life of a family looking after their severely learning disabled girl, Rosie.', 'Comedy drama that shines a light on the day-to-day life of a family looking after their severely learning disabled girl, Rosie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3avC6D2zt0C28xFMWgziRYNwfSp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83625'),
  ('956366162499853344', 'There Was a Cute Girl in the Hero''s Party, So I Tried Confessing to Her', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-14', 'Yoki was once a human but reincarnated into a demon. He now holds a middling position serving the Demon King tasked with taking down the hero party. But when he finally faces them, Yoki thinks... ""No way… she''s perfect."" Of all things, he fell in love at first sight with Cecilia, the priest of the hero party! Her serious gaze, her every little gesture—everything about her is too cute! She''s an angel! And so, Yoki made up his mind that he would confess his feelings to her.', 'Yoki was once a human but reincarnated into a demon. He now holds a middling position serving the Demon King tasked with taking down the hero party. But when he finally faces them, Yoki thinks... ""No way… she''s perfect."" Of all things, he fell in love at first sight with Cecilia, the priest of the hero party! Her serious gaze, her every little gesture—everything about her is too cute! She''s an angel! And so, Yoki made up his mind that he would confess his feelings to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUIuuvxthqaK4euFHTNIsRmdf3s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295366'),
  ('160584315996092483', 'There Will Be Ample Time', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Suxi, Li Xueqin, Shi Ce, Ren Bin, Wu Xingjian, Wu Yuheng, Zhang Chi, Zeng Kelang', null, 'Four childhood friends—Zhang Pei, Gou Dandan, Dong Jiaxi, and Wu Yun—reunite in their hometown after years apart. Each returns for different reasons, from career changes to family responsibilities. As they navigate new challenges, they rediscover friendship, family, and love while finding new purpose in life.', 'Four childhood friends—Zhang Pei, Gou Dandan, Dong Jiaxi, and Wu Yun—reunite in their hometown after years apart. Each returns for different reasons, from career changes to family responsibilities. As they navigate new challenges, they rediscover friendship, family, and love while finding new purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cUblTrnh6LX0M2zbx13IeTVtj0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238085'),
  ('42189233772953323', 'There''s No Freaking Way I''ll Be Your Lover! Unless...', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanna Nakamura, Saori Onishi, Yukari Anzai, Kana Ichinose, Takako Tanaka, Mayu Sagara', null, 'Renako Amaori is leaving her awkward and lonely junior high school life behind, determined to become a normal girl with normal friends in high school. Glamorous, confident Mai Ouzuka is Renako’s total opposite: wealthy, outgoing, and a literal fashion model. Against the odds, the two girls form an immediate connection. Renako thinks she may have found the best friend of her dreams…until Mai’s romantic confession sends her into a tailspin. Renako wants to prove to Mai that being BFFs is better than being girlfriends, but Mai is dead set on convincing Renako that they’re destined to be lovers.', 'Renako Amaori is leaving her awkward and lonely junior high school life behind, determined to become a normal girl with normal friends in high school. Glamorous, confident Mai Ouzuka is Renako’s total opposite: wealthy, outgoing, and a literal fashion model. Against the odds, the two girls form an immediate connection. Renako thinks she may have found the best friend of her dreams…until Mai’s romantic confession sends her into a tailspin. Renako wants to prove to Mai that being BFFs is better than being girlfriends, but Mai is dead set on convincing Renako that they’re destined to be lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zb3FK85DijFCOlT7ghGtfcZCGOC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277513'),
  ('818764296576967274', 'Thermae Romae Novae', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Satoshi Hino, Tsutomu Isobe, Asami Seto, Shuichi Ikeda, Takahiro Sakurai, Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'TV-MA', 'A proud bath architect in ancient Rome starts randomly surfacing in present-day Japan, where he''s inspired by the many bathing innovations he finds.', 'A proud bath architect in ancient Rome starts randomly surfacing in present-day Japan, where he''s inspired by the many bathing innovations he finds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHBI6uDKqI1w0PUt8y1y0yetaq0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112169'),
  ('709065113935851645', 'TheWeekend', 2024, 'News, Talk', null, null, 'Jacqueline Alemany, Eugene Daniels, Jonathan Capehart, Michael Steele, Alicia Menendez, Symone Sanders', null, 'Jonathan Capehart, Eugene Daniels, and Jackie Alemany team up to bring their wide range of political expertise every Saturday and Sunday morning. Fresh analysis of the week''s biggest events and a rotating crew of major newsmakers.', 'Jonathan Capehart, Eugene Daniels, and Jackie Alemany team up to bring their wide range of political expertise every Saturday and Sunday morning. Fresh analysis of the week''s biggest events and a rotating crew of major newsmakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOHQBdB3Brr90TaiSXE78nPXANV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:29135'),
  ('699771458599648314', 'They and I', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Costas Pretederis', 'Costas Pretederis', 'Giannis Bezos, Loukia Pistiola, Rania Papadakou, Niki Sereti, Valeria Kouroupi, Tasos Kostis, Panos Hatzikoutselis, Sotiris Skantzikas', null, 'The adventures of a vulture, an exquisite, handsome and particularly charming man who loves and is loved too much by women.', 'The adventures of a vulture, an exquisite, handsome and particularly charming man who loves and is loved too much by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6BijwiD9n6o3qcdTFAZtUjVIy9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17020'),
  ('800798887586237694', 'They Are My Noble Masters', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Asuka Minamori, Yuko Goto, Tomokazu Seki, Yosuke Akimoto', null, 'Uesugi Ren and his sister Mihato ran away from home because of domestic violence. When they at last reach the city they have a hard time finding work to earn some money. They eventually enter the service of the Kuonji family, making a pledge of absolute loyalty. Thus Ren''s days of being a butler to the demanding Kuonji heir begins...', 'Uesugi Ren and his sister Mihato ran away from home because of domestic violence. When they at last reach the city they have a hard time finding work to earn some money. They eventually enter the service of the Kuonji family, making a pledge of absolute loyalty. Thus Ren''s days of being a butler to the demanding Kuonji heir begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grGacfAwNtsqPfrhNwcx34q7ftx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79044'),
  ('1132334230955163460', 'They Call Me Magic', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paul Westhead, Jeanie Buss, Magic Johnson, Michael Cooper, Jerry West, Byron Scott, Larry Bird, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar', 'TV-MA', 'Earvin “Magic” Johnson is an icon for the ages—from humble beginnings to the Dream Team to business titan. Featuring interviews with President Obama, Larry Bird, Pat Riley, and more, this docuseries charts the life and career of a legend.', 'Earvin “Magic” Johnson is an icon for the ages—from humble beginnings to the Dream Team to business titan. Featuring interviews with President Obama, Larry Bird, Pat Riley, and more, this docuseries charts the life and career of a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJKpiQYPiCfmsiwVKAMBcF65puR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157002'),
  ('933886191847129732', 'They Think It''s All Over', 1995, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Nick Hancock, Gary Lineker, David Gower, David Seaman, Jonathan Ross, Ian Wright, Des Lynam, Phil Tufnell', null, 'They Think It''s All Over is a British comedy panel game with a sporting theme produced by Talkback and shown on BBC One. The show''s name is taken from Kenneth Wolstenholme''s famous 1966 World Cup commentary quotation, "they think it''s all over...it is now!" and the show used the phrase as the last line of every programme. In 2006 the show was axed after 11 years of being on-air.', 'They Think It''s All Over is a British comedy panel game with a sporting theme produced by Talkback and shown on BBC One. The show''s name is taken from Kenneth Wolstenholme''s famous 1966 World Cup commentary quotation, "they think it''s all over...it is now!" and the show used the phrase as the last line of every programme. In 2006 the show was axed after 11 years of being on-air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDcjD4PchrJIfwYyvIqmtHY5uCp.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:2469'),
  ('1140167340175725859', 'They Were Ten', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'Agatha Christie', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Matilda Lutz, Romane Bohringer, Marianne Denicourt, Patrick Mille, Manon Azem, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Nassim Lyes', 'TV-MA', 'Ten people, five women, five men, are invited to a luxury hotel on a deserted tropical island. They soon realize they are completely isolated, cut off from the rest of the word and all means of communication, which rapidly becomes their worst nightmare.', 'Ten people, five women, five men, are invited to a luxury hotel on a deserted tropical island. They soon realize they are completely isolated, cut off from the rest of the word and all means of communication, which rapidly becomes their worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vowNBCgOrKVvAI98KVzDdCcBCdi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106084'),
  ('807861082182054543', 'Thicker Than Water', 2014, 'Drama', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer', 'Veronica Zacco, Morgan Jensen, Niklas Rockström', 'Joel Spira, Björn Bengtsson, Aliette Opheim, Saga Sarkola, Jessica Grabowsky, Molly Nutley, Tobias Zilliacus, Stina Ekblad', null, 'The beautiful island of Sunnanö in the Swedish archipelago is home to a popular B&B run by Anna-Lisa and her son Oskar. Anna-Lisa has summoned her daughter Jonna, an actress, and son Lasse, an opportunist, to the island. It is the first time in years that they are together again. When Anna-Lisa is found dead one morning, the siblings learn that she had terminal cancer: Her will stipulates that all three siblings must run the family B&B together for a year, or they won''t inherit it at all. It is a mother’s last effort to reunite her children. But it will also confront them with the family’s unsolved past, present forces of attraction, and a very dark secret buried in a most unfortunate place...', 'The beautiful island of Sunnanö in the Swedish archipelago is home to a popular B&B run by Anna-Lisa and her son Oskar. Anna-Lisa has summoned her daughter Jonna, an actress, and son Lasse, an opportunist, to the island. It is the first time in years that they are together again. When Anna-Lisa is found dead one morning, the siblings learn that she had terminal cancer: Her will stipulates that all three siblings must run the family B&B together for a year, or they won''t inherit it at all. It is a mother’s last effort to reunite her children. But it will also confront them with the family’s unsolved past, present forces of attraction, and a very dark secret buried in a most unfortunate place...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qppTL3aFz2qxy6J6jHyqfZdlJNi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65344'),
  ('876964820828282983', 'Thicker Than Water', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Nawell Madani, Simon Jablonka', 'Mohamed Benyekhlef, Simon Jablonka, Nawell Madani', 'Nawell Madani, Kahina Carina, Carima Amarouche, Paola Locatelli, Djebril Zonga, Paul Hamy, Vincent Rottiers, Walid Afkir', 'TV-MA', 'A journalist''s life devolves into chaos when she shields her brother from the law, inadvertently entangling her family in a drug lord''s merciless scheme.', 'A journalist''s life devolves into chaos when she shields her brother from the law, inadvertently entangling her family in a drug lord''s merciless scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDVfTRXMP5iwO7EgmVA5ivUwli4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222559'),
  ('981540999689113031', 'Thief', 2006, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Andre Braugher, Yancey Arias, Malik Yoba, Mae Whitman, Clifton Collins Jr., Michael Rooker, Will Yun Lee', null, 'Nick Atwater, the leader of a robbery crew, is balancing his personal life with the planning of a major heist while being targeted by a relentless cop and the Chinese mafia.', 'Nick Atwater, the leader of a robbery crew, is balancing his personal life with the planning of a major heist while being targeted by a relentless cop and the Chinese mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKbOJ6Cgsg0yxZvvxGEZvKG4T67.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3929'),
  ('871306385104914137', 'Thieves of the Wood', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Pieter Van Hees, Maarten Moerkerke, Robin Pront', 'Christophe Dirickx, Benjamin Sprengers', 'Matteo Simoni, Stef Aerts, Jeroen Perceval, Dirk Roofthooft, Tom van Dyck, Anne-Laure Vandeputte, Charlotte Timmers, Anemone Valcke', 'TV-MA', 'Charismatic highwayman Jan de Lichte leads the oppressed and downtrodden in a revolt against the corrupt aristocracy of 18th-century Belgium.', 'Charismatic highwayman Jan de Lichte leads the oppressed and downtrodden in a revolt against the corrupt aristocracy of 18th-century Belgium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQNOzoiaIQWxJAx8OUighnvnhRA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93533'),
  ('778499730201502121', 'Thin Blue Line', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cilla Jackert', null, 'Amanda Jansson, Oscar Töringe, Per Lasson, Anna Sise, Sandra Stojiljkovic, Mustafa Al-Mashhadani', null, 'Swedish drama series about police officers in Malmö, their tiring work and the difficulties of keeping their personal and professional life separate.', 'Swedish drama series about police officers in Malmö, their tiring work and the difficulties of keeping their personal and professional life separate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quDsL13MvDoGI9aX2xddQ3wwFTW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:116944'),
  ('74397993044382916', 'Thin Ice', 2020, 'Drama', 'Cecilie A. Mosli, Birkir Blær Ingólfsson, Jónas Margeir Ingólfsson', null, 'Alexander Karim, Reine Brynolfsson, Lena Endre, Angunnguaq Larsen, Nicolas Bro, Nukâka Coster-Waldau', null, 'In Greenland, a climate meeting for the Arctic Council is in the process of agreeing on a new and historic climate agreement that prohibits all environmentally harmful oil drilling in the area when the political advisor to Sweden''s Foreign Minister Elsa suddenly disappears during a visit to a research vessel.', 'In Greenland, a climate meeting for the Arctic Council is in the process of agreeing on a new and historic climate agreement that prohibits all environmentally harmful oil drilling in the area when the political advisor to Sweden''s Foreign Minister Elsa suddenly disappears during a visit to a research vessel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yq9B44vLMRIGlhW5bBROkJreAt8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98982'),
  ('498751336084159464', 'Third Watch', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'John Wells, Edward Allen Bernero', null, 'Coby Bell, Nia Long, Molly Price, Anthony Ruivivar, Skipp Sudduth, Tia Texada, Jason Wiles, Cara Buono', 'TV-14', 'The exploits of a group of men and women who serve the City of New York as police officers, firemen, and paramedics, all working the same fictional 55th precinct during the 3pm to 11pm shift - the ''Third Watch''.', 'The exploits of a group of men and women who serve the City of New York as police officers, firemen, and paramedics, all working the same fictional 55th precinct during the 3pm to 11pm shift - the ''Third Watch''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWQmgNLdyZGIL6Xuo9ImL0Kh6wt.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:512'),
