  ('119073833828971941', 'Thirteen Years of Dust', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Lou Xiaopeng', 'Lou Xiaopeng', 'Chen Jianbin, Chen Xiao, Chuai Ni, Liu Mintao, Zuo Xiaoqing, Yu Entai, Wang Xiao, Tan Kai', null, 'The special homicide case that was unsolved in 1997 resurfaced 13 years later. Criminal policeman Wei Zhengrong, who wasn''t able to find out the real murderer that year was traumatised and left the front line. The once fledgling new policeman Lu Xingzhi grown from his innocence and has become a meticulous criminal investigation expert. The many coincidences of the case brought the master and apprentice together again to hunt down the real culprit.', 'The special homicide case that was unsolved in 1997 resurfaced 13 years later. Criminal policeman Wei Zhengrong, who wasn''t able to find out the real murderer that year was traumatised and left the front line. The once fledgling new policeman Lu Xingzhi grown from his innocence and has become a meticulous criminal investigation expert. The many coincidences of the case brought the master and apprentice together again to hunt down the real culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPGPeWo7v65HePODxE9vQQd1Z94.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211927'),
  ('542876166699259377', 'Thirty-Minute Theatre', 1965, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'An anthology of short plays shown on BBC Television between 1965 and 1973, used in part at least as a training ground for new writers, on account of its short length, and which therefore attracted many writers who later became well known.', 'An anthology of short plays shown on BBC Television between 1965 and 1973, used in part at least as a training ground for new writers, on account of its short length, and which therefore attracted many writers who later became well known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPF0a1ShxjN4tR6WcB9ZG9HPzUg.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:29917'),
  ('297615639031677702', 'Thirty-Nine', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yu Young-ah, Kim Sang-ho', null, 'Son Ye-jin, Jeon Mi-do, Kim Ji-hyun, Yeon Woo-jin, Lee Mu-saeng, Lee Tae-hwan, An So-hee, Kang Mal-geum', 'TV-MA', 'Leaning on each other through thick and thin, a trio of best friends stand together as they experience life, love and loss on the brink of turning 40.', 'Leaning on each other through thick and thin, a trio of best friends stand together as they experience life, love and loss on the brink of turning 40.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Pz7dZRjuxoRzwYBMLdVBTtcEBi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131028'),
  ('257016930031384916', 'thirtysomething', 1987, 'Drama', 'Edward Zwick, Marshall Herskovitz', null, 'Ken Olin, Mel Harris, Timothy Busfield, Patricia Wettig, Peter Horton, Melanie Mayron, Polly Draper, Patricia Kalember', null, 'Thirtysomething is an American television drama about a group of baby boomers in their late thirties. It was created by Marshall Herskovitz and Edward Zwick for MGM/UA Television Group and The Bedford Falls Company, and aired on ABC. It premiered in the U.S. on September 29, 1987. It lasted four seasons, with the last of its 85 episodes airing on May 28, 1991. The title of the show was designed as thirtysomething by Kathie Broyles, who combined the words of the original title, Thirty Something. In 1997, "The Go Between" and "Samurai Ad Man" were ranked #22 on TV Guide′s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time. In 2002, Thirtysomething was ranked #19 on TV Guide′s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time, and in 2013 TV Guide ranked it #10 in its list of The 60 Greatest Dramas of All Time.', 'Thirtysomething is an American television drama about a group of baby boomers in their late thirties. It was created by Marshall Herskovitz and Edward Zwick for MGM/UA Television Group and The Bedford Falls Company, and aired on ABC. It premiered in the U.S. on September 29, 1987. It lasted four seasons, with the last of its 85 episodes airing on May 28, 1991. The title of the show was designed as thirtysomething by Kathie Broyles, who combined the words of the original title, Thirty Something. In 1997, "The Go Between" and "Samurai Ad Man" were ranked #22 on TV Guide′s 100 Greatest Episodes of All Time. In 2002, Thirtysomething was ranked #19 on TV Guide′s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time, and in 2013 TV Guide ranked it #10 in its list of The 60 Greatest Dramas of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC4CW183RUTvOg5nkLfOnERJ5ov.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1448'),
  ('659165245501012550', 'This Art Club Has a Problem!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Ari Ozawa, Sumire Uesaka, Kentaro Tone, Nao Toyama, Nana Mizuki, Sora Tokui, Chiaki Shimogama', 'TV-PG', 'An art club in a certain middle school, and its members: Subaru Uchimaki, who is a genius at drawing faces, but only wants to draw the perfect 2D wife; Colette, a rich troublemaker who never stops making mischief; and the club president, who sleeps through sessions and collects sleeping aids. Mizuki Usami is the only person in the club who wants to do art club-like activities, and constantly struggles to do so.', 'An art club in a certain middle school, and its members: Subaru Uchimaki, who is a genius at drawing faces, but only wants to draw the perfect 2D wife; Colette, a rich troublemaker who never stops making mischief; and the club president, who sleeps through sessions and collects sleeping aids. Mizuki Usami is the only person in the club who wants to do art club-like activities, and constantly struggles to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCLhgNtu6rMWYAQIxMbgA47jWgW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65955'),
  ('771443688091176204', 'This City Is Ours', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stephen Butchard', null, 'James Nelson-Joyce, Hannah Onslow, Julie Graham, Mike Noble, Laura Aikman', null, 'Notorious gang boss Ronnie (Sean Bean) steps back from his criminal empire, triggering a violent power struggle between his volatile son Jamie (Jack McMullen) and trusted lieutenant Michael (James Nelson Joyce), who sees his chance to seize control. As rivalries ignite and loyalties fracture, the family behind the city’s cocaine trade descends into open war.', 'Notorious gang boss Ronnie (Sean Bean) steps back from his criminal empire, triggering a violent power struggle between his volatile son Jamie (Jack McMullen) and trusted lieutenant Michael (James Nelson Joyce), who sees his chance to seize control. As rivalries ignite and loyalties fracture, the family behind the city’s cocaine trade descends into open war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQpJFVWX8MCdOkwoutDw7tjhvgp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255570'),
  ('198053045231611033', 'This Close', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shoshannah Stern, Josh Feldman', null, 'Josh Feldman, Shoshannah Stern', 'TV-MA', 'BFFs Kate and Michael, who are both deaf and live in Los Angeles, are about to face new challenges - including a bad breakup, being tokenized at work and a troubling secret - all of which test their bond in surprising ways.', 'BFFs Kate and Michael, who are both deaf and live in Los Angeles, are about to face new challenges - including a bad breakup, being tokenized at work and a troubling secret - all of which test their bond in surprising ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1isl0SYrGROT7gKIllV1C27zqAo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76526'),
