  ('124492106260925354', 'Too Much', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lena Dunham, Luis Felber', 'Pat Regan, Monica Heisey, Rachel De-Lahay', 'Megan Stalter, Will Sharpe, Richard E. Grant, Stephen Fry, Janicza Bravo, Michael Zegen, Rhea Perlman, Rita Wilson', 'TV-MA', 'When a heartbroken New Yorker moves to London hoping for a love story, she falls for an indie musician who''s anything but the typical romantic hero.', 'When a heartbroken New Yorker moves to London hoping for a love story, she falls for an indie musician who''s anything but the typical romantic hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCLrhHqN26gS4eNrM27hY8XJXOt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241361'),
