  ('489066052690331971', 'Top Dog', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Veronica Zacco, Molly Hartleb, Alexis Almström', 'Linnea Möller Lindh, Lovisa Milles, Veronica Zacco', 'Josefin Asplund, Alexej Manvelov, Gustav Lindh, Jessica Grabowsky', 'NR', 'A mysterious disappearance makes two completely separate worlds collide, creating an extremely odd couple - the lawyer Emily and recently released convict Teddy.', 'A mysterious disappearance makes two completely separate worlds collide, creating an extremely odd couple - the lawyer Emily and recently released convict Teddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBNNv6ld4pyWKkldvXTwIsZkTyY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36229'),
