  ('148401543332366142', 'Toriko', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Mitsutoshi Shimabukuro', 'Ryotaro Okiayu, Mitsuo Iwata, Romi Park, Takahiro Sakurai, Nana Mizuki, Akira Ishida, Asami Tano, Banjo Ginga', 'TV-PG', 'In a world where gastronomy reigns, Gourmet Hunter Toriko hunts rare ingredients and animals to create his ultimate full-course meal.', 'In a world where gastronomy reigns, Gourmet Hunter Toriko hunts rare ingredients and animals to create his ultimate full-course meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NyEmf5xB1HSYM0MzADv8mjUnc4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:38251'),
