  ('758702433089867678', 'Total Bellas', 2016, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Nikki Garcia, Brie Garcia, Bryan Danielson, John Cena, Artem Chigvintsev, John Laurinaitis', 'TV-14', 'Although these twins share the same genes, they will never share the same jeans as living together was more tolerable when they just shared a womb. The free-spirited, vegan-loving, live-and-let-live lifestyle of Brie and Bryan has always clashed with the fancy panache of the designer handbag-loving Nikki and the meticulously organized tendencies of John. However, when the four world-renowned WWE Superstars move in under one roof, the comical clash of titans rings all throughout the suburbs of Tampa, Fla.', 'Although these twins share the same genes, they will never share the same jeans as living together was more tolerable when they just shared a womb. The free-spirited, vegan-loving, live-and-let-live lifestyle of Brie and Bryan has always clashed with the fancy panache of the designer handbag-loving Nikki and the meticulously organized tendencies of John. However, when the four world-renowned WWE Superstars move in under one roof, the comical clash of titans rings all throughout the suburbs of Tampa, Fla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKo4HiAQsGdpW4gSZjjq0kidpo5.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:66938'),
  ('962969035951314728', 'Total Control', 2019, 'Drama', 'Darren Dale, Rachel Griffiths, Miranda Dear', null, 'Deborah Mailman, Rachel Griffiths, Rob Collins, Wayne Blair, Anthony Hayes, Wesley Patten, Huw Higginson, Steph Tisdell', null, 'A local Indigenous politician is recruited to the senate by the Australian Prime Minister after a contentious video goes viral.', 'A local Indigenous politician is recruited to the senate by the Australian Prime Minister after a contentious video goes viral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfWVQRIoDrfIcY2cmhpLgSZoLia.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:92388'),
  ('931303988299919945', 'Total Divas', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Brie Garcia, Nikki Garcia, Nattie Neidhart-Wilson, Trinity Fatu, Leah Van Dale, Lina Fanene, Daria Berenato, Ronda Rousey', 'TV-14', 'An inside look of the lives of seven WWE Divas from their work within WWE to their personal lives.', 'An inside look of the lives of seven WWE Divas from their work within WWE to their personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBYXdVVehQ5oZfOXvOmDU94MRrN.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:58578'),
  ('429330024932960354', 'Total Drama Action', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Jennifer Pertsch, Tom McGillis', 'Tom McGillis, Jennifer Pertsch', 'Christian Potenza, Clé Bennett, Megan Fahlenbock, Adam Greydon Reid, Kristin Fairlie, Drew Nelson, Dan Petronijevic, Sarah Gadon', 'TV-PG', 'After losing a chance to win a million dollars, campers from "Total Drama Island" get a second chance to win a million dollars through movie-oriented challenges for the next 6 weeks.', 'After losing a chance to win a million dollars, campers from "Total Drama Island" get a second chance to win a million dollars through movie-oriented challenges for the next 6 weeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGG1e2B6fnzMdhsMyZzRUVGktJS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8616'),
  ('846941034977705878', 'Total Drama All-Stars', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Tom McGillis, Jennifer Pertsch', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The fifth season of Total Drama. In the first half, ''Total Drama All-Stars'', 14 contestants from the previous seasons return to Camp Wawanakwa, now having been decontaminated from toxic waste, to win the C$1,000,000 prize. In the second half, "Total Drama: Pahkitew Island", the setting changes to Pahkitew Island, an island located in Western Canada, featuring a brand new 14 contestants.', 'The fifth season of Total Drama. In the first half, ''Total Drama All-Stars'', 14 contestants from the previous seasons return to Camp Wawanakwa, now having been decontaminated from toxic waste, to win the C$1,000,000 prize. In the second half, "Total Drama: Pahkitew Island", the setting changes to Pahkitew Island, an island located in Western Canada, featuring a brand new 14 contestants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csBOOo0VAiizJhS79c1AjRY7nDH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75868'),
  ('1016916330939679537', 'Total Drama Island', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jennifer Pertsch, Tom McGillis', null, 'Christian Potenza, Clé Bennett, Scott McCord, Megan Fahlenbock, Rachel Wilson, Drew Nelson, Dan Petronijevic, Novie Edwards', 'TV-PG', 'Total Drama Island focuses on twenty-two teenagers'' arrival at Camp Wawanakwa to compete on a reality television show. The contestants are divided into two teams and must compete in challenges every three days. While the winning team earns invincibility, the losing team has to vote off one of their own players. Whoever is voted off must walk the Dock of Shame to the Boat of Losers and leave the island. The teams eventually dissolve and the elimination process continues until the last contestant standing wins a grand prize of $100,000.', 'Total Drama Island focuses on twenty-two teenagers'' arrival at Camp Wawanakwa to compete on a reality television show. The contestants are divided into two teams and must compete in challenges every three days. While the winning team earns invincibility, the losing team has to vote off one of their own players. Whoever is voted off must walk the Dock of Shame to the Boat of Losers and leave the island. The teams eventually dissolve and the elimination process continues until the last contestant standing wins a grand prize of $100,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5H8n9dS2bypIAK4sUF3nCBk5tM7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6618'),
  ('518164387142453857', 'Total Drama Island', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Tom McGillis, Jennifer Pertsch', null, 'Terry McGurrin, Deven Mack', null, 'After 7 seasons of Total Drama, it''s time to go back to the Island! Taking place in the run-down Camp Wawanakwa, contestants must give it their all as they compete in extreme baking, TikToking, drag racing and "disaster and horror movie inspired challenges" for a chance to win the one million dollar prize!', 'After 7 seasons of Total Drama, it''s time to go back to the Island! Taking place in the run-down Camp Wawanakwa, contestants must give it their all as they compete in extreme baking, TikToking, drag racing and "disaster and horror movie inspired challenges" for a chance to win the one million dollar prize!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w80XbLlE0slKdFPsZWpZHGI1fl1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:224285'),
  ('271505052250905767', 'Total Drama Presents: The Ridonculous Race', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Jennifer Pertsch, Tom McGillis', 'Miles Smith, Terry McGurrin, Kurt Firla', 'Nicki Burke, Stephanie Mills, Emilie-Claire Barlow, Jeff Geddis, Scott McCord, Bryn McAuley, Terry McGurrin, Dan Petronijevic', 'TV-PG', '18 teams travel the world to 26 exotic locations trying to be the last team standing to win a million dollars complete with a new host.', '18 teams travel the world to 26 exotic locations trying to be the last team standing to win a million dollars complete with a new host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NpHctZgDk1QvwQWpR4gZaqZIdP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67082'),
  ('877745803752325030', 'Total Drama World Tour', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Jennifer Pertsch, Tom McGillis', null, 'Peter Oldring, Christian Potenza, Clé Bennett, Kristin Fairlie, Annick Obonsawin, Marco Grazzini, Rachel Wilson, Peter Oldring', 'TV-PG', 'Total Drama World Tour is the third season of the Total Drama franchise. In this series, fifteen returning contestants and three new contestants are taken on a trip around the world, and compete in cultural-themed challenges of countries they visit. An added twist in this season is that they are required to break spontaneously into song, or else be immediately eliminated.', 'Total Drama World Tour is the third season of the Total Drama franchise. In this series, fifteen returning contestants and three new contestants are taken on a trip around the world, and compete in cultural-themed challenges of countries they visit. An added twist in this season is that they are required to break spontaneously into song, or else be immediately eliminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBJdymNHzCmiIvN4hSis59S8mcH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19123'),
  ('957804669681750650', 'Total Drama: Revenge of the Island', 2012, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Tom McGillis, Jennifer Pertsch', null, 'Athena Karkanis, Jon Cor, Kevin Duhaney, Carleigh Beverly, Barbara Mamabolo, Caitlynne Medrek, Laurie Elliott, Cory Doran', 'TV-PG', 'This series takes the contestants back to Camp Wawanakwa, only this time with thirteen new contestants; Anne Maria, B, Brick, Cameron, Dakota, Dawn, Jo, Lightning, Mike, Sam, Scott, Staci, and Zoey. Additionally the island is radioactive due to becoming a nuclear waste dump. This new season has new friendships, new rivalries, new relationships, and the biggest drama to date.', 'This series takes the contestants back to Camp Wawanakwa, only this time with thirteen new contestants; Anne Maria, B, Brick, Cameron, Dakota, Dawn, Jo, Lightning, Mike, Sam, Scott, Staci, and Zoey. Additionally the island is radioactive due to becoming a nuclear waste dump. This new season has new friendships, new rivalries, new relationships, and the biggest drama to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eo6qAfLRkUCWtU6UGu8Jx0MmiKg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33507'),
  ('386034084280512392', 'Total DramaRama', 2018, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Tom McGillis, Jennifer Pertsch', null, 'Drew Nelson, Deven Mack, Scott McCord, Kerstin Julia Dietrich, Katie Crown, Lilly Bartlam, Wyatt White, Cory Doran', 'TV-Y7', 'Some of the original "Total Drama" characters enter into an alternate universe where they are aged down from teenagers to toddlers.', 'Some of the original "Total Drama" characters enter into an alternate universe where they are aged down from teenagers to toddlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9KAegh5542L8JktkwsZZrdekhe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88069'),
  ('1041228588530234645', 'Total Dreamer', 2015, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'Rosane Svartman, Paulo Halm', 'Felipe Cabral, Paulo Halm, Rosane Svartman', 'Marina Ruy Barbosa, Juliana Paes, Fábio Assunção, Felipe Simas, Vivianne Pasmanter, Humberto Martins, Juliana Paiva, Daniel Rocha', null, 'This modern fairy tale tells the story of a homeless girl who dreams of helping out her family and finds her big chance of turning her life around in a fashion modeling contest - but the way to winning it and becoming a star will be a lot harder than she originally envisioned. A captivating romantic comedy about overcoming obstacles, Total Dreamer wins its audience’s heart right from the first episode.', 'This modern fairy tale tells the story of a homeless girl who dreams of helping out her family and finds her big chance of turning her life around in a fashion modeling contest - but the way to winning it and becoming a star will be a lot harder than she originally envisioned. A captivating romantic comedy about overcoming obstacles, Total Dreamer wins its audience’s heart right from the first episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fnrIUhoxXUcmnYyncFj7Rctvju.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84383'),
  ('952432295191398395', 'Total Eclipse', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Meg Favreau', 'Mackenzie Ziegler, Lauren Orlando, Emily Skinner, Nadia Turner, Andrew Elvis Miller, Devenity Perkins, Dominic Kline, Alexis Simpson', 'TV-G', 'Cassie, a typical high school girl, is ditched by her childhood friends. Now she has to fight to get them back.', 'Cassie, a typical high school girl, is ditched by her childhood friends. Now she has to fight to get them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89wn3wEVNQzAI39pfPaRhlTEnix.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:78634'),
  ('475444966264615555', 'Total Recall 2070', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Art Monterastelli', null, 'Michael Easton, Karl Pruner, Cynthia Preston, Judith Krant, Matthew Bennett', null, 'Total Recall 2070 is a science fiction television series first broadcast in 1999 on the Canadian television channel CHCH-TV and later the same year on the American Showtime channel. It was later syndicated in the United States with some editing to remove scenes of nudity, violence and strong language. The series was inspired by the 1990 film Total Recall, based on Philip K. Dick''s short story "We Can Remember It for You Wholesale", and by Dick''s novel Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?, with a visual style heavily influenced by the film Blade Runner, itself very loosely based on the same novel. However, other than the Rekall company and the concept of virtual vacations, the series shares no major plot points or characters with any of these works. Philip K. Dick is not credited in any way on the series main or end titles. The series was filmed in Toronto. It was a Canadian/German co-production. Only one season, consisting of 22 episodes, was produced.', 'Total Recall 2070 is a science fiction television series first broadcast in 1999 on the Canadian television channel CHCH-TV and later the same year on the American Showtime channel. It was later syndicated in the United States with some editing to remove scenes of nudity, violence and strong language. The series was inspired by the 1990 film Total Recall, based on Philip K. Dick''s short story "We Can Remember It for You Wholesale", and by Dick''s novel Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?, with a visual style heavily influenced by the film Blade Runner, itself very loosely based on the same novel. However, other than the Rekall company and the concept of virtual vacations, the series shares no major plot points or characters with any of these works. Philip K. Dick is not credited in any way on the series main or end titles. The series was filmed in Toronto. It was a Canadian/German co-production. Only one season, consisting of 22 episodes, was produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LKeqDgFBZB8kyzhikcBxpmRm1q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4541'),
  ('785372943534819077', 'Total Wipeout', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Each week, 20 contestants compete in a series of challenges in an attempt to win £10,000. These challenges are based in large pools of water or mud and generally involve large assault courses that participants must cross.', 'Each week, 20 contestants compete in a series of challenges in an attempt to win £10,000. These challenges are based in large pools of water or mud and generally involve large assault courses that participants must cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl5zPBbtqFoMJ1LBHirCTdaFLhj.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:16358'),
  ('24024877089845191', 'Totally Completely Fine', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gretel Vella', null, 'Thomasin McKenzie, Contessa Treffone, Devon Terrell, Rowan Witt, Brandon McClelland', 'TV-MA', 'When self-destructive Vivian discovers the cliffside property she’s inherited is a known suicide site, she is tasked with becoming its reluctant guardian, rescuing lost souls on the verge.', 'When self-destructive Vivian discovers the cliffside property she’s inherited is a known suicide site, she is tasked with becoming its reluctant guardian, rescuing lost souls on the verge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfKEYo5SQKuJwccSfgjCzy747h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223642'),
  ('846559316144376766', 'Totally Spies!', 2002, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Vincent Chalvon-Demersay, David Michel', 'Michelle Lamoreaux, Robert Lamoreaux', 'Claire Guyot, Fily Keita, Céline Mauge, Jean-Claude Donda, Déborah Claude, Gauthier Battoue, Geneviève Doang', 'TV-Y7', 'Totally Spies! depicts three girlfriends ''with an attitude'' who have to cope with their daily lives at high school as well as the unpredictable pressures of international espionage. They confront the most intimidating - and demented - of villains, each with their own special agenda for demonic, global rude behavior.', 'Totally Spies! depicts three girlfriends ''with an attitude'' who have to cope with their daily lives at high school as well as the unpredictable pressures of international espionage. They confront the most intimidating - and demented - of villains, each with their own special agenda for demonic, global rude behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioPQVkwnunF4rqLuwiqmqFHW7UL.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2808'),
  ('597314865025625146', 'Totem Heroes', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', '李文俊', null, 'Liu Xiaoyu, Tang Xiaoxi, Ajie, Su Shangqing, Zhang Yutong, Qiao Shiyu, Mengmeng Yan, Sheng Feng', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH4kTDfkuN0ydqGx0wxGfcCAqdJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:279352'),
  ('1146225816303330814', 'Totems', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Olivier Dujols, Juliette Soubrier', null, 'Niels Schneider, Vera Kolesnikova, José Garcia, Lambert Wilson, Ana Girardot, Aleksey Guskov, Mikhail Gorevoy, Tim Ahern', null, 'Set in 1965 in the midst of the Cold War, Totems follows a French scientist, Francis Mareuil, as he begins working as a spy. While working for the French Secret Service and the CIA, Mareuil meets Lyudmila Goloubeva, a pianist forced to work for the KGB. A romance blossoms between them but neither can be sure what is an expression of their true feelings, and what is the fruit of political shenanigans.', 'Set in 1965 in the midst of the Cold War, Totems follows a French scientist, Francis Mareuil, as he begins working as a spy. While working for the French Secret Service and the CIA, Mareuil meets Lyudmila Goloubeva, a pianist forced to work for the KGB. A romance blossoms between them but neither can be sure what is an expression of their true feelings, and what is the fruit of political shenanigans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa3WeVK1goLYOazsPNmg0mDQSTF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121462'),
  ('340683682651214574', 'Toto Nee-chan', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Mitsuki Takahata, Itsuki Sagara, Tae Kimura, Hana Sugisaki, Osamu Mukai, Himena Irei, Suda Kohaku', null, 'In 1930 and as a young child, Tsuneko Kohashi lives at Enshu in Shizuoka Prefecture. She has a happy life with her parents and two younger sisters. Things change after her father dies from tuberculosis. Her father asked Tsuneko Kohashi to take care of the family in his place. Due to financial difficulties, her mother Kimiko decides to move the family to Tokyo where Tsuneko''s grandmother lives.', 'In 1930 and as a young child, Tsuneko Kohashi lives at Enshu in Shizuoka Prefecture. She has a happy life with her parents and two younger sisters. Things change after her father dies from tuberculosis. Her father asked Tsuneko Kohashi to take care of the family in his place. Due to financial difficulties, her mother Kimiko decides to move the family to Tokyo where Tsuneko''s grandmother lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arbfcsAU908iyC9dzejKEw5SJur.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72294'),
  ('603679529077260473', 'TOTP2', 1994, null, null, 'Steve Wright', 'Amanda Holden, Steve Wright, Johnnie Walker', null, 'Fast-moving music show mixing classic performances from the Top of the Pops archives with exclusive live performances.', 'Fast-moving music show mixing classic performances from the Top of the Pops archives with exclusive live performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eCKfuDgYiJLBwV0GIDvy1Gc3ng.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:24128'),
  ('1131125562224439982', 'Touch', 1985, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Keiichi Nanba, Yuji Mitsuya, Noriko Hidaka, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Banjo Ginga, Kazuhiko Inoue, Mina Tominaga, Ryusei Nakao', null, 'Twins Kazuya and Tatsuya, and their neighbor Minami have played together since they were children and built an unbreakable bond. But with puberty, the twins realized something: Minami is a girl, and three is a crowd. As the trio tries to preserve their relationship, Kazuya''s pledge to make Minami''s dream come true by taking her to Koshien with his baseball pitching skills makes the slackerish Tatsuya wonder about himself, and his own goals. But Minami has another dream she wants fulfilled, and as the twins continue to push themselves, with Minami in the middle, a life-changing tragedy leads one twin down a path he once never would''ve considered...', 'Twins Kazuya and Tatsuya, and their neighbor Minami have played together since they were children and built an unbreakable bond. But with puberty, the twins realized something: Minami is a girl, and three is a crowd. As the trio tries to preserve their relationship, Kazuya''s pledge to make Minami''s dream come true by taking her to Koshien with his baseball pitching skills makes the slackerish Tatsuya wonder about himself, and his own goals. But Minami has another dream she wants fulfilled, and as the twins continue to push themselves, with Minami in the middle, a life-changing tragedy leads one twin down a path he once never would''ve considered...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxtmMvfTOYRL4fQn9B8Pla6oH2N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22104'),
  ('1125820398060584066', 'Touch', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Tim Kring', null, 'Kiefer Sutherland, David Mazouz, Saxon Sharbino, Lukas Haas', 'TV-14', 'Martin Bohm, a widower and single father, is haunted by an inability to connect to his autistic, mute 11-year-old son, Jake. Their relationship and their lives take an extraordinary turn when he discovers his gifted son has the ability to see things that no one else can and the patterns that connect seemingly unrelated events.', 'Martin Bohm, a widower and single father, is haunted by an inability to connect to his autistic, mute 11-year-old son, Jake. Their relationship and their lives take an extraordinary turn when he discovers his gifted son has the ability to see things that no one else can and the patterns that connect seemingly unrelated events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qreaxQD4azrRuZWdevyjVAKt8V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39510'),
  ('113638835729375758', 'Touch Your Heart', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Joon-hwa', 'Lee Myung-sook', 'Lee Dong-wook, Yoo In-na, Lee Sang-woo, Son Sung-yoon, Park Ji-hwan, Oh Jung-se, Shim Hyung-tak, Park Kyung-hye', 'TV-14', 'Hoping to make a comeback after a bad scandal, an actress agrees to research a new role by taking a job as a secretary for a prickly attorney.', 'Hoping to make a comeback after a bad scandal, an actress agrees to research a new role by taking a job as a secretary for a prickly attorney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVFflfTOFqFBh34jcVRI1QCWSre.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85404'),
  ('790943845639826393', 'Touched by an Angel', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'John Masius', null, 'Roma Downey, Della Reese, John Dye, Valerie Bertinelli', 'TV-PG', 'Monica, an angel, is tasked with bringing guidance and messages from God to various people who are at a crossroads in their lives.', 'Monica, an angel, is tasked with bringing guidance and messages from God to various people who are at a crossroads in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiSv0xNx6MGhAFfv05Ov7DgDELJ.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2243'),
  ('598544298639459127', 'Touching Evil', 1997, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Paul Abbott', null, 'Nicola Walker, Robson Green, Michael Feast, Shaun Dingwall, Andrew Scarborough', 'NR', 'Follow the exploits of the Organized and Serial Crime Unit (OSC). Maverick Detective Inspector Dave Creegan is the newest member of the unit, an elite, rapid-response crime squad. The OSC uses their diverse crime-fighting skills to bring justice to society.', 'Follow the exploits of the Organized and Serial Crime Unit (OSC). Maverick Detective Inspector Dave Creegan is the newest member of the unit, an elite, rapid-response crime squad. The OSC uses their diverse crime-fighting skills to bring justice to society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zI20jJmUntgJhfmkZsfDZNHdZW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10622'),
  ('633410500067129568', 'Touching Evil', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Abbott', 'Bruno Heller', 'Jeffrey Donovan, Brian Markinson, Vera Farmiga, Zach Grenier, Kevin Durand', null, 'Returning from a year-long psychological leave of absence after surviving an almost-fatal gunshot wound to the head, Detective David Creegan is assigned to the FBI''s Organized and Serial Crime Unit – a rapid-response, elite crime investigation squad – where he and his new partner, Detective Susan Branca, find themselves committed to saving lives and solving cases. In spite of his inability to abide by common sense and the laws he''s sworn to uphold, Creegan, with the help of Branca, works on hunting down the most vicious criminals on the streets.', 'Returning from a year-long psychological leave of absence after surviving an almost-fatal gunshot wound to the head, Detective David Creegan is assigned to the FBI''s Organized and Serial Crime Unit – a rapid-response, elite crime investigation squad – where he and his new partner, Detective Susan Branca, find themselves committed to saving lives and solving cases. In spite of his inability to abide by common sense and the laws he''s sworn to uphold, Creegan, with the help of Branca, works on hunting down the most vicious criminals on the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dmBxixICLqLPeXqWTR0Js3kcM1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62864'),
  ('839570980537614588', 'Touching You', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Minji Seong', 'Ok Taec-yeon, Song Ha-yoon, Park Joo-Hyung, Kim Jong-Moon, Im Yoon-Jeong, Gil Ha-Ra', null, 'A man who can see the future and an aspiring makeup artist meet under unique circumstances and start to fall in love.', 'A man who can see the future and an aspiring makeup artist meet under unique circumstances and start to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i10586YOBYWMf03kmJMUu6Vs6BY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68671'),
  ('610257547990475672', 'Tougen Anki', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kazuki Ura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Koutaro Nishiyama, Manaka Iwami, Shogo Sakata, Natsuki Hanae, Kaito Miura, Aimi', 'TV-MA', 'After a Momotaro assassin suddenly kills his adoptive father, Shiki vows to avenge him. But first, he must learn to control his newly awakened Oni blood.', 'After a Momotaro assassin suddenly kills his adoptive father, Shiki vows to avenge him. But first, he must learn to control his newly awakened Oni blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnasRNhwT5M3OvTAMzYn4i5fQcT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253811'),
  ('450402607784980583', 'Touken Ranbu: Hanamaru', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Mitsuhiro Ichiki, Toshiki Masuda', null, 'The year is 2205. The "historical revisionists" have begun attacks on the past in their plot to change history. The Saniwa, who have been charged with protecting history, can imbue life into objects. Strongest among these are the Tōken Danshi. The story centers around their cheerful lives.', 'The year is 2205. The "historical revisionists" have begun attacks on the past in their plot to change history. The Saniwa, who have been charged with protecting history, can imbue life into objects. Strongest among these are the Tōken Danshi. The story centers around their cheerful lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riYgCndvjjx7QYnbOQOv3EXO4TJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68100'),
