  ('135685989176560247', 'Tout le monde en parle', 2004, 'Talk', null, null, 'Guy A. Lepage', 'NR', 'Host Guy A. Lepage brings together six to eight personalities from different milieus—sports, politics, stage productions and more—that are the subject of everyone’s conversations and/or are important figures in recent events. Participants are invited to speak freely, voicing their opinions on headline news or on a subject that is near and dear to them.', 'Host Guy A. Lepage brings together six to eight personalities from different milieus—sports, politics, stage productions and more—that are the subject of everyone’s conversations and/or are important figures in recent events. Participants are invited to speak freely, voicing their opinions on headline news or on a subject that is near and dear to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BiaKzjK3arQM2yKLzB9zBKB6GL.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:31351'),
  ('122735129482451577', 'Toward the Terra', 2007, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Keiko Takemiya', null, 'Marina Inoue, Norio Wakamoto, Sanae Kobayashi, Takehito Koyasu, Ai Orikasa, Mitsuki Saiga, Motoki Takagi, Wataru Hatano', null, 'In the future, mankind''s seemingly utopian society is strictly controlled by the government, and anything that threatens to disrupt the status quo is ruthlessly suppressed. When 14-year-old Jomy begins to question the way the society is run, he suddenly becomes a target for both the government and the Mu, an outcast race with extra-sensory abilities who have been fighting against the government for generations. Now, each is determined to hunt him down - one to kill him and the other to save him.', 'In the future, mankind''s seemingly utopian society is strictly controlled by the government, and anything that threatens to disrupt the status quo is ruthlessly suppressed. When 14-year-old Jomy begins to question the way the society is run, he suddenly becomes a target for both the government and the Mu, an outcast race with extra-sensory abilities who have been fighting against the government for generations. Now, each is determined to hunt him down - one to kill him and the other to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OHjXW2DLY13eGqGif0ZBHnIWqO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30237'),
  ('458829312082818169', 'Towards Zero', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Agatha Christie, Rachel Bennette', null, 'Anjelica Huston, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Ella Lily Hyland, Mimi Keene, Clarke Peters, Matthew Rhys, Anjana Vasan, Khalil Ben Gharbia', null, 'After a scandalous divorce, a tennis star, his ex-wife and a volatile mix of guests converge at a coastal estate. When murder strikes, a troubled detective must unravel the truth.', 'After a scandalous divorce, a tennis star, his ex-wife and a volatile mix of guests converge at a coastal estate. When murder strikes, a troubled detective must unravel the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/T6P2hxlya0XVWZdktWy6mdrT6J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245773'),
  ('390128466638412720', 'Tower of God', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taichi Ichikawa, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuma Uchida, Sayumi Watabe, Yu Shimamura, Saki Miyashita, Kenichirou Matsuda, Kento Shiraishi', 'TV-14', 'Reach the top, and everything will be yours. At the top of the tower exists everything in this world, and all of it can be yours. You can become a god. This is the story of the beginning and the end of Rachel, the girl who climbed the tower so she could see the stars, and Bam, the boy who needed nothing but her.', 'Reach the top, and everything will be yours. At the top of the tower exists everything in this world, and all of it can be yours. You can become a god. This is the story of the beginning and the end of Rachel, the girl who climbed the tower so she could see the stars, and Bam, the boy who needed nothing but her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QXO4C0AwAuBa15nuDLZU2MyktB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97860'),
  ('1109417682264036147', 'Tower Prep', 2010, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Paul Dini', null, 'Drew Van Acker, Ryan Pinkston, Dyana Liu, Elise Gatien, Jesse Haddock', null, 'Ian Archer wakes up one morning to find himself at a mysterious academy for teens with special abilities. Unable to find answers to his questions from the school’s faculty and cut off from any kind of outside contact or means of escape, Ian forms a secret group with fellow suspicious students.', 'Ian Archer wakes up one morning to find himself at a mysterious academy for teens with special abilities. Unable to find answers to his questions from the school’s faculty and cut off from any kind of outside contact or means of escape, Ian forms a secret group with fellow suspicious students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4ATUzfBJPuq0HkyNwXMSdtoUth.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33785'),
  ('424640778546950620', 'Toxic Crusaders', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz', null, 'Rodger Bumpass, Gregg Berger, Susan Silo, Ed Gilbert, Hal Rayle, Patric Zimmerman, Chuck McCann, Susan Blu', 'TV-Y7', 'Loosely based on the 1984 B-horror comedy film The Toxic Avenger, Toxic Crusaders is a syndicated 13-episode animated series created by Lloyd Kaufman and Michael Herz. Like the source material, Toxie is a grotesque mutant endowed with superhuman powers, but is still a good-hearted and law-abiding citizen of the fictional town of Tromaville, New Jersey; the setting of most of Troma Entertainment''s films. In a change from the films, the toxic waste mutated his mop into a sentient entity that sometimes battles enemies by itself or gives him ideas on how to solve problems. The villains include Czar Zosta, Dr. Killemoff, and Psycho, polluters from the planet Smogula who wreak ecological havoc with help from Tromaville''s corrupt mayor, Grody. Bonehead, a street punk who bullied Melvin, joins them in the first episode.', 'Loosely based on the 1984 B-horror comedy film The Toxic Avenger, Toxic Crusaders is a syndicated 13-episode animated series created by Lloyd Kaufman and Michael Herz. Like the source material, Toxie is a grotesque mutant endowed with superhuman powers, but is still a good-hearted and law-abiding citizen of the fictional town of Tromaville, New Jersey; the setting of most of Troma Entertainment''s films. In a change from the films, the toxic waste mutated his mop into a sentient entity that sometimes battles enemies by itself or gives him ideas on how to solve problems. The villains include Czar Zosta, Dr. Killemoff, and Psycho, polluters from the planet Smogula who wreak ecological havoc with help from Tromaville''s corrupt mayor, Grody. Bonehead, a street punk who bullied Melvin, joins them in the first episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTK4iXbxYQ0UfarUoYSeu1if2ja.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11814'),
  ('718661327767237539', 'Toxic Town', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jack Thorne', null, 'Jodie Whittaker, Aimee Lou Wood, Claudia Jessie, Karla Crome, Robert Carlyle, Brendan Coyle, Rory Kinnear, Joe Dempsie', 'TV-MA', 'When dozens of babies in Corby are born with disabilities, their mothers embark on a battle to hold those responsible to account.', 'When dozens of babies in Corby are born with disabilities, their mothers embark on a battle to hold those responsible to account.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5n1BQpcDe2GBIXJ2y39qxnEsyp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232342'),
  ('892612021033506773', 'Toy Boy', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'César Benítez, Juan Carlos Cueto, Rocío Martínez', null, 'Jesús Mosquera, María Pedraza, Cristina Castaño, José de la Torre, Carlo Costanzia Jr, Juanjo Almeida, Raudel Raúl Martiato, Adelfa Calvo', 'TV-MA', 'After seven years in a Málaga prison, a male stripper is released pending retrial and sets out to prove his lover framed him for her husband''s murder.', 'After seven years in a Málaga prison, a male stripper is released pending retrial and sets out to prove his lover framed him for her husband''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jhblvJAmiAVpxWOEXemqEUJYAA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87763'),
  ('708682048024731246', 'Toyotomi Kyodai', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Hiroyuki Yatsu', 'Taiga Nakano, Sosuke Ikematsu, Sei Shiraishi, Minami Hamabe, Shun Oguri, Jun Kaname, Maki Sakai, Emma Miyazawa', null, 'Set in the Sengoku period, this story follows the Toyotomi brothers—Hidenaga and Hideyoshi—and their unbreakable bond as they rise to unify Japan.', 'Set in the Sengoku period, this story follows the Toyotomi brothers—Hidenaga and Hideyoshi—and their unbreakable bond as they rise to unify Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XXGtGWyaPNeuGYnZ05sBji4WZy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305227'),
