  ('810546803730544445', 'Trackdown', 1957, 'Western, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Robert Culp', null, 'Trackdown is an American Western television series starring Robert Culp that aired on CBS between 1957 and 1959. More than seventy episodes of this series were produced by Dick Powell''s Four Star Television and filmed at the Desilu-Culver Studio. The series was itself a spin-off of Powell''s anthology series, Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theater.', 'Trackdown is an American Western television series starring Robert Culp that aired on CBS between 1957 and 1959. More than seventy episodes of this series were produced by Dick Powell''s Four Star Television and filmed at the Desilu-Culver Studio. The series was itself a spin-off of Powell''s anthology series, Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n39XqrEQjKWSWGFZ7G6pZYBWI6T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:980'),
  ('653425298342364387', 'Tracker', 2001, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama', 'Gil Grant', null, 'Adrian Paul, Amy Price-Francis', 'TV-14', 'Tracker is a 2001 Canadian science fiction television series starring Adrian Paul and Amy Price-Francis. The series is based on a short story by Gil Grant and Jeannine Renshaw. The pilot episode and two other episodes were edited into the film Alien Tracker.', 'Tracker is a 2001 Canadian science fiction television series starring Adrian Paul and Amy Price-Francis. The series is based on a short story by Gil Grant and Jeannine Renshaw. The pilot episode and two other episodes were edited into the film Alien Tracker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W3GcWgTl9VYjClH4nhxFeIyFi9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2365'),
  ('918035998168288470', 'Tracker', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ben H. Winters', null, 'Justin Hartley, Fiona Rene, Chris Lee', 'TV-14', 'Lone-wolf survivalist Colter Shaw roams the country as a “reward seeker,” using his expert tracking skills to help private citizens and law enforcement solve all manner of mysteries while contending with his own fractured family.', 'Lone-wolf survivalist Colter Shaw roams the country as a “reward seeker,” using his expert tracking skills to help private citizens and law enforcement solve all manner of mysteries while contending with his own fractured family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otula4h1ITZ0eV84eg7Lb8u614C.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:211288'),
  ('809012242011269865', 'Trackers', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Thorogood', null, 'Ed Stoppard, James Alexander, Sandi Schultz, Rolanda Marais, Thapelo Mokoena, Trix Vivier, Sisanda Henna, Avital Lvova', 'TV-MA', 'Three story strands are interwoven into a sophisticated action-packed thriller that covers the length and breadth of South Africa, explosively colliding in Cape Town in a violent conspiracy involving organized crime, smuggled diamonds, state security, Black Rhinos, the CIA and an international terrorist plot.', 'Three story strands are interwoven into a sophisticated action-packed thriller that covers the length and breadth of South Africa, explosively colliding in Cape Town in a violent conspiracy involving organized crime, smuggled diamonds, state security, Black Rhinos, the CIA and an international terrorist plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofEr16h04owvFKMUkEpKjptZV8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94923'),
  ('432048050105094747', 'Traders', 1996, 'Drama', null, null, 'David Cubitt, Sonja Smits, Bruce Gray, Rachael Crawford, Peter Stebbings, David Hewlett, Patrick McKenna, Sabrina Grdevich', null, 'Traders is a Canadian television drama series, which was broadcast on Global Television Network from 1996 to 2000. Set in the Toronto-based investment house Gardner/Ross, "Traders" explores the intimate lives and loves of investment bankers whose high-stakes decisions and sizzling alliances can have grave international consequences.', 'Traders is a Canadian television drama series, which was broadcast on Global Television Network from 1996 to 2000. Set in the Toronto-based investment house Gardner/Ross, "Traders" explores the intimate lives and loves of investment bankers whose high-stakes decisions and sizzling alliances can have grave international consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gc2ZV39WNR0lpPloQBReze3PcdO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:11169'),
  ('887768193932802532', 'Traffic Light', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Bob Fisher, Adir Miller', null, 'Liza Lapira, Kris Marshall, David Denman, Nelson Franklin, Aya Cash', 'TV-14', 'Brothers-in-arms Ethan, Adam and Mike have been friends since college and have seen each other through highs and lows. Now well into their 30s, the three find themselves at different stages in their lives and trying to wrap their heads around the very grown-up decisions they have to make.', 'Brothers-in-arms Ethan, Adam and Mike have been friends since college and have seen each other through highs and lows. Now well into their 30s, the three find themselves at different stages in their lives and trying to wrap their heads around the very grown-up decisions they have to make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfjOdHzFnzsNuGjCZuyEbkF5Sik.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32825'),
  ('1032063030011271471', 'Trafficked with Mariana van Zeller', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, 'Mariana van Zeller', 'TV-14', 'A 360-degree view of the trafficking world from the point-of-view of the traffickers, law enforcement agents and those caught in the crossfire with access only National Geographic can provide.', 'A 360-degree view of the trafficking world from the point-of-view of the traffickers, law enforcement agents and those caught in the crossfire with access only National Geographic can provide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oAz8SXfhAUYN3Dqxcj4vXK6DJm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:113888'),
  ('758062578014403854', 'Traffik', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Simon Moore', 'Bill Paterson, Lindsay Duncan, Jamal Shah, Vincenzo Benestante, Talat Hussain, Juraj Kukura, Julia Ormond', 'TV-14', 'Traffik is a 1989 British television serial about the illegal drugs trade. Its three stories are interwoven, with arcs told from the perspectives of Afghan and Pakistani growers and manufacturers, German dealers, and British users. It was nominated for six BAFTA Awards, winning three. It also won an International Emmy Award for best drama. The 2000 crime drama film Traffic, directed by Steven Soderbergh, was based on this television serial. In turn, the 2004 American television miniseries Traffic was based on both versions.', 'Traffik is a 1989 British television serial about the illegal drugs trade. Its three stories are interwoven, with arcs told from the perspectives of Afghan and Pakistani growers and manufacturers, German dealers, and British users. It was nominated for six BAFTA Awards, winning three. It also won an International Emmy Award for best drama. The 2000 crime drama film Traffic, directed by Steven Soderbergh, was based on this television serial. In turn, the 2004 American television miniseries Traffic was based on both versions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GSiTblI86N5gQKbBEY2QsdlreW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13253'),
  ('1149246603667029828', 'Trail of Lies', 2013, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco, Daisy Chaves, Daniel Berlinsky', 'Paolla Oliveira, Malvino Salvador, Mateus Solano, Vanessa Giácomo, Juliano Cazarré, Antônio Fagundes, Susana Vieira, Thiago Fragoso', null, 'Paloma is a willful woman whose newborn baby is kidnapped by her own brother, Félix, who plans to become sole heir to the family’s fortune. Bruno is an honest man who, during the same night, loses his wife and son in childbirth and miraculously finds Paloma’s child in a dumpster. Destiny will unite their lives in a plot of secrets, revelations, and disputes, with the unpredictable consequences of lives based on a dangerous and surprising network of lies.', 'Paloma is a willful woman whose newborn baby is kidnapped by her own brother, Félix, who plans to become sole heir to the family’s fortune. Bruno is an honest man who, during the same night, loses his wife and son in childbirth and miraculously finds Paloma’s child in a dumpster. Destiny will unite their lives in a plot of secrets, revelations, and disputes, with the unpredictable consequences of lives based on a dangerous and surprising network of lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8i9XWOXNMgOHixobXIU76fnfmw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59599'),
