  ('63039782344273740', 'True Women', 1997, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Western', 'Christopher Lofton', null, 'Angelina Jolie, Dana Delany, Annabeth Gish, Tina Majorino, Rachael Leigh Cook, Michael York, Tony Todd, Michael Greyeyes', null, 'A story of love, friendship, survival and triumph spanning five decades from the Texas Revolution through the Civil War, Reconstruction and beyond.', 'A story of love, friendship, survival and triumph spanning five decades from the Texas Revolution through the Civil War, Reconstruction and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzttOAvVGgm2DVPLyglptMsHqK7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76497'),
