  ('134653223536768430', 'Truth Be Told', 2015, 'Comedy', 'D.J. Nash', null, 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Tone Bell, Vanessa Lachey, Bresha Webb', null, 'If you can think it, they will say it. This unabashed new comedy is about two diverse couples, who are both neighbors and best friends. As they go through life side by side, they can''t help but analyze and obsess about EVERYTHING. From topics like sex and race, to the fact that the trusted new babysitter might just be a porn star, nothing is out of bounds for this wildly outspoken foursome.', 'If you can think it, they will say it. This unabashed new comedy is about two diverse couples, who are both neighbors and best friends. As they go through life side by side, they can''t help but analyze and obsess about EVERYTHING. From topics like sex and race, to the fact that the trusted new babysitter might just be a porn star, nothing is out of bounds for this wildly outspoken foursome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6AzYiyI82YZrhjAmGy2RmC9IsD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64186'),
  ('756323355366870279', 'Truth Be Told', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nichelle D. Tramble', 'Madeleine Pron', 'Octavia Spencer, Mekhi Phifer, David Lyons, Gabrielle Union, Ron Cephas Jones, Merle Dandridge, Mychala Lee, Tracie Thoms', 'TV-MA', 'Descend into the world of true-crime podcasts with Poppy Parnell, who risks everything—including her life—to pursue truth and justice.', 'Descend into the world of true-crime podcasts with Poppy Parnell, who risks everything—including her life—to pursue truth and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T2TJ61ems7ArVGwb6kiVuKcdUk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80054'),
  ('485428948881717368', 'Truth Seekers', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Nick Frost, Simon Pegg, Nat Saunders', null, 'Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Samson Kayo, Malcolm McDowell, Emma D''Arcy, Susan Wokoma', 'TV-MA', 'A ghost-hunting duo team up to uncover and film paranormal sightings across the U.K. and share their adventures on an online channel. Their supernatural experiences grow more frequent, terrifying, and even deadly as the pair begin to uncover a conspiracy that could threaten the entire human race.', 'A ghost-hunting duo team up to uncover and film paranormal sightings across the U.K. and share their adventures on an online channel. Their supernatural experiences grow more frequent, terrifying, and even deadly as the pair begin to uncover a conspiracy that could threaten the entire human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRva67XCxkCRt4WuobrVVysdufU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92209'),
  ('57122064830065865', 'Trying', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Andy Wolton', null, 'Rafe Spall, Esther Smith, Scarlett Rayner, Cooper Turner', 'TV-14', 'All Nikki and Jason want is a baby—the one thing they can''t have. So they decide to adopt. With their dysfunctional friends, screwball families, and chaotic lives, will the adoption panel agree that they''re ready to be parents?', 'All Nikki and Jason want is a baby—the one thing they can''t have. So they decide to adopt. With their dysfunctional friends, screwball families, and chaotic lives, will the adoption panel agree that they''re ready to be parents?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHTDuZp8UtbSK1XehE59UJrgOXg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:98177'),
  ('633282279035095956', 'Tschugger', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy', 'David Constantin, Mats Frey', null, 'David Constantin, Dragan Vujic, Cedric Schild, Anna Rossinelli, Arsene Junior Page, Annalena Miano, Laurent Chevrier', null, 'Normally, the Valais cantonal police are concerned with minor details: runaway sheep and a presence at the village festival. Until the day when an inconceivable murder attempt awakens the criminalistic energy of policemen Bax and Pirmin. In the process, the duo not only uncovers local networks, but also tangles with dark forces.', 'Normally, the Valais cantonal police are concerned with minor details: runaway sheep and a presence at the village festival. Until the day when an inconceivable murder attempt awakens the criminalistic energy of policemen Bax and Pirmin. In the process, the duo not only uncovers local networks, but also tangles with dark forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3z5mDKJvJ8tDJCWQezC1JONF8y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:138927'),
  ('365675142612524721', 'Tsubasa RESERVoir CHRoNiCLE', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mika Kikuchi, Yui Makino, Miyu Irino, Daisuke Namikawa, Tetsu Inada, Maaya Sakamoto, Sanae Kobayashi, Akiko Hiramatsu', 'NR', 'Syaoran fights to gather the scattered soul of his beloved princess Sakura, whose memories were sent adrift across space and time.', 'Syaoran fights to gather the scattered soul of his beloved princess Sakura, whose memories were sent adrift across space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU2oU80UhGREf1dJBRb756KWEWJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:37565'),
  ('791305076039723391', 'Tsugumomo', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuko Sanpei, Naomi Ohzora, Yurika Kubo, Eriko Matsui, Noriko Shibasaki, You Taichi, Kotono Mitsuishi', 'TV-MA', 'Kazuya Kagami never goes anywhere without the precious "Sakura Obi" his mother gave him. One day a beautiful, kimono-clad girl named Kiriha appeared before him. Kiriha naturally began to live with Kazuya in his room. Then there''s Chisato, Kazuya''s childhood friend with glasses and a ponytail, who meddles in his affairs. Soon there''s also an overprotective older sister who seems to want to take baths with him. Jumble in a huge-chested priestess, a good-looking sorceress named Kokuyoura, beautiful women, and hot girls, and Kazuya''s happy, embarrassing, confusing life begins…', 'Kazuya Kagami never goes anywhere without the precious "Sakura Obi" his mother gave him. One day a beautiful, kimono-clad girl named Kiriha appeared before him. Kiriha naturally began to live with Kazuya in his room. Then there''s Chisato, Kazuya''s childhood friend with glasses and a ponytail, who meddles in his affairs. Soon there''s also an overprotective older sister who seems to want to take baths with him. Jumble in a huge-chested priestess, a good-looking sorceress named Kokuyoura, beautiful women, and hot girls, and Kazuya''s happy, embarrassing, confusing life begins…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQLw9RZvzYTUukElg11bHIFNoQg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71000'),
  ('810224557178297789', 'Tsukigakirei', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Konomi Kohara', 'TV-PG', 'Kotarou Azumi and Akane Mizuno became third year students at junior high school and are classmates for the first time. These two, along with fellow classmates, Chinatsu Nishio and Takumi Hira, relate to their peers through mutual understandings and feelings. As their final year at junior high school progresses, the group overcome their challenges to mature and become aware of changes in themselves.', 'Kotarou Azumi and Akane Mizuno became third year students at junior high school and are classmates for the first time. These two, along with fellow classmates, Chinatsu Nishio and Takumi Hira, relate to their peers through mutual understandings and feelings. As their final year at junior high school progresses, the group overcome their challenges to mature and become aware of changes in themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knYBIZnFBxLpA3ctLQJsnBad63Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70880'),
  ('29701985951252196', 'TSUKIMICHI -Moonlit Fantasy-', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Ayane Sakura, Akari Kito, Saori Hayami, Yukiyo Fujii', 'TV-14', 'Makoto Misumi is just an ordinary high school student living a regular life, but all of a sudden gets summoned to the other world to become a "hero." The goddess of the other world, however, insults him for being different and strips his "hero" title, before casting him off to the wilderness at the edge of the world. As he wanders the wilderness, Makoto encounters dragons, spiders, orcs, dwarves, and all sorts of non-human tribes. Because Makoto comes from a different world, he is able to unleash unimaginable magical powers and combat skills. But just how will he handle his encounters with various species and survive in his new environment. In this fantasy, Makoto tries to transform the other world into a better place despite the humans and gods having turned their backs on him.', 'Makoto Misumi is just an ordinary high school student living a regular life, but all of a sudden gets summoned to the other world to become a "hero." The goddess of the other world, however, insults him for being different and strips his "hero" title, before casting him off to the wilderness at the edge of the world. As he wanders the wilderness, Makoto encounters dragons, spiders, orcs, dwarves, and all sorts of non-human tribes. Because Makoto comes from a different world, he is able to unleash unimaginable magical powers and combat skills. But just how will he handle his encounters with various species and survive in his new environment. In this fantasy, Makoto tries to transform the other world into a better place despite the humans and gods having turned their backs on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XQ2dMEARAdUZQscnIJFPI54q3r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111819'),
  ('563892420800501852', 'TsumaSho', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Daisuke Hirakawa, Aoi Yuuki, Maiko Nomura, Sachiko Kojima, Mutsuki Iwanaka', null, 'Keisuke Niijima has lived in grief since his wife, Takae, passed away 10 years ago. But when a young girl visits, claiming to be Takae reincarnated, Keisuke and his daughter, Mai, are drawn into a miraculous reunion. As the girl reveals intimate details only they could know, the Niijima family slowly begins to heal, rediscovering love and warmth in the most unexpected way.', 'Keisuke Niijima has lived in grief since his wife, Takae, passed away 10 years ago. But when a young girl visits, claiming to be Takae reincarnated, Keisuke and his daughter, Mai, are drawn into a miraculous reunion. As the girl reveals intimate details only they could know, the Niijima family slowly begins to heal, rediscovering love and warmth in the most unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWXFAo8ua0T5fSVQNNU31g7cx2c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257603'),
  ('379559682231079819', 'Tsunami: Race Against Time', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'The definitive story of the deadly 2004 tsunami as it travels from country to country, with unseen archive video and untold stories of survival.', 'The definitive story of the deadly 2004 tsunami as it travels from country to country, with unseen archive video and untold stories of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtq5L6sPglEKzBIThbsyVKs5Zvf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274921'),
  ('89475562534241387', 'Tsunami: The Aftermath', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Abi Morgan', 'Tim Roth, Toni Collette, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Sophie Okonedo, Hugh Bonneville, Gina McKee, Samrit Machielsen, Will Yun Lee', null, 'Tsunami: The Aftermath is a television mini-series that was broadcast in two parts in 2006. It dramatizes the events following the 2004 Indian Ocean earthquake and the resulting tsunami in Thailand. Tsunami: The Aftermath is a joint production of HBO and the BBC and stars Tim Roth, Toni Collette, Sophie Okonedo, Samrit Machielsen, Chiwetel Ejiofor, and Savannah Loney. It was filmed in Phuket and Khao Lak, Thailand from April to June 2006. Phuket and Khao Lak were two of the worst hit areas in the country in the December 26, 2004 disaster.', 'Tsunami: The Aftermath is a television mini-series that was broadcast in two parts in 2006. It dramatizes the events following the 2004 Indian Ocean earthquake and the resulting tsunami in Thailand. Tsunami: The Aftermath is a joint production of HBO and the BBC and stars Tim Roth, Toni Collette, Sophie Okonedo, Samrit Machielsen, Chiwetel Ejiofor, and Savannah Loney. It was filmed in Phuket and Khao Lak, Thailand from April to June 2006. Phuket and Khao Lak were two of the worst hit areas in the country in the December 26, 2004 disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXrnDhkCah3J9g2AWD8lQGotI6A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13238'),
  ('834407098011614879', 'Tsuredure Children', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A series depicting various scenarios of young love. These stories range from a boy, crippled by his absolute lack of confidence in himself, cannot even accept the fact that the girl of his dreams actually asked him out on a date, to the near-psychotic girl that pours her own blood into her homemade chocolate in order to win his heart.', 'A series depicting various scenarios of young love. These stories range from a boy, crippled by his absolute lack of confidence in himself, cannot even accept the fact that the girl of his dreams actually asked him out on a date, to the near-psychotic girl that pours her own blood into her homemade chocolate in order to win his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8waP7tAJuejMSk3lUyn5yevD1Pz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72509'),
  ('515819494472214539', 'Tsuritama', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ogura, Ryota Osaka, Miyu Irino, Koki Uchiyama, Tomokazu Sugita, Fumi Hirano, Emiri Kato, Daisuke Hosomi', null, 'Yuki Sanada has always felt like a fish out of water. Socially awkward and anxious, he struggles to fit in with his surroundings and moves from town to town with his grandma. As he and his grandma settle into the charming seaside town of Enoshima, Yuki hopes for a fresh start. However, his reputation at school is jeopardized by the arrival of fellow transfer student Haru. The eccentric Haru immediately makes a splash, wildly claiming to be an alien and declaring that Yuki is his friend. Pairing the reluctant Yuki with their classmate and fishing talent, Natsuki Usami, he tasks both of them with the absurd mission of saving the world from a mysterious threat in the ocean. Mischief and hijinks ensue, as these three embark on a whimsical adventure filled with laughs, heart, and self-discovery!', 'Yuki Sanada has always felt like a fish out of water. Socially awkward and anxious, he struggles to fit in with his surroundings and moves from town to town with his grandma. As he and his grandma settle into the charming seaside town of Enoshima, Yuki hopes for a fresh start. However, his reputation at school is jeopardized by the arrival of fellow transfer student Haru. The eccentric Haru immediately makes a splash, wildly claiming to be an alien and declaring that Yuki is his friend. Pairing the reluctant Yuki with their classmate and fishing talent, Natsuki Usami, he tasks both of them with the absurd mission of saving the world from a mysterious threat in the ocean. Mischief and hijinks ensue, as these three embark on a whimsical adventure filled with laughs, heart, and self-discovery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8ygIUurefq12xnnBEEUozFSUyy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45283'),
  ('5741493264476895', 'Tsurune', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Kensho Ono, Shogo Yano, Kaito Ishikawa, Jun Fukuyama, Takayuki Kondo, Yuya Hirose, Yuuichirou Umehara', 'TV-14', 'After target panic drives him from archery in middle school, Minato decides to return to the sport when his friends join the high school kyudo club.', 'After target panic drives him from archery in middle school, Minato decides to return to the sport when his friends join the high school kyudo club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9hGhB8UpGOUVXlcn2oyE7kCYS8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83314'),
  ('124151559660594340', 'Tsuyokiss', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Nana Inoue, Saki Fujita, Yu Kobayashi, Mai Nakahara', null, 'Sunao Konoe is very lively high school student who dreams of becoming a professional actress. After changing schools, she wants to establish a drama club in order to follow the path of acting, but she is constantly denied by the student council president.', 'Sunao Konoe is very lively high school student who dreams of becoming a professional actress. After changing schools, she wants to establish a drama club in order to follow the path of acting, but she is constantly denied by the student council president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3bksFhLU451v5m3AZ3PGPQ42RJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36803'),
