  ('742123683340094314', 'TURN: Washington''s Spies', 2014, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Craig Silverstein', null, 'Jamie Bell, Seth Numrich, Heather Lind, Meegan Warner, Burn Gorman, Samuel Roukin, Daniel Henshall, Kevin McNally', 'TV-14', 'The story of New York farmer, Abe Woodhull, who bands together with a group of childhood friends to form The Culper Ring, an unlikely group of spies who turn the tide in America’s fight for independence.', 'The story of New York farmer, Abe Woodhull, who bands together with a group of childhood friends to form The Culper Ring, an unlikely group of spies who turn the tide in America’s fight for independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AehTUycX0VSvCkOOkZzurLnjHsS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:57276'),
  ('761661366610639916', 'Turner & Hooch', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Matt Nix', null, 'Josh Peck, Lyndsy Fonseca, Carra Patterson, Vanessa Lengies, Anthony Ruivivar, Brandon Jay McLaren, Jeremy Maguire', 'TV-PG', 'A Deputy Marshal inherits an unruly dog who helps him solve crimes and investigate a family mystery.', 'A Deputy Marshal inherits an unruly dog who helps him solve crimes and investigate a family mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7de7nCLy3NNQuuf6JfnDGoRtCw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114503'),
  ('794287630764805418', 'Turning Point: 9/11 and the War on Terror', 2021, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Modern history can be divided into two time frames: before 9/11 and after 9/11. This five-part docuseries is a cohesive chronicle of the September 11, 2001 attacks on the U.S., offering illuminating perspectives and personal stories of how the catastrophic events of that day changed the course of the nation.', 'Modern history can be divided into two time frames: before 9/11 and after 9/11. This five-part docuseries is a cohesive chronicle of the September 11, 2001 attacks on the U.S., offering illuminating perspectives and personal stories of how the catastrophic events of that day changed the course of the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWHyzSVVVlKcd6KIuZCMIvD5TPZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131651'),
  ('799746718506796393', 'Turning Point: The Bomb and the Cold War', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'With firsthand accounts and access to prominent figures around the world, this comprehensive docuseries explores the Cold War and its aftermath.', 'With firsthand accounts and access to prominent figures around the world, this comprehensive docuseries explores the Cold War and its aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XBYN5Sb0yBvvodwr8fJa7iyuo2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245926'),
  ('253908408395951039', 'Turning Point: The Vietnam War', 2025, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, null, null, 'This thought-provoking documentary series examines the harrowing consequences of the Vietnam War, from the Gulf of Tonkin incident to the fall of Saigon.', 'This thought-provoking documentary series examines the harrowing consequences of the Vietnam War, from the Gulf of Tonkin incident to the fall of Saigon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwyhia2REWLVv3UmY9Cc5N7Gtfx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286788'),
  ('172476735924929782', 'Tusenbröder', 2002, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jakob Eklund, Ola Rapace, Shanti Roney, Anja Lundqvist, Bisse Unger, Marika Lindström', null, 'Tusenbröder is a drama TV-series on Swedish Television in three seasons, from 2002, 2003 and 2006. The third installment of the series first opened on the big screen, March 10, 2006, edited together as one film, before later being shown on TV as a longer series.', 'Tusenbröder is a drama TV-series on Swedish Television in three seasons, from 2002, 2003 and 2006. The third installment of the series first opened on the big screen, March 10, 2006, edited together as one film, before later being shown on TV as a longer series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mhLbZd5ist456U1kcmEajzuPVb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9638'),
  ('768116673585823763', 'Tut', 2015, 'Drama', 'Peter Paige, Michael Vickerman, Bradley Bredeweg', null, 'Ben Kingsley, Avan Jogia, Nonso Anozie, Sibylla Deen, Alexander Siddig, Kylie Bunbury, Peter Gadiot, Iddo Goldberg', 'TV-14', 'The story of the Egyptian Pharaoh, one of the most renowned leaders in human history. This ambitious special-event series tells the story of Tut’s rise to power and his struggle to lead Egypt to glory, while his closest advisers, friends and lovers scheme for their own nefarious interests. “Tut” opens up a fascinating window into a world filled with heart-breaking romance, epic battles, political backstabbing, conspiracy, jealousy, and even murder — proving his world was not far removed from our own — and that his reign as the youngest Egyptian king played out as a real-life drama for the ages.', 'The story of the Egyptian Pharaoh, one of the most renowned leaders in human history. This ambitious special-event series tells the story of Tut’s rise to power and his struggle to lead Egypt to glory, while his closest advisers, friends and lovers scheme for their own nefarious interests. “Tut” opens up a fascinating window into a world filled with heart-breaking romance, epic battles, political backstabbing, conspiracy, jealousy, and even murder — proving his world was not far removed from our own — and that his reign as the youngest Egyptian king played out as a real-life drama for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoKHf67aYDUOkZkS9tVOEgDzjMa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62977'),
  ('1148437164221259027', 'Tut''s Treasures: Hidden Secrets', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Michael Douglas', null, 'Mark Bazeley', null, 'Howard Carter’s discovery of Tutankhamun’s tomb in 1922 made headlines across the world sparking a global frenzy for Ancient Egypt. But over the decades since the find, many of the pharaoh’s priceless grave goods have disappeared into museum basements and archives across Egypt. Now all 5,398 objects are being reunited for the first time since their discovery at the new Grand Egyptian Museum. Many have never been seen before but together they shed new light on the short, eventful life of the so-called ‘Boy King’ and are now helping experts realize the sheer scale of Tutankhamun’s influence in the ancient world.', 'Howard Carter’s discovery of Tutankhamun’s tomb in 1922 made headlines across the world sparking a global frenzy for Ancient Egypt. But over the decades since the find, many of the pharaoh’s priceless grave goods have disappeared into museum basements and archives across Egypt. Now all 5,398 objects are being reunited for the first time since their discovery at the new Grand Egyptian Museum. Many have never been seen before but together they shed new light on the short, eventful life of the so-called ‘Boy King’ and are now helping experts realize the sheer scale of Tutankhamun’s influence in the ancient world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xijdOpd8WaNeSDGk2RqxOCf2WIG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80225'),
  ('91300418045249212', 'Tutankhamun', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Guy Burt', 'Max Irons, Amy Wren, Sam Neill, Catherine Steadman, Jonathan Aris', 'TV-PG', 'The remarkable story of the chance meeting that transformed penniless, ostracised archaeologist Howard Carter into a household name following his discovery of the tomb of the boy-king, Tutankhamun.', 'The remarkable story of the chance meeting that transformed penniless, ostracised archaeologist Howard Carter into a household name following his discovery of the tomb of the boy-king, Tutankhamun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2LyymMB8Pf6migjFgPd4aR5b4f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68178'),
  ('540851399613018420', 'Tutenstein', 2003, 'Animation, Kids', 'Jay Stephens', 'Brooks Wachtel, Mark Seidenberg', 'Crystal Scales, Lex Lang, Jeannie Elias, Maryke Hendrikse, David Lodge', null, 'Tut-ankh-en-set-amun, a 3,000-year-old Egyptian mummy on display at a museum, is revived in the present day by a bolt of lightning. You''d think someone who''s been dead for three millenniums would be a bit more humble after returning to life, but once an egotistical boy king, always an egotistical boy king. Now a confused blend of zombie pharaoh and Frankenstein''s monster, this reanimated ruler adapts to his modern-day surroundings with the help of young friend Cleo and her talking cat, Luxor.', 'Tut-ankh-en-set-amun, a 3,000-year-old Egyptian mummy on display at a museum, is revived in the present day by a bolt of lightning. You''d think someone who''s been dead for three millenniums would be a bit more humble after returning to life, but once an egotistical boy king, always an egotistical boy king. Now a confused blend of zombie pharaoh and Frankenstein''s monster, this reanimated ruler adapts to his modern-day surroundings with the help of young friend Cleo and her talking cat, Luxor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64mxPXRRQEMnPNJB9VdbbVLATdc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1886'),
