  ('322467012403688447', 'Tutti pazzi per amore', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ivan Cotroneo', null, 'Emilio Solfrizzi, Antónia Lišková, Nicole Murgia, Carlotta Natoli, Brenno Placido, Marina Rocco, Luca Angeletti, Francesca Inaudi', null, 'Paolo Giorgi and Laura Del Fiore, coincidentally approaching their forties, find themselves sharing the ups and downs of life with growing children, extended families, and a hilarious love story.', 'Paolo Giorgi and Laura Del Fiore, coincidentally approaching their forties, find themselves sharing the ups and downs of life with growing children, extended families, and a hilarious love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BAQ1czruleqR8g0cZxP5qEJcSE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:41446'),
