  ('169068925985487651', 'Tuu Juliet Jatt Di', 2025, 'Drama, Soap', 'Sargun Mehta, Ravi Dubey', null, 'Jasmeet Kaur, Syed Raza Ahmed, Sangita Ghosh, Digvijay Purohit, Ayush Sharma, Aanchal Khurana, Abhishek Sharma, Alisha Parveen', null, 'The star of the story—Heer—is an ambitious Kudi! Poles apart, Nawab is a rich, spoiled Munda. Destiny brings them together in a love saga inked by betrayals.', 'The star of the story—Heer—is an ambitious Kudi! Poles apart, Nawab is a rich, spoiled Munda. Destiny brings them together in a love saga inked by betrayals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oy23uz9J5o9hIkZGqMhySajy9Jt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306555'),
