  ('851637653637254913', 'Tweeny Witches', 2004, 'Animation', null, 'Sunao Katabuchi', 'Sachiko Kojima, Houko Kuwashima, Ryo Hirohashi', 'TV-PG', 'Arusu believes in magic and it''s power to do good in the world. Unfortunately for her, her fellow witches disagree, and use their powers for all sorts of neat tricks, like turning little sprites into their slaves. Realizing that this nightmare is a reality, Arusu sets out to change the ways of the witches, and gets up to some hilarious hijinks along the way.', 'Arusu believes in magic and it''s power to do good in the world. Unfortunately for her, her fellow witches disagree, and use their powers for all sorts of neat tricks, like turning little sprites into their slaves. Realizing that this nightmare is a reality, Arusu sets out to change the ways of the witches, and gets up to some hilarious hijinks along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xucSukaEKp33wgODgHtWX8oal9f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37803'),
  ('549334555209444459', 'Twelve', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Kim Bong-han', null, 'Don Lee, Park Hyung-sik, Seo In-guk, Lee Ju-bin, Ko Kyu-pil, Kang Mi-na, Sung Yoo-bin, Ahn Ji-hye', 'TV-14', 'A group of heroes, each embodying one of the 12 zodiac signs, battles to defend the Korean Peninsula from malevolent spirits.', 'A group of heroes, each embodying one of the 12 zodiac signs, battles to defend the Korean Peninsula from malevolent spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6q66Psq2cDrCsoz8cGDVa6gFmMm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274875'),
  ('1063644993527126779', 'Twelve Forever', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Julia Vickerman', null, 'Jaylen Barron, Spencer Rothbell, Kelsy Abbott, Wade Randolph, Antony Del Rio, Matt Berry', 'TV-Y7', 'Reggie''s dream is to be a kid forever. Her dream is so powerful that it creates its own fantasy world of perpetual youth.', 'Reggie''s dream is to be a kid forever. Her dream is so powerful that it creates its own fantasy world of perpetual youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJocMECVkXeBw0gRyjE5FEeiAmT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91656'),
  ('470404803138888645', 'Twelve Letters', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Zhou Yiran, Wang Yinglu', null, 'In a small town, twelve mysterious letters and a 35-year wait intertwine to shape the lives and loves of a close-knit group of friends. Yu Nian and Shen Cheng’s world is thrown into turmoil when their parents vanish, followed by cryptic messages arriving from another time. Driven to uncover the truth, they plunge into a complex puzzle, navigating dual timelines and unraveling the secrets hidden within the letters that could explain their disappearance.', 'In a small town, twelve mysterious letters and a 35-year wait intertwine to shape the lives and loves of a close-knit group of friends. Yu Nian and Shen Cheng’s world is thrown into turmoil when their parents vanish, followed by cryptic messages arriving from another time. Driven to uncover the truth, they plunge into a complex puzzle, navigating dual timelines and unraveling the secrets hidden within the letters that could explain their disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNpoDw5rap6dpZBSKGDgv0NAtXn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263292'),
  ('580512725440905522', 'Twelve Warrior Explosive Eto Rangers', 1995, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kyoko Hikami', null, 'Twelve Warrior Explosive Eto Rangers is a 1995 Japanese anime television series. The Eto Rangers are based on the twelve animals of the Chinese zodiac.', 'Twelve Warrior Explosive Eto Rangers is a 1995 Japanese anime television series. The Eto Rangers are based on the twelve animals of the Chinese zodiac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7weJ2s2NSGBlzYOA2OYis7Krina.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9570'),
  ('471481288982775395', 'Twenties', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Hattie, a queer African American woman, hangs out with her two straight best friends Mari and Nia, in Los Angeles as they try to figure out life, love and the professional world.', 'Hattie, a queer African American woman, hangs out with her two straight best friends Mari and Nia, in Los Angeles as they try to figure out life, love and the professional world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OdmKUouR6xCTfoDrqFNqKyiWQP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100002'),
  ('265291645423041129', 'Twenty Again', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'So Hyun Kyung', 'So Hyun Kyung', 'Choi Ji-woo, Ha Seung-lee, Lee Sang-yun, Kim Hee-chan, Choi Won-young, Kim Min-jae, Son Na-eun, Park Hyo-ju', 'TV-14', 'Due to an unplanned pregnancy, Ha No Ra married young and dropped out of school. But after two decades as a housewife, she finally gets the chance to experience college, alongside her 20-year-old son Kim Min Soo and his girlfriend Oh Hye Mi. Further complicating things, No Ra already has a strained student-teacher relationship, as her husband Kim Woo Chul and her first love Cha Hyun Suk wind up being her professors.', 'Due to an unplanned pregnancy, Ha No Ra married young and dropped out of school. But after two decades as a housewife, she finally gets the chance to experience college, alongside her 20-year-old son Kim Min Soo and his girlfriend Oh Hye Mi. Further complicating things, No Ra already has a strained student-teacher relationship, as her husband Kim Woo Chul and her first love Cha Hyun Suk wind up being her professors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adpq2WHlPuGTwSU1jx5RnwI4cb7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63529'),
  ('715289501170656806', 'Twenty Five Twenty One', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jung Jee-hyun, Kwon Do-eun', null, 'Kim Tae-ri, Nam Joo-hyuk, Bona, Choi Hyun-wook, Lee Ju-myoung, Kim Hye-eun, Choi Myeong-bin, Joo Bo-young', 'TV-14', 'In a time when dreams seem out of reach, a teen fencer pursues big ambitions and meets a hardworking young man who seeks to rebuild his life.', 'In a time when dreams seem out of reach, a teen fencer pursues big ambitions and meets a hardworking young man who seeks to rebuild his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCQFnmYhYf7XALMka2EoBRAFmPO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129888'),
  ('929599498106454234', 'Twenty Twelve', 2011, 'Comedy', 'John Morton', 'John Morton', 'Hugh Bonneville, Olivia Colman, Jessica Hynes, Amelia Bullmore, Karl Theobald, Vincent Franklin, Morven Christie, Samuel Barnett', 'TV-14', 'A mock-documentary following the challenges - both personal and professional - faced by the team responsible for delivering the biggest show on Earth: the 2012 Olympics. From getting a busload of non-English speaking Brazilians from A to B, who to appoint to run the Cultural Olympiad and what to do when the much-vaunted wind turbines won''t turn because there''s no wind, it''s all in a day''s work for the men and women whose job it is to stage the greatest sporting event in the world.', 'A mock-documentary following the challenges - both personal and professional - faced by the team responsible for delivering the biggest show on Earth: the 2012 Olympics. From getting a busload of non-English speaking Brazilians from A to B, who to appoint to run the Cultural Olympiad and what to do when the much-vaunted wind turbines won''t turn because there''s no wind, it''s all in a day''s work for the men and women whose job it is to stage the greatest sporting event in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5O9uEXosgtvNmZyOYYh0DCdiHGY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38210'),
  ('442998816217013075', 'Twenty Twenty Six', 2026, 'Comedy', 'John Morton', 'John Morton', 'David Tennant, Hugh Bonneville, Hugh Skinner, Paulo Costanzo, Henry Ian Cusick, Nick Blood, Chelsey Crisp, Stephen Kunken', null, '48 countries, three host nations - what can possibly go wrong? Former BBC head of values Ian Fletcher is saving the World Cup. So that''s all good then. Starring Hugh Bonneville.', '48 countries, three host nations - what can possibly go wrong? Former BBC head of values Ian Fletcher is saving the World Cup. So that''s all good then. Starring Hugh Bonneville.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOMHB1sHMf4ASjB909y7AQFuX3q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317556'),
  ('928250744528100699', 'Twenty Your Life On', 2020, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Guan Xiaotong, Bu Guanjin, Dong Siyi, Xu Mengjie, Fei Qiming, Li Junxian, Xie Binbin, Zhou Yiran', null, 'Four university students—Jiang Xiaoguo, Duan Jiabao, Luo Yan, and Liang Shuang—navigate the challenges and complexities of life after high school as they transition into adulthood.', 'Four university students—Jiang Xiaoguo, Duan Jiabao, Luo Yan, and Liang Shuang—navigate the challenges and complexities of life after high school as they transition into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QQwxTuV7koWGyMbf4dOOUAzAEx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:137680'),
  ('596615836181731217', 'Twenty-Twenty', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Seong So-eun', 'Han Sung-min, Kim Woo-seok, Park Sang-nam, Chae Won-been, Jin Ho-eun, Lee Seung-il, Bae Hae-seon, Kang Yu-chan', null, 'Set me free. Many say twenty years old is the beginning of the new chapter, but not for Da Hee. She was still under her mom''s guidance. Da Hee, 20 years old, starts to become defiant. She wants to live as herself, not the daughter of her mom. Just a more step to cross the boundary. Da Hee who just became an adult tries to make her first step further.', 'Set me free. Many say twenty years old is the beginning of the new chapter, but not for Da Hee. She was still under her mom''s guidance. Da Hee, 20 years old, starts to become defiant. She wants to live as herself, not the daughter of her mom. Just a more step to cross the boundary. Da Hee who just became an adult tries to make her first step further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iX4K96n5oRLK6q27fXzU3qn7Wu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107393'),
  ('949978721106657157', 'Twice in a Lifetime', 1999, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Family, Documentary', 'Steve Sohmer', null, 'Al Waxman, Paul Popowich', 'TV-PG', 'Prematurely deceased people are given the opportunity to correct something that went wrong in their lives and thus change them for the better.', 'Prematurely deceased people are given the opportunity to correct something that went wrong in their lives and thus change them for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Idn583Aa0knxM5P4SWqellWNUb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10000'),
  ('498600977415078998', 'Twice Upon a Time', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Nathalie Leuthreau, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Nathalie Leuthreau, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Gaspard Ulliel, Freya Mavor, Patrick d''Assumçao, Claire Sermonne, Richard Dillane, Éva Ionesco, Julianne Binard, Émile Berling', 'TV-MA', 'Months after a crushing breakup, a man receives a mysterious package that opens a portal to the past -- and gives him a chance to win back his ex.', 'Months after a crushing breakup, a man receives a mysterious package that opens a portal to the past -- and gives him a chance to win back his ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rACSv2uaTHT9Szr3Ci5nLbTpp9t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92647'),
  ('705983486204501866', 'Twilight', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Ren Jialun, AngelaBaby, Sun Jiayu, Jing Chao, Li Junyi, Li Yiru, Ren Bin, Jia Jinghui', null, 'Writer Qi Lianshan wants to adapt his psychological reasoning novel into a script. After seeing Liu Xia, who successfully guide a woman who wants to jump off a bridge with her psychological knowledge, he invites her to be a consultant . In the process of adapting the novel, Qi Lianshan gets deeply attracted by Liu Xia, and in the end, the two gained a successful career and a beautiful love story.', 'Writer Qi Lianshan wants to adapt his psychological reasoning novel into a script. After seeing Liu Xia, who successfully guide a woman who wants to jump off a bridge with her psychological knowledge, he invites her to be a consultant . In the process of adapting the novel, Qi Lianshan gets deeply attracted by Liu Xia, and in the end, the two gained a successful career and a beautiful love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4Elcn8Q6ssgmWXyBfh59cG6bLn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197579'),
  ('326247869644558497', 'Twilight of a Nation', 1988, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Siu Sang', null, 'Ray Lui, Barbara Chan, Jimmy Au Shui-Wai, Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Carrie Choi, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Sheren Tang Shui-Man', null, 'Twilight of a Nation is a Hong Kong television series based on the events of the Taiping Rebellion and the rise and fall of the Taiping Heavenly Kingdom during the late Qing Dynasty. The 45 episodes long series was produced by Siu Sang and was first aired on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in November 1988. It was broadcast again on TVB in 1996. The theme songs and insert songs in the series were performed by Roman Tam.', 'Twilight of a Nation is a Hong Kong television series based on the events of the Taiping Rebellion and the rise and fall of the Taiping Heavenly Kingdom during the late Qing Dynasty. The 45 episodes long series was produced by Siu Sang and was first aired on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in November 1988. It was broadcast again on TVB in 1996. The theme songs and insert songs in the series were performed by Roman Tam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8M1qPm88T8tcQSSYouEGUj5mZI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32302'),
  ('6831454123001153', 'Twilight of the Gods', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jay Oliva, Eric Carrasco, Zack Snyder', null, 'Sylvia Hoeks, Stuart Martin, Pilou Asbæk, Peter Stormare, Kristofer Hivju, Paterson Joseph, Rahul Kohli, Jamie Clayton', 'TV-MA', 'Zack Snyder unleashes a bold and bloody vision of Norse mythology in this adult animated series about a warrior with an ax to grind against the gods.', 'Zack Snyder unleashes a bold and bloody vision of Norse mythology in this adult animated series about a warrior with an ax to grind against the gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0rqWDT1oYGcNIuLydZD4J4JpwK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97333'),
  ('787987876466350514', 'Twilight Out of Focus', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yuma Uchida, Soma Saito, Makoto Furukawa, Takuya Eguchi, Masatomo Nakazawa', 'TV-MA', 'Three poignant love stories unfold in a boys'' school film club as its members butt heads and navigate friendship, sexuality and boundaries.', 'Three poignant love stories unfold in a boys'' school film club as its members butt heads and navigate friendship, sexuality and boundaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk1YIuggnboOBXql6dpffAUBYFq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249409'),
  ('437661051657165846', 'TWIN', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kristoffer Metcalfe', null, 'Kristofer Hivju, Mathilde Holtedahl Cuhra, Sigrid Erdal, Vebjørn Enger, Torstein Bjørklund, Ellen Birgitte Winther, Rebekka Nystabakk, Kingsford Siayor', 'TV-14', 'When a young mother is responsible for the accidental death of her husband, she persuades the dead husband''s identical twin to take his identity.', 'When a young mother is responsible for the accidental death of her husband, she persuades the dead husband''s identical twin to take his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUM9P2GEdd9M7cJD9RFDaKA0fDQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94495'),
  ('503848981764769472', 'Twin Angel Break', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mao Ichimichi, Ai Kayano, Rie Kugimiya, Ayaka Suwa, Yukiyo Fujii, Shizuka Itoh, Minami Takahashi, Asuka Nishi', null, 'Amatsuki Meguru is a girl who innocently aspires to be a hero of justice and the cool Kisaragi Sumire who grew up in the strict Kisaragi household... The two girls who are in their 3rd year of middle school end up getting orders from a mysterious hedgehog named Miruku-chan and turn into Twin Angels in order to fight evil! Meguru is always cheerful but sometimes a bit too forceful. Meanwhile, Sumire isn’t accustomed with being around others. Despite their differences, as they work together, they start opening up to each other.', 'Amatsuki Meguru is a girl who innocently aspires to be a hero of justice and the cool Kisaragi Sumire who grew up in the strict Kisaragi household... The two girls who are in their 3rd year of middle school end up getting orders from a mysterious hedgehog named Miruku-chan and turn into Twin Angels in order to fight evil! Meguru is always cheerful but sometimes a bit too forceful. Meanwhile, Sumire isn’t accustomed with being around others. Despite their differences, as they work together, they start opening up to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df1hhC7He2N5cnP2hRN0RzWn9Il.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71021'),
  ('375267208416891350', 'Twin of Brothers', 2011, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Athena Chu Yan, Kong Lin, You Yongzhi, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Andrew Wu, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Zheng Haoyuan, Gao Hu', null, 'Kau Jong and Tzi Ling are both orphans. One day, when they are going to get martial arts lessons from the well known Sek Long, they find themselves stuck in the middle of a fight... a woman and their furture martial arts teacher!!', 'Kau Jong and Tzi Ling are both orphans. One day, when they are going to get martial arts lessons from the well known Sek Long, they find themselves stuck in the middle of a fight... a woman and their furture martial arts teacher!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNkNrpshZlrbpYbr5oT2pDvG0R2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85279'),
  ('304323920544378195', 'Twin Peaks', 1990, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mark Frost, David Lynch', null, 'Kyle MacLachlan', 'TV-MA', 'The body of Laura Palmer is washed up on a beach near the small Washington state town of Twin Peaks. FBI Special Agent Dale Cooper is called in to investigate her strange demise only to uncover a web of mystery that ultimately leads him deep into the heart of the surrounding woodland and his very own soul.', 'The body of Laura Palmer is washed up on a beach near the small Washington state town of Twin Peaks. FBI Special Agent Dale Cooper is called in to investigate her strange demise only to uncover a web of mystery that ultimately leads him deep into the heart of the surrounding woodland and his very own soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA9CNSdo50iQPZ8A2fyVpMvJZAf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1920'),
  ('28327709439484057', 'Twin Princess of Wonder Planet', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'In the hollow Mysterious Planet, seven kingdoms co-exist, all of them lit by the Sun''s Blessing from the Kingdom of the Sun, in the middle of the planet. The light of the core sun is necessary for the continued existence of all the kingdoms. Yet, something is causing the Sun''s Blessing to weaken. If something isn''t done, it will be the end of life on the Mysterious Planet. Fortunately, the twin princesses of the Sun Kingdom, Fine and Rein, have been endowed with the magic of the Prominence and are looking for a way to fix things.', 'In the hollow Mysterious Planet, seven kingdoms co-exist, all of them lit by the Sun''s Blessing from the Kingdom of the Sun, in the middle of the planet. The light of the core sun is necessary for the continued existence of all the kingdoms. Yet, something is causing the Sun''s Blessing to weaken. If something isn''t done, it will be the end of life on the Mysterious Planet. Fortunately, the twin princesses of the Sun Kingdom, Fine and Rein, have been endowed with the magic of the Prominence and are looking for a way to fix things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Q0Jo5gJzPpaBinjWP2cBDGie1P.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21236'),
  ('929190446206955999', 'Twin Star Exorcists', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Megumi Han, Junichi Suwabe, Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa, Kohsuke Toriumi, Masaya Takatsuka, Misako Tomioka', 'TV-14', 'Rokuro is from a family of exorcists, but he''d rather be a singer, a soccer player or anything but an exorcist! He''s forced to own up to his own incredible potential when new arrival Benio stirs his competitive spirit. But their rivalry gets a twist when they earn the prestigious title of "Twin Star Exorcists"—two supreme fighters fated to marry and birth the ultimate spiritual warrior!', 'Rokuro is from a family of exorcists, but he''d rather be a singer, a soccer player or anything but an exorcist! He''s forced to own up to his own incredible potential when new arrival Benio stirs his competitive spirit. But their rivalry gets a twist when they earn the prestigious title of "Twin Star Exorcists"—two supreme fighters fated to marry and birth the ultimate spiritual warrior!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbGtsHEuV8zREyMEXmf5YFtUZyL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66078'),
  ('620308571845581236', 'Twinkle Love', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'A reality show where 10 youths in their early 20s that recently graduated university will go on a graduation trip together. They have different personalities and different backgrounds but with time spent with each other, they form friendships and relationships.', 'A reality show where 10 youths in their early 20s that recently graduated university will go on a graduation trip together. They have different personalities and different backgrounds but with time spent with each other, they form friendships and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCtD0KAa5rRNMnvB4KvLYD4ntRk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:206122'),
  ('1002751555676836884', 'Twinkling Watermelon', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jin Soo-wan, Son Jeong-hyeon', 'Jin Soo-wan', 'Ryeoun, Choi Hyun-wook, Seol In-a, Shin Eun-soo, Choi Won-young, Seo Young-hee, Jung Sang-hoon, Cheon Ho-jin', 'TV-14', 'A CODA (child of deaf adult) student born with a gift for music crash lands at an unfamiliar place after time traveling through a suspicious music shop. There, he forms the band Watermelon Sugar with other mysterious youths.', 'A CODA (child of deaf adult) student born with a gift for music crash lands at an unfamiliar place after time traveling through a suspicious music shop. There, he forms the band Watermelon Sugar with other mysterious youths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwTzW1wTgUxUOQruhT8DvinUYgR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212204'),
  ('1026487525455596763', 'Twins', 2005, 'Comedy', 'David Kohan, Max Mutchnick', null, 'Sara Gilbert, Molly Stanton, Mark Linn-Baker, Melanie Griffith', null, 'Twin sisters—one a driven entrepreneur, the other a glamorous model—inherit their family’s lingerie brand and must juggle rivalry, humor, and heart.', 'Twin sisters—one a driven entrepreneur, the other a glamorous model—inherit their family’s lingerie brand and must juggle rivalry, humor, and heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/563vvBkI2iurkRF47K9iXJacsmt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3018'),
  ('469248635708855960', 'Twirlywoos', 2015, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'The four Twirlywoos - Great Big Hoo, Toodle-oo, Chickadee and Chick - have adventures both in the real world, and in their boat. They learn about a new concept each episode. Shy Peekaboo also lives on the boat, and joins in without the Twirlywoos knowing. The boat sometimes gets visitors, including the Stop Go Car and the Very Important Lady.', 'The four Twirlywoos - Great Big Hoo, Toodle-oo, Chickadee and Chick - have adventures both in the real world, and in their boat. They learn about a new concept each episode. Shy Peekaboo also lives on the boat, and joins in without the Twirlywoos knowing. The boat sometimes gets visitors, including the Stop Go Car and the Very Important Lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EvAI0QPzMqpDPpvgjOsNytILfu.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:81240'),
  ('247098496528146393', 'TWIST', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Bianca Hauda, Romy Straßenburg', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KBxrI7eG89Ned7gWDkAi2c0bff.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245611'),
  ('43087221854336702', 'Twist of Fate', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Serdar Gözelekli', null, 'Aytaç Şaşmaz, Cemre Baysel, İdris Nebi Taşkan, Aslı Sümen, Hande Subaşı, Funda İlhan, Tuğba Çom, Anıl Çelik', 'TV-G', 'Ada is a young girl who believes that if she is abandoned by her first love, she will be unhappy forever like the women of her maternal side. While trying to escape the fate of her family, Ada falls in love with Rüzgar, a student from Albania at the same university who is threatened with deportation. Believing that Rüzgar is her first love, Ada proposes him and they have a fake marriage to prevent his deportation. She believes that Rüzgar will literally propose to her on the 3rd anniversary of their fake marriage and then their real marriage adventure will finally begin. But unfortunately, all the dreams and hopes of Ada will be ruined when she is abandoned by Rüzgar on their 3rd wedding anniversary. Ada immediately takes action to get her first love back. But fate has its own way and will put Bora in Ada''s way at an unexpected moment... A workaholic, callous, self-righteous alpha male with tightly closed doors for love...', 'Ada is a young girl who believes that if she is abandoned by her first love, she will be unhappy forever like the women of her maternal side. While trying to escape the fate of her family, Ada falls in love with Rüzgar, a student from Albania at the same university who is threatened with deportation. Believing that Rüzgar is her first love, Ada proposes him and they have a fake marriage to prevent his deportation. She believes that Rüzgar will literally propose to her on the 3rd anniversary of their fake marriage and then their real marriage adventure will finally begin. But unfortunately, all the dreams and hopes of Ada will be ruined when she is abandoned by Rüzgar on their 3rd wedding anniversary. Ada immediately takes action to get her first love back. But fate has its own way and will put Bora in Ada''s way at an unexpected moment... A workaholic, callous, self-righteous alpha male with tightly closed doors for love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qBdshcYgdgLZmO3AVbNtMKqbSf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125527'),
  ('183197069198359437', 'Twisted', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Maddie Hasson, Avan Jogia, Kylie Bunbury, Kimberly Quinn, Sam Robards, Denise Richards, Ashton Moio', 'TV-14', 'A one-hour mystery full of twists and turns that follows Danny Desai, a charismatic 16-year-old with a troubled past who returns to his hometown after spending five years in juvenile detention. Immediately branded an outcast, Danny attempts to reconnect with his two childhood best friends, Jo and Lacey. But when a fellow student is found dead in her home, Danny instantly becomes the prime suspect and town spirals into a frenzy of suspicion and mystery. Jo and Lacey must decide if their childhood friend is unforgivable, or if he''s really a victim being persecuted for his own twisted secrets.', 'A one-hour mystery full of twists and turns that follows Danny Desai, a charismatic 16-year-old with a troubled past who returns to his hometown after spending five years in juvenile detention. Immediately branded an outcast, Danny attempts to reconnect with his two childhood best friends, Jo and Lacey. But when a fellow student is found dead in her home, Danny instantly becomes the prime suspect and town spirals into a frenzy of suspicion and mystery. Jo and Lacey must decide if their childhood friend is unforgivable, or if he''s really a victim being persecuted for his own twisted secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMhccRNcOR4bDxxoWsnDZzjf7PB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46661'),
  ('691950567922437500', 'Twisted Metal', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick, Michael Jonathan Smith', null, 'Anthony Mackie, Stephanie Beatriz, Nuufolau Joel Seanoa, Will Arnett, Anthony Carrigan', 'TV-MA', 'A motor-mouthed outsider with no memory of his past is offered a chance at a better life, but only if he can successfully deliver a mysterious package across a post-apocalyptic wasteland. With the help of a badass axe-wielding car thief, he’ll face savage marauders driving vehicles of destruction and other dangers of the open road, including a deranged clown who drives an all too familiar ice cream truck.', 'A motor-mouthed outsider with no memory of his past is offered a chance at a better life, but only if he can successfully deliver a mysterious package across a post-apocalyptic wasteland. With the help of a badass axe-wielding car thief, he’ll face savage marauders driving vehicles of destruction and other dangers of the open road, including a deranged clown who drives an all too familiar ice cream truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMwMClR9y7RBeVWMEmNn8LwUJHz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:133748'),
  ('397280852373177588', 'Two and a Half Men', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Lee Aronsohn, Chuck Lorre', null, 'Ashton Kutcher, Jon Cryer, Conchata Ferrell', 'TV-14', 'A hedonistic jingle writer''s free-wheeling life comes to an abrupt halt when his brother and 10-year-old nephew move into his beach-front house.', 'A hedonistic jingle writer''s free-wheeling life comes to an abrupt halt when his brother and 10-year-old nephew move into his beach-front house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgfjxyV3g1S68opzuvG6G87muDp.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2691'),
  ('1099258494394335703', 'Two Broke Girls', 2019, 'Comedy', null, 'Vladimir Porubaev, Roman Ivanov, Artur Dilanyan', 'Olga Kartunkova, Alevtina Tukan, Vladimir Sychev, Natalya Bochkareva, Arman Navasardyan, Viktor Bychkov, Nikita Dyuvbanov, Gosha Kutsenko', null, 'It would seem, what is common between provincial Olga and the daughter of billionaire Margot? They both want to make a lot of money! Olya - coming simpleton, who barely makes ends meet. Margot is a girl from high society who suddenly lost her status and status. Ironically, she is forced to work as a waitress in a cafe where Olya works. Together, girls start thinking about their lucrative business. Moreover, almost all for this they have. Everything except money. But you can''t open a tip for yourself ...', 'It would seem, what is common between provincial Olga and the daughter of billionaire Margot? They both want to make a lot of money! Olya - coming simpleton, who barely makes ends meet. Margot is a girl from high society who suddenly lost her status and status. Ironically, she is forced to work as a waitress in a cafe where Olya works. Together, girls start thinking about their lucrative business. Moreover, almost all for this they have. Everything except money. But you can''t open a tip for yourself ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWFqOzI61zf8zP7bEgWxpgzJjR6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87955'),
  ('849611099074669133', 'Two Cops', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Lim Hwa-min', 'Byun Sang-soon', 'Cho Jung-seok, Lee Hye-ri, Kim Seon-ho, Lee Ho-won, Lee Si-eon, Moon Ji-in, Jung Hae-kyun, Choi Il-hwa', null, 'Cha Dong-Tak is a detective in pursuit of justice. A swindler''s spirit takes possession of his body. The detective and swindler''s spirit cooperate to solve cases. The detective falls in love with a reporter.', 'Cha Dong-Tak is a detective in pursuit of justice. A swindler''s spirit takes possession of his body. The detective and swindler''s spirit cooperate to solve cases. The detective falls in love with a reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOxQhCu8tSXDhbfkTlny3dgLjnA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74785'),
  ('463564366752647559', 'Two Doors Down', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Simon Carlyle, Gregor Sharp', null, 'Alex Norton, Jamie Quinn, Jonathan Watson, Elaine C. Smith, Arabella Weir, Kieran Hodgson', null, 'Comedy centred around a couple and their insufferable neighbours.', 'Comedy centred around a couple and their insufferable neighbours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dc8uRpR7YlnFXeS3INd00jmP7F.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:66119'),
  ('160915177085912939', 'Two Graves', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Agustín Martínez', null, 'Álvaro Morte, Hovik Keuchkerian, Kiti Mánver, Zoé Arnao, Nonna Cardoner', 'TV-MA', 'When the disappearance of two teen girls shocks a quiet coastal town, a bereft grandmother risks everything to uncover the truth and seek revenge.', 'When the disappearance of two teen girls shocks a quiet coastal town, a bereft grandmother risks everything to uncover the truth and seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnERtXWzPaTRZfa0iEtvygiOrPP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280888'),
  ('744417277998447315', 'Two Guys and a Girl', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Danny Jacobson', null, 'Traylor Howard, Ryan Reynolds, Richard Ruccolo, Suzanne Cryer, Nathan Fillion, Jillian Bach', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to Beacon Street Pizza, the perfect workplace and hangout for aimless wise-guy Berg, neurotic Pete and campus beauty Sharon. Pete and Berg are roommates and students at a local Boston university, while Sharon struggles with her work and relationships. Together, these three best friends try to navigate life and love in Boston!', 'Welcome to Beacon Street Pizza, the perfect workplace and hangout for aimless wise-guy Berg, neurotic Pete and campus beauty Sharon. Pete and Berg are roommates and students at a local Boston university, while Sharon struggles with her work and relationships. Together, these three best friends try to navigate life and love in Boston!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulm7wLxyxDNO8kEe12oTM5efWfb.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:75'),
  ('527480067446541269', 'Two of a Kind', 1998, 'Comedy, Family', 'Robert Griffard, Howard Adler', null, 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Christopher Sieber, Sally Wheeler', 'TV-G', 'Two of a Kind is an American sitcom that aired on ABC as part of the network''s TGIF line-up, starring Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen. The show aired from September 25, 1998 to July 9, 1999. The series was produced by Griffard/Adler Productions, Dualstar Productions, and Miller-Boyett-Warren Productions, in association with Warner Bros. Television. It was the last series to be produced by Miller-Boyett Productions in any of its identities.', 'Two of a Kind is an American sitcom that aired on ABC as part of the network''s TGIF line-up, starring Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen. The show aired from September 25, 1998 to July 9, 1999. The series was produced by Griffard/Adler Productions, Dualstar Productions, and Miller-Boyett-Warren Productions, in association with Warner Bros. Television. It was the last series to be produced by Miller-Boyett Productions in any of its identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwRBIXpNyRICSQTpxs51rHweb4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2141'),
  ('157317763479994574', 'Two Pints of Lager and a Packet of Crisps', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Susan Nickson', null, 'Will Mellor, Natalie Casey, Freddie Hogan, Georgia Henshaw, Luke Gell', null, 'Sitcom about the lives and loves of five twenty-somethings in Runcorn.', 'Sitcom about the lives and loves of five twenty-somethings in Runcorn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fohuobXrEo8l2TdI1oNAl8uLdeT.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:598'),
  ('930715586287036867', 'Two Sentence Horror Stories', 2019, 'Mystery', 'Vera Miao', null, null, 'TV-14', 'An anthology series featuring updated tales of horror and haunting for the digital age, inspired by the viral fan fiction of two sentence horror stories.', 'An anthology series featuring updated tales of horror and haunting for the digital age, inspired by the viral fan fiction of two sentence horror stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO6L4j8TzsCGQrl6oiAgehk4aqI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90961'),
  ('553945524068314', 'Two Sides of the Abyss', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kristin Derfler', null, 'Anne Ratte-Polle, Anton Dreger, Lea van Acken, Senita Huskić, Dirk Martens, Renato Schuch, Ann-Kathrin Kramer, Claudia Eisinger', 'TV-MA', 'Police officer Luise Berg heads for an inevitable catastrophe after her daughter’s murderer is released early from prison. A psychologically complex game of confusion begins in which the boundaries of guilt and innocence, perpetrators and victims, law and justice are constantly blurred.', 'Police officer Luise Berg heads for an inevitable catastrophe after her daughter’s murderer is released early from prison. A psychologically complex game of confusion begins in which the boundaries of guilt and innocence, perpetrators and victims, law and justice are constantly blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idewc0QLPpR8UNUm4MLqXUfFAiL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225217'),
  ('759753945285864956', 'Two Strangers', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandros Rigas, Dimitris Apostolou', 'Alexandros Rigas, Dimitris Apostolou', 'Nikos Sergianopoulos, Dina Consta, Dimitris Tsoutsis, Evelina Papoulia, Chrysoula Diavati, Odysseas Stamoulis, Alexandra Paleologou, Ava Galanopoulou', null, 'Konstadinos Markoras is a director who owns a high profile drama school. Marina Kountouratou is a beautiful woman who hosts a silly television show. Seeking to improve her image, Marina decides to go for studies at Konstadino''s school, so that people will stop thinking she''s a dumb blonde. Konstadinos doesn''t welcome the crazy girl at his school and soon tension begins to raise between them.', 'Konstadinos Markoras is a director who owns a high profile drama school. Marina Kountouratou is a beautiful woman who hosts a silly television show. Seeking to improve her image, Marina decides to go for studies at Konstadino''s school, so that people will stop thinking she''s a dumb blonde. Konstadinos doesn''t welcome the crazy girl at his school and soon tension begins to raise between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njTRh9jseIZG3KsbtsaAp10HRKG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:53452'),
  ('615827717665108857', 'Two Summers', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Paul Baeten Gronda, Tom Lenaerts', 'Paul Baeten Gronda, Tom Lenaerts', 'An Miller, Marieke Anthoni, Tom Vermeir, Lukas Bulteel, Herwig Ilegems, Bjarne Devolder, Inge Paulussen, Louise Bergez', 'TV-PG', 'A group of friends get together thirty years after one of the group members died in a tragic accident while they were on holiday. What was supposed to be a relaxing vacation changes rapidly into a nightmare, when some of the friends are blackmailed with footage from that terrible week three decades ago.', 'A group of friends get together thirty years after one of the group members died in a tragic accident while they were on holiday. What was supposed to be a relaxing vacation changes rapidly into a nightmare, when some of the friends are blackmailed with footage from that terrible week three decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xzkqEdrKuXn0rTYAe88CFWOWo4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133979'),
  ('260197409221134461', 'Two Weeks', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'So Hyun Kyung', 'Lee Joon-gi, Park Ha-seon, Ryu Soo-young, Kim So-yeon, Lee Chae-mi, Jo Min-ki, Lim Se-mi, Jeong In-gi', null, 'Jang Tae San is a man who has been living a meaningless life and never thinks toward his future. He is on the run after being falsely accused of murder. Furthermore, he discovers that he has a daughter who is now suffering from leukemia. The drama spans exactly two weeks, and tells about Tae San''s desperate struggles to save his daughter.', 'Jang Tae San is a man who has been living a meaningless life and never thinks toward his future. He is on the run after being falsely accused of murder. Furthermore, he discovers that he has a daughter who is now suffering from leukemia. The drama spans exactly two weeks, and tells about Tae San''s desperate struggles to save his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvKGO5ZCgBbekQB4z2lXzhyTXqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53095'),
  ('1008548984082645697', 'Two Weeks to Live', 2020, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Gaby Hull', null, 'Maisie Williams, Mawaan Rizwan, Sian Clifford, Taheen Modak', null, 'When strange young misfit Kim Noakes was just a little girl, her father died in murky circumstances and her mother Tina whisked her away to a remote rural life of seclusion and bizarre survival techniques. Now all grown up, Kim sets out into the real world for the first time to begin a secret mission of honouring her father’s memory.', 'When strange young misfit Kim Noakes was just a little girl, her father died in murky circumstances and her mother Tina whisked her away to a remote rural life of seclusion and bizarre survival techniques. Now all grown up, Kim sets out into the real world for the first time to begin a secret mission of honouring her father’s memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOhQYHbHVo03elgWA4mTW5bzNAg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91445'),
  ('755079865800483807', 'Two Women, One Road', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, 'Erik Estrada, Laura León, Bibi Gaytán, Enrique Rocha, Luz María Jerez, Elizabeth Dupeyrón, Claudio Báez, Itatí Cantoral', null, 'Dos mujeres, un camino is a Mexican telenovela, produced by Televisa, which originally aired from August 2, 1993 to July 1, 1994, on Canal de las Estrellas.', 'Dos mujeres, un camino is a Mexican telenovela, produced by Televisa, which originally aired from August 2, 1993 to July 1, 1994, on Canal de las Estrellas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDWuYnHRr36xUW2gsDA4X4kwcJ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12970'),
  ('418829121845561507', 'Two Worlds', 2024, 'Drama', 'Prang', null, 'Kornthas Rujeerattanavorapan, Natasit Uareksit, Thapanawat Kaewbumrung, Varayu Pusomjitsakul, Mon Taechin Phaisanwan, Pik Supawit Vichitrananda', null, 'Kram, grieving Phupha''s loss, crosses into a parallel world to save Phupha, but unexpected feelings for Tai complicate his mission in this tale of love and fate.', 'Kram, grieving Phupha''s loss, crosses into a parallel world to save Phupha, but unexpected feelings for Tai complicate his mission in this tale of love and fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4M2AnTTYXaEvAoeqPRiw31T68LE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224843'),
  ('598505374219074547', 'Two Years Vacation', 1974, 'Action & Adventure, Family', 'Gilles Grangier', null, 'Marc Di Napoli, Franz Seidenschwan, Werner Pochath, Rainer Basedow, Angela Chiuaru', null, 'The story of a group of young New Zealand school boys. Because one of them is the nephew of a ship captain, they win the opportunity to go on a sailing trip. Some pirates (Forbes and Pike) are looking for a boat so they can go and find treasure on a deserted island. They manage to be recruited as crew members on that same boat as the school boys. After a mutiny, the pirates take over the boat and take the young boys as hostages. Helped by O''Brian, the young kids manage to escape from the pirates with the boat. After a storm, they have to land on a deserted island. They have learn to live together in harmony if they want their community to survive, despite the rivalry within the group. But is this island really a deserted one? And can they really get away from the pirates?', 'The story of a group of young New Zealand school boys. Because one of them is the nephew of a ship captain, they win the opportunity to go on a sailing trip. Some pirates (Forbes and Pike) are looking for a boat so they can go and find treasure on a deserted island. They manage to be recruited as crew members on that same boat as the school boys. After a mutiny, the pirates take over the boat and take the young boys as hostages. Helped by O''Brian, the young kids manage to escape from the pirates with the boat. After a storm, they have to land on a deserted island. They have learn to live together in harmony if they want their community to survive, despite the rivalry within the group. But is this island really a deserted one? And can they really get away from the pirates?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYmdYvwjKphPPLHRAPcfkDwBKNa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70702'),
  ('802975987497241344', 'Tying the Knot with an Amagami Sister', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Sumire Uesaka, Kaede Hondo, Shion Wakayama', 'TV-14', 'Uryu Kamihate is a high school student hoping to enroll in Kyoto University’s medical school. After being taken in by the chief priest at Amagami Shrine, he is told he must marry one of three maiden sisters—Yae, Yuna, or Asahi—to live at, and one day inherit, the Amagami Shrine. Kamihate will need to sweep one of the maidens off her feet in this story of romance, friendship, and fun.', 'Uryu Kamihate is a high school student hoping to enroll in Kyoto University’s medical school. After being taken in by the chief priest at Amagami Shrine, he is told he must marry one of three maiden sisters—Yae, Yuna, or Asahi—to live at, and one day inherit, the Amagami Shrine. Kamihate will need to sweep one of the maidens off her feet in this story of romance, friendship, and fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/werwTXBFyhlhBqDkGQzUaDolHt9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234910'),
  ('1019966049109143700', 'Tyler Perry''s Assisted Living', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'J. Anthony Brown, Na''im Lynn, David Mann, Courtney Nichole, Tamela Mann', 'TV-PG', 'After losing his job, Jeremy, a patriarch of a young family with teenage children, decides to move to the backwoods of Georgia to help his crazy grandfather. Grandpa Vinny has foolishly purchased a terribly run-down home for the elderly and he is in way over his head, but comedy ensues as Mr. Brown and Cora show up at the right time as needy investors.', 'After losing his job, Jeremy, a patriarch of a young family with teenage children, decides to move to the backwoods of Georgia to help his crazy grandfather. Grandpa Vinny has foolishly purchased a terribly run-down home for the elderly and he is in way over his head, but comedy ensues as Mr. Brown and Cora show up at the right time as needy investors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4Sw20fSr9rLV8ei2efU9Sn2Xqm.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:108544'),
  ('733084104018144548', 'Tyler Perry''s Bruh', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'Barry Brewer, Mahdi Cocci, Phillip Mullings Jr., Monti Washington, Alyssa Goss, Candice Renee, Chandra Currelley-Young, Shawn Vaughn', 'TV-MA', 'This dramedy follows four longtime friends as they navigate life and relationships through the strength of their brother-like bond. In a society where relationships between men of color are often misjudged and misrepresented, the series embraces male vulnerability versus hypermasculinity.', 'This dramedy follows four longtime friends as they navigate life and relationships through the strength of their brother-like bond. In a society where relationships between men of color are often misjudged and misrepresented, the series embraces male vulnerability versus hypermasculinity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awXwj4A63l9PoSlbj9scpEPuAaM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:103135'),
  ('154072834728442511', 'Tyler Perry''s Divorced Sistas', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'LeToya Luckett, Khadeen Indréa, Porscha Coleman, Briana Price, Jennifer Sears, RonReaco Lee, Donovan Christie Jr., Robert Christopher Riley', null, 'Five friends - Rasheda, Geneva, Naomi, Tiffany, and Bridgette - support each other through divorce, marriage, dating, healing, and friendship struggles while their loyalty and sisterhood bonds are tested.', 'Five friends - Rasheda, Geneva, Naomi, Tiffany, and Bridgette - support each other through divorce, marriage, dating, healing, and friendship struggles while their loyalty and sisterhood bonds are tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRvxRFx4INJNqgmpMbijQTWwUWX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292462'),
  ('630461835236400360', 'Tyler Perry''s For Better or Worse', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'Tasha Smith, Michael Jai White, Crystle Stewart, Jason Olive, Kiki Haynes, Kent Faulcon, Cocoa Brown, Brad James', 'TV-14', 'Follow the ups-and-downs of Angela Williams, the owner of a successful beauty salon, and her husband of 13 years, Marcus, a former professional football player who has recently partnered with Richard Ellington and Joseph Jetson on a new sports news program called "C-Sports Now."', 'Follow the ups-and-downs of Angela Williams, the owner of a successful beauty salon, and her husband of 13 years, Marcus, a former professional football player who has recently partnered with Richard Ellington and Joseph Jetson on a new sports news program called "C-Sports Now."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qal0vTHLsZfPKlSrmOX56sYKGUV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:42032'),
  ('651824596029737010', 'Tyler Perry''s House of Payne', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'LaVan Davis, Cassi Davis, Allen Payne, Doc Shaw, Lance Gross, Keshia Knight Pulliam', 'TV-PG', 'A multigenerational, working-class family experience life''s struggles with faith, love and, most importantly, humor. Curtis, aka ''Pops'', the uncle and head of the household, has house and home turned upside down when an unexpected event forces his nephew, CJ, and CJ’s kids to move in, putting three generations under one roof. This chaotic living situation takes its toll on cranky Pops, who is reluctant to have his routine disturbed. In addition to CJ’s family, Pops and Ella’s son, Calvin, a wise-cracking, broke college student, hangs out at home, making it impossible for any peace and quiet. It soon becomes evident just how wide the gap is, as the family tries to find a way to coexist through all of life’s hilarious ups and downs.', 'A multigenerational, working-class family experience life''s struggles with faith, love and, most importantly, humor. Curtis, aka ''Pops'', the uncle and head of the household, has house and home turned upside down when an unexpected event forces his nephew, CJ, and CJ’s kids to move in, putting three generations under one roof. This chaotic living situation takes its toll on cranky Pops, who is reluctant to have his routine disturbed. In addition to CJ’s family, Pops and Ella’s son, Calvin, a wise-cracking, broke college student, hangs out at home, making it impossible for any peace and quiet. It soon becomes evident just how wide the gap is, as the family tries to find a way to coexist through all of life’s hilarious ups and downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NdUdJnZnwI6skvm6OXWrK2D42U.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:3690'),
  ('69883891438662832', 'Tyler Perry''s If Loving You Is Wrong', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'April Parker Jones, Aidan Turner, Charles Malik Whitfield, Amanda Clayton, Edwina Findley, Eltony Williams, Heather Hemmens, Joel Rush', 'TV-14', 'Follow the relationships of a group of husbands and wives that live and love on the same street. While the neighbors come from very different backgrounds, their lives are similar – raising children, dealing with exes, worrying about money and keeping romance in their relationships. But just below the surface — secrets, lies and deception threaten to destroy what they have built.', 'Follow the relationships of a group of husbands and wives that live and love on the same street. While the neighbors come from very different backgrounds, their lives are similar – raising children, dealing with exes, worrying about money and keeping romance in their relationships. But just below the surface — secrets, lies and deception threaten to destroy what they have built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzYQGEYYvZyeuSWMHbQvhvOh8lc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62251'),
  ('468108975838367918', 'Tyler Perry''s Meet the Browns', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'K Callan, Lamman Rucker, Denise Boutte, Tamela Mann, LaVan Davis, David Mann, Juanita Jennings, Terri J. Vaughn', 'TV-PG', 'In this spinoff from "Tyler Perry''s House of Payne," Downtown Leroy Brown tries to fulfill his father''s dying wish by transforming a dilapidated house into a retirement home: Brown Meadows, which happens to be located next door to a rowdy fraternity house. Helping Leroy keep the facility''s quirky residents in line are his daughter, Cora; his nephew, Will, a doctor, and Will''s wife, Sasha, a nurse; social worker Carmen Martinez; and Jesus Hernandez, a maintenance engineer who is studying to be a lawyer.', 'In this spinoff from "Tyler Perry''s House of Payne," Downtown Leroy Brown tries to fulfill his father''s dying wish by transforming a dilapidated house into a retirement home: Brown Meadows, which happens to be located next door to a rowdy fraternity house. Helping Leroy keep the facility''s quirky residents in line are his daughter, Cora; his nephew, Will, a doctor, and Will''s wife, Sasha, a nurse; social worker Carmen Martinez; and Jesus Hernandez, a maintenance engineer who is studying to be a lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yS1NOS5o4G2eGOqsjgF91Tv3ZTK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:7771'),
  ('645577432310843322', 'Tyler Perry''s Ruthless', 2020, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'Melissa L. Williams, Matt Cedeño, Lenny Thomas, Yvonne Senat Jones, Baadja-Lyne Odums, Blue Kimble, Colin McCalla, Stevie Baggs Jr.', 'TV-MA', 'A spinoff of "The Oval," follows Ruth Truesdale as she''s forced to play nice with a scandalous religious cult of powerful sex crazed fanatics in the hopes of freeing herself and her daughter.', 'A spinoff of "The Oval," follows Ruth Truesdale as she''s forced to play nice with a scandalous religious cult of powerful sex crazed fanatics in the hopes of freeing herself and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYgAnS5tMXMtckAjaj2xemzol4m.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:100575'),
  ('864748375010674145', 'Tyler Perry''s Sistas', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry', null, 'KJ Smith, Mignon Von, Ebony Obsidian, Novi Brown, Crystal Hayslett, Devale Ellis, Chido Nwokocha, Kevin A. Walton', 'TV-14', 'There''s nothing that bonds a group of single black women together more than sidestepping the land mines of living, working and dating in Atlanta. In a sea of swipe-lefts, social media drama and unrealistic #relationshipgoals, these friends try to find their Mr. Right.', 'There''s nothing that bonds a group of single black women together more than sidestepping the land mines of living, working and dating in Atlanta. In a sea of swipe-lefts, social media drama and unrealistic #relationshipgoals, these friends try to find their Mr. Right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UtwdSXDkDMvqAdMJsbB8JLlBEH.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:94686'),
