  ('845434027500390211', 'Übel Blatt', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuya Hirose, Hina Tachibana, Toshiki Masuda, Hitomi Ueda, Yui Kanari, Kenichirou Matsuda, Kohsuke Toriumi, Ryota Suzuki', 'TV-14', 'Fourteen warriors set out to prevent an invasion, but only seven return. Three died along the way, and four were slain for betraying the empire. In truth, it is the Seven Heroes who turned on their allies so they could take all the glory. Ascheriit was their victim, but now, 20 years later, he is back to get revenge.', 'Fourteen warriors set out to prevent an invasion, but only seven return. Three died along the way, and four were slain for betraying the empire. In truth, it is the Seven Heroes who turned on their allies so they could take all the glory. Ascheriit was their victim, but now, 20 years later, he is back to get revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LuObyUIr1YlqbcwmypJT4tO6Bv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247367'),
  ('27980086364193235', 'Ubice mog oca', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Predrag Antonijević, Nataša Drakulić, Marko Miskovic', null, 'Vuk Kostić, Marko Janketić, Katarina Radivojević, Nina Janković, Tihomir Stanić', null, 'The action series begins when the main character, a young police inspector Aleksandar Jakovljevic, despite its problematic behavior, receives an important case - killed the daughter of a prominent man unit whose company is building the largest residential - commercial complex in the region. The investigation goes in that direction, or even torn Aleksandar their problems, nothing leaves the case and digging into every aspect of life of the murdered girl, unaware of the danger which is exposed because someone cares about is to cover up the killing as quickly as possible.', 'The action series begins when the main character, a young police inspector Aleksandar Jakovljevic, despite its problematic behavior, receives an important case - killed the daughter of a prominent man unit whose company is building the largest residential - commercial complex in the region. The investigation goes in that direction, or even torn Aleksandar their problems, nothing leaves the case and digging into every aspect of life of the murdered girl, unaware of the danger which is exposed because someone cares about is to cover up the killing as quickly as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJKjdu0MuUUctLUGPqZtzbCYaWn.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:68518'),
  ('847962760316402016', 'Uchuu Sentai Kyuranger', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Takumi Kizu, Yosuke Kishi, Kazuya Nakai, Yasuhiro Takeuchi, Yuki Ono, Masaru Ōbayashi, Akio Otsuka, Jiro Okamoto', null, 'All across the universe, the Jark Matter empire has conquered everything they see. Meanwhile, the insurgent force called "Rebellion" is established and gathers nine ultimate saviors from across the galaxy who are chosen by the Kyu Globes, magical spheres with the power of the constellations.', 'All across the universe, the Jark Matter empire has conquered everything they see. Meanwhile, the insurgent force called "Rebellion" is established and gathers nine ultimate saviors from across the galaxy who are chosen by the Kyu Globes, magical spheres with the power of the constellations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmoLp8sOSckHKTnWtV9L5WfnLae.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103386'),
  ('1076680762353492691', 'UFO', 1970, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gerry Anderson, Sylvia Anderson', null, 'Ed Bishop', 'TV-14', 'A secret, high-technology international agency called SHADO defends Earth from alien invaders.', 'A secret, high-technology international agency called SHADO defends Earth from alien invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJMF2BlJ3M7rXRQQpv91WInBtXO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2560'),
  ('851378296889962313', 'UFO', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'John Greenewald Jr., Leslie Kean', 'TV-14', 'Ignited by a bombshell story revealing the Pentagon had been tracking UFOs for years, the series examines the history of the phenomenon through cultural and political touchpoints, including testimony from eyewitnesses across the country.', 'Ignited by a bombshell story revealing the Pentagon had been tracking UFOs for years, the series examines the history of the phenomenon through cultural and political touchpoints, including testimony from eyewitnesses across the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCGqIRUdZ4mVrzeB2B6vKSumZDM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127642'),
  ('904645478943212632', 'UFO Files', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Kristen Akers Gozdecki', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'UFO Files is an American television series that was produced from 2004 to 2007 for The History Channel. The program covers the phenomena of unidentified flying and submerged objects, close encounters with alleged extraterrestrial life, and alleged military and government cover-up conspiracies. In 2008, a following series called UFO Hunters premiered on the same channel.', 'UFO Files is an American television series that was produced from 2004 to 2007 for The History Channel. The program covers the phenomena of unidentified flying and submerged objects, close encounters with alleged extraterrestrial life, and alleged military and government cover-up conspiracies. In 2008, a following series called UFO Hunters premiered on the same channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UVDGnEDPn4Tmr5CivrtD13oz8E.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4208'),
  ('403079514683675441', 'UFO Hunters', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'UFO Hunters is an American television series that premiered on January 30, 2008 on The History Channel, produced by Motion Picture Production Inc., and ran for three seasons. Jon Alon Walz was the Executive Producer of the show and was responsible for selling the series to History Channel after a bidding war for the rights to the show broke out between History Channel and Sci-Fi Channel. The concept for the show was tested in a segment of History Channel''s 2006 UFO special entitled "Deep Sea UFOs", produced by Motion Picture Production Inc, which featured two of the final four cast members. "UFO Hunters" was not a spin-off from a 2005 History Channel special with the same title. The tagline of the show is: Hoax or History? The series should not be confused with a similarly themed and titled UFO Hunters, a special that debuted the same day and time on the Sci-Fi Channel, and created by the producers of Ghost Hunters, but which only aired one episode. In the US, History Channel only released the first two seasons on DVD in the correct airdate order. However, the format was only released in full screen instead of wide screen. In the UK, History Channel released the third and final season on DVD however, the episodes were released in the incorrect airdate order.', 'UFO Hunters is an American television series that premiered on January 30, 2008 on The History Channel, produced by Motion Picture Production Inc., and ran for three seasons. Jon Alon Walz was the Executive Producer of the show and was responsible for selling the series to History Channel after a bidding war for the rights to the show broke out between History Channel and Sci-Fi Channel. The concept for the show was tested in a segment of History Channel''s 2006 UFO special entitled "Deep Sea UFOs", produced by Motion Picture Production Inc, which featured two of the final four cast members. "UFO Hunters" was not a spin-off from a 2005 History Channel special with the same title. The tagline of the show is: Hoax or History? The series should not be confused with a similarly themed and titled UFO Hunters, a special that debuted the same day and time on the Sci-Fi Channel, and created by the producers of Ghost Hunters, but which only aired one episode. In the US, History Channel only released the first two seasons on DVD in the correct airdate order. However, the format was only released in full screen instead of wide screen. In the UK, History Channel released the third and final season on DVD however, the episodes were released in the incorrect airdate order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E8GPTWAiZN0eKOeJkE4iLWQAFi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17655'),
  ('944182348872136053', 'UFO Robot Grendizer', 1975, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Go Nagai', 'Shozo Uehara, Mitsuru Majima, Keisuke Fujikawa', 'Kei Tomiyama, Hiroya Ishimaru, Joji Yanami, Chiyoko Kawashima, Kosei Tomita, Kazuko Sawada, Rihoko Yoshida, Banjo Ginga', 'TV-G', 'The story revolves around Duke Fleed who is a survivor of the Vega Star, raised by Dr. Umon as his adoptive son, and known as Daisuke Umon on Earth. Years after his arrival, he''s faced with the threat of King Vega and his army, who want to conquer the Earth. With his friends Koji and Hikaru (and later his kid sister Maria Grace), Duke decides to fight back using his best weapon, the almighty Grendizer.', 'The story revolves around Duke Fleed who is a survivor of the Vega Star, raised by Dr. Umon as his adoptive son, and known as Daisuke Umon on Earth. Years after his arrival, he''s faced with the threat of King Vega and his army, who want to conquer the Earth. With his friends Koji and Hikaru (and later his kid sister Maria Grace), Duke decides to fight back using his best weapon, the almighty Grendizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4ymZQgSjhJppwm38D8OFjY2mGb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46252'),
  ('778231188229036875', 'UFO Ultramaiden Valkyrie', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hisayo Mochizuki, Megumi Ogata, Kenichi Suzumura, Chinami Nishimura, Rie Tanaka, Saeko Chiba, Haruko Momoi, Omi Minami', null, 'UFO Ultramaiden Valkyrie, aka UFO Princess Valkyrie, is an anime series that follows the story of Kazuto Tokino and the alien Princess, Valkyrie, who gives half her soul to Kazuto to save him after accidentally crashing her spaceship into Kazuto''s family owned public bathhouse and nearly killing him. The splitting up of her soul turned her into a child, but whenever she kisses Kazuto, Valkyrie returns to her adult form for a limited time, and regains the use of her special powers.', 'UFO Ultramaiden Valkyrie, aka UFO Princess Valkyrie, is an anime series that follows the story of Kazuto Tokino and the alien Princess, Valkyrie, who gives half her soul to Kazuto to save him after accidentally crashing her spaceship into Kazuto''s family owned public bathhouse and nearly killing him. The splitting up of her soul turned her into a child, but whenever she kisses Kazuto, Valkyrie returns to her adult form for a limited time, and regains the use of her special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91h2MznT4jToCx8XXsMp6NZ7Zt1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:34149'),
  ('921491574392886635', 'UFO Witness', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ben Hansen', null, 'Ben Hansen is on a mission to uncover the truth behind UFO sightings across America. With unprecedented access to the archives of famed ufologist Dr. J. Allen Hynek, Ben unlocks the secrets of the past to shed light on today''s UFO encounters.', 'Ben Hansen is on a mission to uncover the truth behind UFO sightings across America. With unprecedented access to the archives of famed ufologist Dr. J. Allen Hynek, Ben unlocks the secrets of the past to shed light on today''s UFO encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5n1XhVQjQLZQ2EVtZlwJarDAJCR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:116504'),
  ('550785394968037995', 'UFOs', 2021, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Clémence Dargent, Martin Douaire, Raphaëlle Richet', null, 'Melvil Poupaud, Daphné Patakia, Michel Vuillermoz, Géraldine Pailhas, Quentin Dolmaire, Laurent Poitrenaux, Capucine Valmary, Nicole Garcia', null, 'As the dreams of Didier Mathure, a brilliant space engineer, literally go up in smoke when his rocket explodes on take-off, he is transferred to head GEPAN, a unit specializing in UFOs. He is tasked with coming up with scientific explanations for the UFO sightings that are currently dominating the headlines. This is a nightmare job for a die-hard rationalist like him, and he is determined to find a way out as soon as he can.', 'As the dreams of Didier Mathure, a brilliant space engineer, literally go up in smoke when his rocket explodes on take-off, he is transferred to head GEPAN, a unit specializing in UFOs. He is tasked with coming up with scientific explanations for the UFO sightings that are currently dominating the headlines. This is a nightmare job for a die-hard rationalist like him, and he is determined to find a way out as soon as he can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvwpLNyKRElnlI4sUaKOBY6Z2d1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:108353'),
  ('131740685990235574', 'UFOs Declassified', 2015, 'Documentary', null, 'John Moores', 'Brad Cartner', null, 'Investigates the mysteries behind declassified top secret government files with stunning details about the world''s most credible UFO sightings and alien encounters. The series pieces together the data on these incidents, and tries to answer the question: what really happened?', 'Investigates the mysteries behind declassified top secret government files with stunning details about the world''s most credible UFO sightings and alien encounters. The series pieces together the data on these incidents, and tries to answer the question: what really happened?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IGCbZkZqwFnO94WnTjNjFhG1rc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65083'),
  ('821069353182457805', 'UFOs: Investigating the Unknown', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The truth behind the U.S. government''s secret Pentagon program on UAPs, Unidentified Aerial Phenomena, otherwise known as UFOs, is exposed.', 'The truth behind the U.S. government''s secret Pentagon program on UAPs, Unidentified Aerial Phenomena, otherwise known as UFOs, is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hjjlePqkcdQkK4VEe7kb4LRFop.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220444'),
  ('993621367590685223', 'UFOs: The Lost Evidence', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Richard Monahan', null, 'Nick Pope, Richard Dolan, Eric Chase, Erica Lukes, Mike Bara', null, 'UFOs: The Lost Evidence examines UFOs that may be inhabiting our oceans, top-secret military base Area 52, pilot and astronaut UFO sighting accounts, and deathbed confessions.', 'UFOs: The Lost Evidence examines UFOs that may be inhabiting our oceans, top-secret military base Area 52, pilot and astronaut UFO sighting accounts, and deathbed confessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRkUsq6qfHIFfU7TY8ZBdX0XSFs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79500'),
  ('918426685615638295', 'Uga-Uga', 2000, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Carlos Lombardi', 'Carlos Lombardi, Margareth Boury, Tiago Santiago', 'Cláudio Heinrich, Lima Duarte, Humberto Martins, Vivianne Pasmanter, Marcello Novaes, Nair Bello, Marcos Pasquim, Danielle Winits', null, 'An orphaned young man raised in the wild by an indigenous shaman is found by his grandfather and returned to his estranged family, where he finds himself as heir to their wealth.', 'An orphaned young man raised in the wild by an indigenous shaman is found by his grandfather and returned to his estranged family, where he finds himself as heir to their wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQPTjWKZnvyz6FpMSCIzlJa8DGT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42679'),
  ('1075959094854908765', 'Ugly', 2026, 'Drama', 'Fırat Parlak', 'Özlem İnci Hekimoğlu, Nil Güleç Ünsal', 'Çağlar Ertuğrul, Derya Pınar Ak, Nur Sürer, Çetin Tekindor, Başak Gümülcinelioğlu, Baran Bölükbaşı, Olgun Toker, Cahit Gök', null, 'The series follows Meryem, who holds onto life with nothing but good intentions, as she reunites with her one true love, Kadir—now a man whose world has been shaped by power, wealth, and ambition.', 'The series follows Meryem, who holds onto life with nothing but good intentions, as she reunites with her one true love, Kadir—now a man whose world has been shaped by power, wealth, and ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrBNLQUzs6KiqL6nTRfVTQdlVgP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315179'),
  ('317079189374205154', 'Ugly Americans', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David M. Stern, Devin Clark', null, 'Matt Oberg, Kurt Metzger, Natasha Leggero, Michael-Leon Wooley, Larry Murphy, Randy Pearlstein', 'TV-14', 'Social worker Mark Lilly helps new citizens—both human and "other"—begin the process of adapting to life in the Big Apple, but his coworkers, demonic bureaucrat Twayne, drunken wizard Leonard Powers, surly law enforcement head Frank Grimes & his girlfriend, Callie, don''t make it easy.', 'Social worker Mark Lilly helps new citizens—both human and "other"—begin the process of adapting to life in the Big Apple, but his coworkers, demonic bureaucrat Twayne, drunken wizard Leonard Powers, surly law enforcement head Frank Grimes & his girlfriend, Callie, don''t make it easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGwH9KWYhU16ZYyNX7mz30M0J1U.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32351'),
  ('1054551958908787883', 'Ugly Betty', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Silvio Horta', null, 'America Ferrera, Eric Mabius, Vanessa Williams, Tony Plana, Ana Ortiz, Judith Light, Becki Newton, Michael Urie', 'TV-PG', 'Wannabe writer Betty Suarez is a plain girl from Queens, who is smart, hardworking and savvy but lacks a fashionable sense of style. When publishing mogul Bradford Meade puts his son Daniel in charge of Mode magazine, he hires Betty to be Daniel''s new assistant -- mostly because he knows that she may be the only woman in Manhattan with whom the younger man won''t sleep.', 'Wannabe writer Betty Suarez is a plain girl from Queens, who is smart, hardworking and savvy but lacks a fashionable sense of style. When publishing mogul Bradford Meade puts his son Daniel in charge of Mode magazine, he hires Betty to be Daniel''s new assistant -- mostly because he knows that she may be the only woman in Manhattan with whom the younger man won''t sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prGylxnFpIWMcvHh9sUC46hmiIC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4626'),
